mth of vanilla, cedarwood, and sandalwood, leaving a lingering, refined amber trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:39:25.829Z"}}'::json),
