velvety rose, complemented by the herbal facets of geranium, the delicacy of jasmine, and the powdery accents of violet. The fragrance concludes with a profound base that unites sensual musk with the woody warmth of sandalwood and cedar. Notes of vanilla and amber provide the trail with softness and persistence, leaving a delicate, captivating finish on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:32:33.739Z"}}'::json),
