warmth of cinnamon, nutmeg, and geranium. The base notes envelop the senses with a deep resonance of oud, amber, musk, sandalwood, vanilla, and patchouli, creating a soft and lingering finish.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:50:20.869Z"}}'::json),
