  (5109, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Poudre Accord EDP - A Symphony of Neroli, Pink Pepper, and Litchi with a Heart of Orange Blossom and Jasmine - Luxury Arab Fragrance for Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/d33d0dfedc0186043325d9b750721b83bcb020911a907cd78b38d37a49d40a09.png', 'Poudre Accord EDP 100ml - A Symphony of Neroli, Pink Pepper, and Litchi with a Heart of Orange Blossom and Jasmine - Luxury Arab Fragrance for Women — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 25.3, '{"gtin":"6292257642797","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Цветочные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/X8MszNmkHD9nuhNF5iAZup.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Нероли · Розовый Перец · Флёрдоранж · Белый Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:24:28.636161+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/d33d0dfedc0186043325d9b750721b83bcb020911a907cd78b38d37a49d40a09.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:22.947826+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/23e8639a4f6878ca211ee24bbacdaef87c2e6932472ce872bcbde45d0c98156f.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:24:38.106078+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:24:38.106078+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"36f4fcb1844447ef91f5692b995d5cec","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Нероли","Розовый Перец","Личи","Бергамот","Мандарин"],"heart":["Флёрдоранж","Жасмин","Роза","Цвет Персика"],"base":["Белый Мускус","Ваниль","Кедр","Амбра","Пудровые Ноты"]},"en":{"top":["Neroli","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Bergamot","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Orange Blossom","Jasmine","Rose","Peach Blossom"],"base":["White Musk","Vanilla","Cedarwood","Amber","Powdery Notes"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:30.157Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Neroli · Pink Pepper · Orange Blossom · White Musk","descriptionRu":"Poudre Accord — это изысканная цветочная композиция, построенная на тонком контрасте между искристой фруктовой свежестью и обволакивающей пудровой мягкостью. Аромат раскрывается динамичным сочетанием цитрусовых нот бергамота и мандарина, дополненных пикантным розовым перцем и экзотической сладостью личи. В сердце композиции расцветает нежный букет, где доминируют флердоранж и жасмин, подчеркнутые бархатистыми акцентами розы и персикового цвета. Это цветочное созвучие плавно перетекает в глубокую базу, создавая изящный шлейф. Завершающий аккорд дарит ощущение чистоты и тепла благодаря соединению белого мускуса, ванили и древесных нот кедра. Пудровые нюансы в сочетании с амброй придают аромату особую чувственность и благородную завершенность.","descriptionEn":"Poudre Accord is an elegant floral composition built upon a delicate contrast between sparkling fruit freshness and enveloping powdery softness. The fragrance opens with a dynamic blend of bergamot and mandarin orange, accented by the piquant bite of pink pepper and the exotic sweetness of litchi. At the heart of the fragrance, a refined bouquet unfolds, dominated by orange blossom and jasmine, further enriched by the velvety nuances of rose and peach blossom. This floral harmony transitions gracefully into a deep, sophisticated base. The final impression leaves a trail of clean warmth, crafted from a blend of white musk, vanilla, and cedarwood. Subtle powdery notes, underscored by the richness of amber, lend the fragrance a distinct sense of intimacy and polished character.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:36:10.470Z"}}'::json),
