чули","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Jasmine","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Cedarwood","Patchouli","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:28.214Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Amir Two — это выразительная восточная композиция, построенная на тонком контрасте между искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким, согревающим древесно-пряным шлейфом. Аромат открывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным пикантной остротой розового перца и прохладным акцентом кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает элегантный букет из лаванды, герани и жасмина, чья цветочная мягкость уравновешивается пряным теплом мускатного ореха. Это сочетание придает аромату особую глубину и объем, постепенно трансформируясь в обволакивающую базу. Финал парфюма раскрывается богатым союзом амбры, мускуса и кедра, подчеркнутым землистыми оттенками пачули и деликатной сладостью ванили. Такое сочетание создает стойкий, насыщенный шлейф, который оставляет благородное и запоминающееся впечатление.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Amir Two is a distinctive oriental composition built upon a refined contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and a deep, warming woody-spicy trail. The fragrance opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the piquant bite of pink pepper and the cool, aromatic edge of cardamom. At the heart, an elegant bouquet of lavender, geranium, and jasmine unfolds, its floral softness balanced by the warm spice of nutmeg. This transition adds depth and dimension to the scent as it slowly moves toward its lingering foundation. The dry down reveals a rich union of amber, musk, and cedarwood, underscored by the earthy nuances of patchouli and a touch of delicate vanilla. This combination results in a persistent, resonant finish that leaves a sophisticated and memorable impression.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:35:24.550Z"}}'::json),
  (5114, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Ajmal Amber Musc Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/c84f4a982abbb7b36d5864fd016d17b54c78a3d8fc8bbb9b0930489774037470.png', 'Ajmal Amber Musc Eau De Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 33.28, '{"gtin":"6293708007486","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Пряные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/NEwcFXzdZwoboLKnjBB2nJ.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Роза · Уд","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:15:51.427473+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/c84f4a982abbb7b36d5864fd016d17b54c78a3d8fc8bbb9b0930489774037470.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:45:44.269396+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/833805051ae01b5a7d4ff5710249cd8501db577756181b258aaec24d876fdebb.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:16:14.753517+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:16:14.753517+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"4LcJiiCsJX","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Кардамон","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Амбра","Мускус"],"base":["Уд","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Белый Мускус","Лабданум"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Cardamom","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Amber","Musk"],"base":["Oud","Sandalwood","Vanilla","White Musk","Labdanum"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:31.354Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Amber Musc — это глубокая пряная композиция, построенная на изысканном контрасте между искристой свежестью цитрусов и обволакивающей теплотой восточных смол. Аромат раскрывается энергичным сочетанием шафрана, бергамота, кардамона и розового перца, создавая яркий и пряный вступительный аккорд. В сердце композиции расцветает классический цветочный дуэт розы и жасмина, который постепенно погружается в чувственные объятия амбры и мускуса. Это сочетание придает аромату особую бархатистость и глубину, сглаживая начальную остроту специй. Завершающий шлейф строится на благородных нотах уда и сандала, дополненных мягкой сладостью ванили. Белый мускус и лабданум закрепляют композицию, оставляя на коже долгое, теплое и обволакивающее послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Amber Musc is a profound spicy composition defined by the elegant contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and the enveloping warmth of oriental resins. The fragrance opens with an energetic blend of saffron, bergamot, cardamom, and pink pepper, establishing a vibrant and spiced initial impression. At the heart, a classic floral duet of rose and jasmine unfolds, gradually sinking into the sensual embrace of amber and musk. This layering imparts a distinct velvety texture and depth to the scent, gracefully softening the sharpness of the opening notes. The base is anchored by noble notes of oud and sandalwood, enriched by the subtle sweetness of vanilla. White musk and labdanum anchor the composition, leaving a long-lasting, warm, and enveloping trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:36:28.221Z"}}'::json),
  (5137, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Evoke Red Her Eau de Parfum - Floral Woody Fragrance', '/assets/img/generated-products/3dbd56e54c28efa49a046cf37794ce7c7bde28e3aea89da0ca18f873e86a995d.png', 'Ajmal Evoke Red Her Eau de Parfum 75ml - Floral Woody Fragrance — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 19.54, '{"gtin":"6293708022106","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Цветочные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/DaAMmtLBpWpsNpUjfzffY4.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Сандаловое Дерево","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:26.744518+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/3dbd56e54c28efa49a046cf37794ce7c7bde28e3aea89da0ca18f873e86a995d.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:31.928676+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/44bf1664882925fd8a0cf143ede17d851536c7ccbe273ceffb37248d79b832f0.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:33.655169+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:33.655169+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"bd3b3b249a7046e69209b2bb47bddcfd","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Чёрная Смородина","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фиалка"],"base":["Сандаловое Дерево","Кедровое Дерево","Мускус","Амбра","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Black Currant","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Violet"],"base":["Sandalwood","Cedarwood","Musk","Amber","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:35.502Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Sandalwood","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Evoke Red Her — это выразительная цветочная композиция, построенная на интригующем контрасте искристой фруктовой свежести и глубокой древесной основы. Аромат открывается ярким всплеском цитрусовых нот бергамота и мандарина, дополненных пряным акцентом розового перца и терпким нюансом черной смородины. В сердце раскрывается изысканный букет из розы, жасмина, пиона и фиалки, придающий парфюму утонченную женственность и цветочную мягкость. Постепенно аромат переходит в теплое, обволакивающее послевкусие, где бархатистое сочетание сандала и кедра гармонично дополняется чувственными нотами амбры, мускуса и сладкой ванили, создавая стойкий и запоминающийся шлейф.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Evoke Red Her is an expressive floral composition built upon the intriguing contrast between sparkling fruit freshness and a deep, grounded woody base. The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of citrusy bergamot and mandarin orange, accented by the spicy zing of pink pepper and the tart character of black currant. At the heart, a sophisticated bouquet of rose, jasmine, peony, and violet emerges, lending the scent a refined femininity and velvety floral grace. The fragrance gradually settles into a warm, lingering finish where the creamy depth of sandalwood and cedarwood is harmonized by the sensual presence of amber, musk, and sweet vanilla, resulting in a smooth and lasting trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:13.454Z"}}'::json),
  (5099, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Al Crystal Al Aswad EDP by Adyan Prestige for Men', '/assets/img/generated-products/3fece09f3c2fd3f87e056e099a9d71c6ac033398c954dc4e76ac3cdb35df4f33.png', 'Al Crystal Al Aswad EDP by Adyan Prestige for Men 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 13.31, '{"gtin":"6292257582109","gender":"Мужской","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/XQmJ2LVCQACEe3sUTnvYdy.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Герань · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:22:53.249187+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/3fece09f3c2fd3f87e056e099a9d71c6ac033398c954dc4e76ac3cdb35df4f33.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:19.413831+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/21bb543a2bc0408660d9f42e6fadeeb2f65f5aa3dc6149974a0027b3b8dd1640.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:23:00.417698+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:23:00.417698+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"e54ed99a7d684f049ae0094f6b1d582b","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда","Грейпфрут"],"heart":["Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Лист Фиалки","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Кожа","Пачули","Бобы Тонка","Ваниль","Мускус"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender","Grapefruit"],"heart":["Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Violet Leaf","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Leather","Patchouli","Tonka Bean","Vanilla","Musk"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:26.956Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Geranium · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Crystal Al Aswad — это динамичная восточная композиция, построенная на интригующем контрасте между ледяной свежестью цитрусовых и обволакивающим теплом пряных древесных аккордов. Аромат открывается бодрящим дуэтом грейпфрута и бергамота, которые обретают глубину благодаря пикантному розовому перцу, кардамону и успокаивающим лавандовым нюансам. В сердце композиции раскрывается мужественное созвучие корицы, мускатного ореха и кедра, смягченное травянистыми оттенками герани и свежестью листьев фиалки. Этот переход создает ощущение благородной сдержанности, подготавливая почву для глубокого финала. Шлейф аромата соткан из смолистой амбры и мягкой кожи, дополненных землистыми нотами пачули. Завершающий аккорд из ванили, бобов тонка и мускуса придает композиции стойкость и выразительную чувственность, оставляя после себя мягкий, но запоминающийся след.","descriptionEn":"Al Crystal Al Aswad is a dynamic Oriental composition defined by an intriguing contrast between icy citrus freshness and the enveloping warmth of spiced woods. The fragrance opens with an invigorating duet of grapefruit and bergamot, gaining complexity from the sharpness of pink pepper, cardamom, and a soothing lavender undertone. At the heart, a masculine harmony of cinnamon, nutmeg, and cedar emerges, softened by the herbaceous facets of geranium and the crispness of violet leaf. This transition creates a sense of refined composure that bridges the initial brightness with a profound finish. The base is anchored in resinous amber and supple leather, balanced by the earthy depth of patchouli. A final touch of vanilla, tonka bean, and musk ensures a lingering, expressive trail that is both soft and commanding.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:35:04.757Z"}}'::json),
  (5107, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Ajmal Viola Women''s Perfume - Spicy, Fresh, Fruity, Floral, Woody, Powdery', '/assets/img/generated-products/143706f708bb0c60ab4d7a5b558297989ac1926ff21945ee254b8707f70f09c3.png', 'Ajmal Viola Women''s Perfume 75ml - Spicy, Fresh, Fruity, Floral, Woody, Powdery — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 13.63, '{"gtin":"6293708009329","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Свежие","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/9RjyJtN55xs24df9qGDXSs.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Ананас · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:24:09.172790+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/143706f708bb0c60ab4d7a5b558297989ac1926ff21945ee254b8707f70f09c3.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:22.149382+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/719251c94ac7533e9995aafaa28f96fb83080cbe3fd2f8e0375f68fe5c79bc8a.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:24:16.886336+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:24:16.886336+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"HRK9zWHPEM","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Ананас","Чёрная Смородина","Яблоко","Персик"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Фиалка","Корень Ириса","Ландыш"],"base":["Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Амбра","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pineapple","Black Currant","Apple","Peach"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Violet","Orris Root","Lily of the Valley"],"base":["Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Amber","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:29.040Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pineapple · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Viola — это изысканная композиция, в которой искристая свежесть фруктов встречается с пудровой элегантностью цветочного сердца. Аромат выстраивает тонкий баланс между энергичным началом и мягким, глубоким древесным шлейфом. Вступительные аккорды раскрываются ярким коктейлем из бергамота, ананаса, черной смородины, яблока и персика, создавая ощущение сочной и бодрящей чистоты. Постепенно аромат обретает бархатистое звучание, где сплетаются роза, жасмин, фиалка, корень ириса и ландыш, придавая композиции женственную утонченность. Завершающим аккордом выступает теплая база из мускуса, сандала, ванили, амбры и кедра. Эти ноты создают стойкое, обволакивающее послевкусие, которое мягко оседает на коже, подчеркивая благородство и глубину парфюмерной пирамиды.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Viola is an exquisite composition where sparkling fruit freshness meets the powdery elegance of a floral heart. The fragrance strikes a delicate balance between an energetic opening and a soft, deep woody trail. The initial notes unfold with a vibrant cocktail of bergamot, pineapple, black currant, apple, and peach, creating an impression of juicy and invigorating clarity. Gradually, the scent evolves into a velvety blend of rose, jasmine, violet, orris root, and lily of the valley, lending the composition a refined feminine character. The experience concludes with a warm base of musk, sandalwood, vanilla, amber, and cedar. These notes provide a lingering, enveloping finish that settles gently on the skin, highlighting the nobility and depth of the fragrance pyramid.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:36:05.161Z"}}'::json),
