дровая Древесина","Мускус"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Violet Leaf"],"base":["Amber","Leather","Patchouli","Cedarwood","Musk"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:32.058Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Geranium · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Evoke Him — это динамичная восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте бодрящей пряной свежести и глубокого древесно-кожаного шлейфа. Аромат открывается ярким всплеском бергамота и лаванды, который мгновенно сменяется теплым акцентом розового перца и кардамона. В сердце аромата пряные ноты корицы и мускатного ореха переплетаются с травянистой чистотой герани и утонченным звучанием листьев фиалки, создавая сбалансированный и выразительный профиль. Постепенно композиция переходит в основательную базу, где мужественные кожаные аккорды соединяются с землистыми оттенками пачули, смолистостью кедра и мягким мускусно-амбровым теплом, оставляющим на коже стойкий и элегантный след.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Evoke Him is a dynamic oriental composition defined by the contrast between invigorating spicy freshness and a profound leathery-woody trail. The fragrance opens with a sharp, bright spark of bergamot and lavender, immediately balanced by the warm, piquant edge of pink pepper and cardamom. At its heart, the aromatic blend of cinnamon and nutmeg harmonizes with the crisp, herbaceous character of geranium and violet leaf, forming a sophisticated and well-rounded center. As the scent settles, it reveals a robust base where masculine leather notes meet the earthy depth of patchouli, the resinous strength of cedarwood, and a smooth musk-amber warmth that leaves a lasting, elegant impression.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:17:11.280Z"}}'::json),
  (5128, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Ajmal Aurum Elixir Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/2101d2fe1594a942d16e8bcabf96a14f8e944c7ac279dd0c9a63db3997a3af33.png', 'Ajmal Aurum Elixir Eau De Parfum Spray 75ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 18.37, '{"gtin":"6293708020997","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/2P9ooXGwGUzJxNq8kkjgmk.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Жасмин · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:16:27.558910+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/2101d2fe1594a942d16e8bcabf96a14f8e944c7ac279dd0c9a63db3997a3af33.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:45:45.386120+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/67e28fdd566543e3debec9c6eb12d040de8d715a66bbe01541464fab4085b2e6.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:16:35.509364+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:16:35.509364+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"5291e368fcdd41fba80a7f8a7e016a53","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Жасмин","Роза","Герань","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Ваниль","Сандал","Мускус","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Jasmine","Rose","Geranium","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Vanilla","Sandalwood","Musk","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:33.442Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Jasmine · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Aurum Elixir — это восточная композиция, построенная на изысканном контрасте между искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким, согревающим древесно-пряным шлейфом. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным пикантной остротой розового перца и пряным теплом кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает богатый цветочный букет из жасмина, розы и герани, чье бархатистое звучание подчеркивается терпким акцентом мускатного ореха. Этот цветочный аккорд плавно переходит в чувственную базу, где сладость ванили и теплота амбры соединяются со сливочными оттенками сандала. Завершающий шлейф обретает глубину благодаря землистым нотам пачули и мягкому мускусному финалу, создающему стойкое и обволакивающее послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Aurum Elixir is an oriental composition defined by the sophisticated contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and a deep, warming woody-spicy trail. The fragrance opens with an invigorating blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the piquant bite of pink pepper and the aromatic warmth of cardamom. At the heart, a rich floral bouquet of jasmine, rose, and geranium unfolds, its velvety character accented by the subtle spice of nutmeg. This floral core transitions seamlessly into a sensual base where the sweetness of vanilla and the radiant glow of amber meet the creamy texture of sandalwood. The final trail gains depth through the earthy nuances of patchouli and a soft musky finish, leaving a lingering, enveloping presence on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:17:53.306Z"}}'::json),
  (5097, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Emira Perfume for Women Eau de Parfum Romantic Floral Fragrance with Rose Amber Patchouli Musk', '/assets/img/generated-products/3419e6b58049ee3df15629e0798bfe7bd6823bc994be230f7c254aefedb53286.png', 'Emira Perfume for Women Eau de Parfum 100ml Romantic Floral Fragrance with Rose Amber Patchouli Musk — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 13.31, '{"gtin":"6292257641981","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Цветочные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/6kbJnfgGqpLzXsQi5QkPuC.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Роза · Бергамот · Жасмин · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:22:31.641657+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/3419e6b58049ee3df15629e0798bfe7bd6823bc994be230f7c254aefedb53286.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:18.565170+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/e9093e7be636870926d448de580c021abefc6ed35092ab53e886227737698f13.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:22:38.258125+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:22:38.258125+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"230741c9ffd54ff6b55bd24685acc21b","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Роза","Бергамот","Персик","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Жасмин","Герань","Фиалка","Ландыш"],"base":["Амбра","Пачули","Мускус","Ваниль","Сандал"]},"en":{"top":["Rose","Bergamot","Peach","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Jasmine","Geranium","Violet","Lily of the Valley"],"base":["Amber","Patchouli","Musk","Vanilla","Sandalwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:26.540Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Rose · Bergamot · Jasmine · Amber","descriptionRu":"Emira от Ajmal — изысканная цветочная композиция, сочетающая классическую элегантность и современную чувственность через яркий контраст искрящихся фруктово-пряных акцентов и теплой древесной базы. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и розового перца, дополненным сочной сладостью персика и благородным звучанием розы. Постепенно в силу вступает богатый и многогранный цветочный букет из жасмина, герани, фиалки и ландыша, придающий композиции глубину и утонченную нежность. Завершает звучание мягкий шлейф, сотканный из глубоких нот амбры, пачули и мускуса, гармонично соединенных с кремовым сандалом и сладковатой ванилью, оставляя на коже обволакивающий и элегантный след.","descriptionEn":"Emira by Ajmal is an exquisite floral composition that unites classic elegance with modern sensuality through a striking contrast of sparkling fruit-spiced accents and a warm woody foundation. The fragrance opens with an invigorating duet of bergamot and pink pepper, complemented by the juicy sweetness of peach and the refined presence of rose. Gradually, a rich and multifaceted floral bouquet of jasmine, geranium, violet, and lily of the valley unfolds, imparting depth and delicate sophistication. The scent concludes with a soft trail woven from deep notes of amber, patchouli, and musk, harmoniously blended with creamy sandalwood and sweet vanilla, leaving an enveloping and elegant imprint on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:34:39.967Z"}}'::json),
