ot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:48.789Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Adyan Samara — это воплощение изысканной восточной композиции, построенной на контрасте искристой фруктовой свежести и глубокого цветочного тепла. Аромат раскрывается динамичным аккордом бергамота, мандарина и личи, дополненным едва уловимым пряным оттенком розового перца. В сердце композиции расцветает нежный букет, где бархатистая роза и жасмин переплетаются с воздушными нотами пиона и фрезии, создавая утонченную женственную ауру. Постепенно аромат обретает чувственную глубину благодаря шлейфу из мягкого мускуса, теплой амбры, сливочного сандала и сладких ванильных нюансов.","descriptionEn":"Adyan Samara captures the essence of an elegant oriental composition, defined by the interplay between sparkling fruity freshness and deep floral warmth. The fragrance opens with a vibrant citrus blend of bergamot and mandarin orange, brightened by the exotic sweetness of litchi and a subtle, piquante touch of pink pepper. As the scent unfolds, a delicate floral bouquet emerges, where the velvety character of rose and jasmine harmonizes with the airy, ethereal nuances of peony and freesia. The experience concludes with a rich, lingering base, as the warmth of amber and sandalwood blends seamlessly with soft musk and a touch of creamy vanilla.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:21:42.039Z"}}'::json),
  (5217, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.183501+00:00', 'Ajmal Kids Perfumes Adventure Bay', '/assets/img/generated-products/8c3846d0a576b3aba697e9972e8882f122faca8102cb0d0cfd2b707cee0c6a43.png', 'Ajmal Kids Perfumes Adventure Bay — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 7.56, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Белый Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/KSTMmb6mVC2LrG3o93ohJr.jpg","gtin":"6293708020010","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:28.146176+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/8c3846d0a576b3aba697e9972e8882f122faca8102cb0d0cfd2b707cee0c6a43.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:05.132261+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:33.302024+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:33.302024+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"fc7d21f16876495b9cf8dc05db021b47","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Зелёное Яблоко","Мята"],"heart":["Лаванда","Жасмин","Фрезия","Морские Ноты"],"base":["Белый Мускус","Кедровая Древесина","Амбра","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Green Apple","Mint"],"heart":["Lavender","Jasmine","Freesia","Sea Notes"],"base":["White Musk","Cedarwood","Amber","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:50.932Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · White Musk","descriptionRu":"Adventure Bay от Ajmal — это яркая восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте бодрящей свежести и мягкой древесной глубины. Аромат открывается всплеском цитрусовой энергии бергамота и лимона, дополненной хрустящей кислинкой зеленого яблока и прохладным акцентом мяты. В сердце аромата расцветает гармоничный букет из лаванды, жасмина и фрезии, овеянный легким дыханием морских нот, которые придают композиции воздушность и чистоту. Постепенно раскрываясь на коже, парфюм обретает теплоту благодаря базе из белого мускуса, кедра, амбры и ванили, оставляя деликатный и уютный шлейф.","descriptionEn":"Adventure Bay by Ajmal is a vibrant oriental composition defined by the contrast between invigorating freshness and soft woody depth. The fragrance opens with a burst of citrus energy from bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the crisp acidity of green apple and a cooling touch of mint. At the heart, a harmonious bouquet of lavender, jasmine, and freesia unfolds, infused with the airy clarity of sea notes. As the scent settles, it reveals a warm, grounding base of white musk, cedarwood, amber, and vanilla, leaving behind a delicate and comforting trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:22:06.088Z"}}'::json),
  (5101, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Ajmal Aristocrat Coastal Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/3a47a2fbdd33de671d49e39a53d2301b340ca4b42adb49e327f629787f2dd635.png', 'Ajmal Aristocrat Coastal Eau De Parfum — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 25.59, '{"gtin":"6293708019601","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/awLNtwGxQPfCk7HYDPoKRf.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Кедр","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:23:12.559222+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/3a47a2fbdd33de671d49e39a53d2301b340ca4b42adb49e327f629787f2dd635.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:20.199198+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/c245878872491ca13b70cc0228174aac660b93b66bb1c431b501aa26f8411b19.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:23:19.822279+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:23:19.822279+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"8e6c294b2abd4afaa2e3af3de3976407","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Морские Ноты","Мята"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Можжевельник","Розмарин"],"base":["Кедр","Мускус","Амбра","Ветивер"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Sea Notes","Mint"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Juniper Berry","Rosemary"],"base":["Cedarwood","Musk","Amber","Vetiver"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:27.317Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Cedarwood","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Aristocrat Coastal — это освежающая интерпретация восточного аромата, в которой прохлада морского бриза встречается с благородной глубиной древесных аккордов. Композиция воплощает контраст между энергичным цитрусовым стартом и сдержанной травянистой элегантностью сердца. Начало аромата раскрывается искристым сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным бодрящими акцентами мяты и солеными морскими нотами. Это яркое вступление постепенно смягчается, уступая место ароматическому «сердцу», где переплетаются прохладная лаванда, герань, терпкий можжевельник и пряный розмарин. В базе композиция обретает устойчивый характер благодаря теплому сочетанию кедра, мускуса и амбры. Завершающий штрих в виде ветивера придает аромату землистую глубину, оставляя на коже сбалансированный и выразительный шлейф.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Aristocrat Coastal is a refreshing interpretation of an oriental fragrance, where the coolness of a sea breeze meets the noble depth of woody accords. The composition embodies the contrast between an energetic citrus opening and the restrained, herbaceous elegance of its heart. The fragrance begins with a sparkling blend of bergamot and lemon, complemented by invigorating accents of mint and oceanic sea notes. This vibrant introduction gradually softens, giving way to an aromatic heart where lavender and geranium intertwine with the tartness of juniper berry and the earthy spice of rosemary. In the base, the composition gains a steady character through a warm combination of cedarwood, musk, and amber. A final touch of vetiver provides an earthy depth, leaving a balanced and expressive trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T19:35:11.949Z"}}'::json),
  (5134, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Hatkora Wood Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/84f661ff0a233cad294b5c75275c82556e9638e4c66edfc9105ef72a5aad3619.png', 'Ajmal Hatkora Wood Eau De Parfum — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 41.21, '{"gtin":"6293708016549","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Древесные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/YiGgVhLLN8ThvuwVJdyrwJ.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Цитрус Хаткора · Кедровая Древесина","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:15.188192+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/84f661ff0a233cad294b5c75275c82556e9638e4c66edfc9105ef72a5aad3619.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:31.383671+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/4e00706bda0393e29b0e2d20bd91acedee8322def39a19e09ea70026cb1d2563.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:23.358230+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:23.358230+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"YE1Z9E","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Цитрус Хаткора","Жасмин","Роза","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Кедровая Древесина","Сандаловое Дерево","Амбра","Мускус","Ветивер"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Hatkora Citrus","Jasmine","Rose","Nutmeg"],"base":["Cedarwood","Sandalwood","Amber","Musk","Vetiver"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:35.037Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Hatkora Citrus · Cedarwood","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Hatkora Wood — это древесная композиция, построенная на контрасте искристой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого, землистого тепла. Аромат раскрывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, подчеркнутым деликатной остротой розового перца и пряным акцентом кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает редкий цитрус хаткора, чья самобытная терпкость гармонично переплетается с классическим цветочным букетом из жасмина и розы. Пряный нюанс мускатного ореха придает этой части аромата особую глубину и объем. Завершает звучание благородный древесный шлейф, в котором кедр и сандал соединяются с обволакивающим теплом амбры и мускуса. Вкрапления ветивера придают базе финальную строгость и выразительную стойкость.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Hatkora Wood is a woody composition defined by the interplay between sparkling citrus freshness and deep, earthy warmth. The fragrance opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the delicate piquancy of pink pepper and a refined touch of cardamom. At the heart of the scent, the rare Hatkora citrus takes center stage, its distinctive tartness seamlessly woven into a classic floral bouquet of jasmine and rose. A subtle hint of nutmeg adds complexity and texture to the developing middle notes. The experience concludes with a noble woody trail, where cedar and sandalwood merge with the enveloping warmth of amber and musk. A grounding infusion of vetiver brings a final touch of composure and lasting resonance to the base.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:11.274Z"}}'::json),
  (5145, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Nomad Noir Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/fbd581e42e61f8c6af91d86321712171ec96e50642753c44c0564abeac05f5bb.png', 'Ajmal Nomad Noir Eau De Parfum — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 10.13, '{"gtin":"6293708019946","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/DTnJjVAjaxXfkY6KNXYMpN.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Герань · Уд","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:25.437008+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/fbd581e42e61f8c6af91d86321712171ec96e50642753c44c0564abeac05f5bb.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:35.049807+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/61c3aca0f6fbc145341ad322a3f0468951c5ea9c2f16f100e71e0fbdbf682aec.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:34.550096+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:34.550096+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Лист Фиалки"],"base":["Уд","Кожа","Амбра","Пачули","Мускус"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Violet Leaf"],"base":["Oud","Leather","Amber","Patchouli","Musk"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:37.150Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Geranium · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Nomad Noir — это глубокая восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте прохладной пряности и анималистической интенсивности. Аромат открывается энергичным всплеском бергамота, дополненным бодрящим дуэтом розового перца и кардамона, чья острота плавно смягчается травянистыми оттенками лаванды. В сердце раскрывается сложный пряный аккорд, где теплота корицы и мускатного ореха встречается с цветочными нюансами герани и тонкой, влажной зеленью листьев фиалки. Это сочетание придает композиции объем и утонченную динамику. Завершающий шлейф строится на солидном фундаменте из дымного уда, кожи и смолистой амбры. Землистые тона пачули и мягкие мускусные вкрапления закрепляют звучание, создавая выразительный и стойкий характер.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Nomad Noir is a profound Oriental composition defined by the contrast between cooling spices and raw, animalic intensity. The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of bergamot, sharpened by the piquant duo of pink pepper and cardamom, while a touch of lavender adds an aromatic, herbal clarity. At the heart, a complex spicy accord emerges, where the warmth of cinnamon and nutmeg meets the floral elegance of geranium and the subtle, aqueous green of violet leaf. This transition balances the initial spice with a smooth, nuanced texture. The base settles into a commanding foundation of smoky oud, supple leather, and resinous amber. Deep, earthy tones of patchouli and clean musk linger on the skin, leaving a lasting, sophisticated trail that anchors the entire olfactory narrative.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:42.247Z"}}'::json),
