за","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Жасмин"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Кедровое Дерево","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender","Lemon"],"heart":["Geranium","Rose","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Jasmine"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Cedarwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:41.665Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Geranium · Amber","descriptionRu":"Mizyaan от Ajmal — это глубокая восточная композиция, построенная на изысканном контрасте между искристой свежестью цитрусовых и обволакивающим теплом пряных древесных нот. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим сочетанием бергамота, лимона и лаванды, подчеркнутым пикантными акцентами розового перца и кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает элегантный цветочный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, который постепенно согревается пряным теплом корицы и мускатного ореха. Это сочетание создает мягкий переход к богатому, многогранному шлейфу. Завершающим аккордом выступает глубокая база, где сливочные оттенки сандала и ванили переплетаются с землистыми нотами пачули, кедра, амбры и мускуса, оставляя на коже стойкий, благородный древесный отпечаток.","descriptionEn":"Mizyaan by Ajmal is a profound Oriental composition defined by the sophisticated contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and the enveloping warmth of spicy, woody undertones. The fragrance opens with an invigorating blend of bergamot, lemon, and lavender, sharpened by the piquant bite of pink pepper and cardamom. At the heart, an elegant floral bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, gradually warming as it meets the spicy depth of cinnamon and nutmeg. This transition marks the shift from initial lightness into a more complex, textured narrative. The fragrance settles into a rich, lingering base where the creamy nuances of sandalwood and vanilla intertwine with the earthy character of patchouli, cedarwood, amber, and musk, leaving a noble and enduring woody trail upon the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:19:40.059Z"}}'::json),
  (5127, '2026-11-02T10:59:23.880825+00:00', 'Ajmal Majestic Melange Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/ffe5163a9838d90dcae783b4a2125e2c6bc688b282a769bf11274e706f7737f4.png', 'Ajmal Majestic Melange Eau De Parfum — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 36.79, '{"gtin":"6293708019533","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/4t2xpMjNS2fGWipsUzFttD.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Лаванда · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:27:13.962432+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/ffe5163a9838d90dcae783b4a2125e2c6bc688b282a769bf11274e706f7737f4.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:27.741801+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/cbed22c595211b1609c7de9433665a9277bdbc09e6d4ffbe64335868f18579b2.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:27:20.144339+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:27:20.144339+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"77bea8e5a8b544099a9b5fa7c8d6d1bb","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лимон"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Кедр","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Cedar","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:33.722Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Majestic Melange — это искусное переплетение пряной остроты и глубокой древесной теплоты, создающее образ утонченного восточного аромата. Композиция открывается бодрящим аккордом бергамота и лимона, который мгновенно обретает характер благодаря яркому созвучию розового перца и кардамона. В сердце аромата раскрывается гармоничный дуэт лаванды и герани, дополненный пряными оттенками корицы и мускатного ореха. Эти цветочные и специевые грани плавно переходят в насыщенный шлейф, где доминируют благородные ноты сандала и кедра. Завершают композицию чувственные аккорды амбры, мускуса и ванили, оставляя на коже мягкий, притягательный след. Это сбалансированное сочетание подчеркивает многогранность восточного парфюмерного искусства, придавая образу элегантную завершенность.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Majestic Melange is a sophisticated interplay of spicy intensity and deep woody warmth, defining the essence of a refined oriental fragrance. The composition opens with a vibrant citrus burst of bergamot and lemon, immediately given a sharp, distinctive edge by the inclusion of pink pepper and cardamom. At the heart of the scent lies a balanced union of lavender and geranium, enriched with the warm, aromatic nuances of cinnamon and nutmeg. This floral and spiced core transitions seamlessly into a robust base defined by the creamy presence of sandalwood and the structured elegance of cedarwood. The fragrance concludes with a lingering trail of amber, musk, and vanilla, providing a soft yet enduring finish. This harmonious blend reflects the complexity of oriental perfumery, offering an evocative and polished olfactory experience.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:17:49.329Z"}}'::json),
  (5141, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Chemystery Men Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/c895710fd1fd611c492f45a98668857421cff61c44f2c410788e229631a2524a.png', 'Ajmal Chemystery Men Eau De Parfum Spray 90ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 8.26, '{"gtin":"6293708000432","gender":"Мужской","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/AWfzDLKi9pN9QxPyhRfFxK.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Герань · Кожа","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:46.642377+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/c895710fd1fd611c492f45a98668857421cff61c44f2c410788e229631a2524a.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:32.999879+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/2962848e1764b5fb2f74239533d4efd165f2ae06a89a7f02421663cb64e6cb46.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:53.503554+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:53.503554+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"48W8L5","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Лист Фиалки"],"base":["Кожа","Амбра","Пачули","Кедровая Древесина","Мускус"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Violet Leaf"],"base":["Leather","Amber","Patchouli","Cedarwood","Musk"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:36.450Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Geranium · Leather","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Chemystery — это восточная композиция, построенная на интригующем контрасте между прохладной пряной свежестью и глубоким, анималистичным шлейфом. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим аккордом бергамота и лаванды, подчеркнутым энергичными искрами розового перца и кардамона. В сердце композиции пряные нюансы корицы и мускатного ореха смягчаются травянистой чистотой герани и утонченным оттенком листа фиалки. Постепенно аромат обретает более плотную структуру, переходя к уверенному древесно-кожаному звучанию. Базовый аккорд из кожи, амбры и пачули создает стойкий, обволакивающий характер. Теплота кедра и мягкие мускусные ноты завершают звучание, оставляя после себя сдержанный, но выразительный шлейф.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Chemystery is an oriental composition defined by the intriguing contrast between cool, spicy freshness and a deep, animalic trail. The fragrance opens with an invigorating accord of bergamot and lavender, punctuated by the energetic sparks of pink pepper and cardamom. At the heart of the composition, the spicy nuances of cinnamon and nutmeg are softened by the herbaceous clarity of geranium and the refined touch of violet leaf. The scent gradually gains a denser structure, transitioning into a confident leather and wood profile. The base accord of leather, amber, and patchouli creates a persistent, enveloping character. The warmth of cedarwood and soft musky notes complete the experience, leaving behind a subtle yet expressive signature.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:21.402Z"}}'::json),
