ловое Дерево","Мускус","Ваниль","Лабданум"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon"],"heart":["Amber","Cedarwood","Patchouli","Geranium","Nutmeg"],"base":["Oud","Sandalwood","Musk","Vanilla","Labdanum"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:34.802Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Amber · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Amber Wood Noir — это глубокая древесная композиция, в которой искристая свежесть цитрусов встречается с обволакивающей теплотой драгоценных смол. Аромат выстраивает сложный баланс между пряной энергией и благородной древесной базой. Начальные ноты раскрываются бодрящим сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным пикантными акцентами розового перца и кардамона. Этот яркий старт постепенно переходит в насыщенное сердце, где доминирует теплый янтарь в обрамлении кедра, землистого пачули, цветочно-травянистого герани и пряного мускатного ореха. Финал композиции оставляет глубокий и стойкий шлейф. Древесные грани уда и сандала сплетаются с мягкостью ванили, мускуса и лабданума, создавая ощущение комфорта и утонченной интенсивности.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Amber Wood Noir is a profound woody composition where the sparkling freshness of citrus meets the enveloping warmth of precious resins. The fragrance establishes a sophisticated balance between vibrant spice and a noble woody foundation. The opening notes unfold with an invigorating blend of bergamot and lemon, accented by the piquant touch of pink pepper and cardamom. This bright introduction transitions into a rich heart, where warm amber takes center stage, framed by cedar, earthy patchouli, floral-herbal geranium, and spicy nutmeg. The dry down leaves a deep and lingering trail. The woody facets of oud and sandalwood intertwine with the softness of vanilla, musk, and labdanum, creating a sense of comfort and refined intensity.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:00.853Z"}}'::json),
  (5144, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Evoke Gold Edition Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/7515f7706fdc6e1806721ed2f445fd6a014a6a3f6bb606ccbfd0719d6e38b17e.png', 'Ajmal Evoke Gold Edition Eau De Parfum Spray 90ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 23.49, '{"gtin":"6293708011261","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/Anqp4PJ5BuYZLKUH2ipepa.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:16.134455+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/7515f7706fdc6e1806721ed2f445fd6a014a6a3f6bb606ccbfd0719d6e38b17e.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:34.533990+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/f8a1b6cf777b51401b68b6db4bb6b97dc9273c2069fba58f343bf8c4ae46de44.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:22.710060+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:22.710060+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"KXFaQS6s3S","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Жасмин","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Кедр","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Jasmine","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Cedar","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:36.675Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Evoke Gold Edition — это воплощение изысканной восточной композиции, построенной на контрасте между искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким древесно-пряным шлейфом. Аромат открывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, приправленным пикантными искрами розового перца и кардамона, которые мгновенно задают динамичный тон. В сердце композиции расцветает утонченный цветочный букет из лаванды, герани и жасмина, чья прохладная элегантность гармонично дополнена теплым пряным акцентом мускатного ореха. Это сочетание придает аромату особую многогранность, плавно переходящую в уверенную базу. Завершающий шлейф окутывает мягкой дымкой из амбры и муска, подчеркнутой сливочными переливами сандала, благородным кедром и деликатной сладостью ванили. Такое сочетание создает стойкий, обволакивающий характер, оставляя после себя ощущение тепла и безупречного стиля.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Evoke Gold Edition is an embodiment of an exquisite oriental composition, built on the contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and a deep, woody-spicy trail. The fragrance opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, seasoned with the piquant sparks of pink pepper and cardamom that instantly set a dynamic tone. At the heart of the composition, a refined floral bouquet of lavender, geranium, and jasmine unfolds, its cool elegance harmoniously complemented by the warm, spicy accent of nutmeg. This combination lends the fragrance a multifaceted character that transitions smoothly into a confident base. The final trail envelops the senses in a soft haze of amber and musk, highlighted by creamy sandalwood nuances, noble cedar, and a delicate touch of vanilla. This blend creates a long-lasting, enveloping presence, leaving behind a sensation of warmth and impeccable style.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:38.647Z"}}'::json),
  (5160, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Hatkora Wood Unisex Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/838015913f545cfe4462b13402e6b9fcfcabe8330418949d58d7a4b6a619d7ab.png', 'Ajmal Hatkora Wood Unisex Eau De Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 53.96, '{"gtin":"6293708006748","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Древесные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/c2JXTBuacYZbNKtueGd7W8.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Цитрус Хаткора · Кедровая Древесина","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:32:02.951160+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/838015913f545cfe4462b13402e6b9fcfcabe8330418949d58d7a4b6a619d7ab.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:42.478836+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/85c01480586d85f9ee83783fdc159d968e9f6df6472fa6638dfb457c0b38d68f.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:32:10.468601+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:32:10.468601+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"K9ymn7tiFX","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Цитрус Хаткора","Жасмин","Роза","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Кедровая Древесина","Сандаловое Дерево","Амбра","Мускус","Ветивер"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Hatkora Citrus","Jasmine","Rose","Nutmeg"],"base":["Cedarwood","Sandalwood","Amber","Musk","Vetiver"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:35.037Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Hatkora Citrus · Cedarwood","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Hatkora Wood — это утонченное сочетание цитрусовой яркости и глубокой древесной основы, создающее контраст между бодрящей свежестью и обволакивающим теплом. Аромат раскрывается энергичным всплеском бергамота и лимона, подчеркнутых пикантной остротой розового перца и кардамона, которые задают динамичный тон с первых секунд. В сердце композиции доминирует редкий цитрус хаткора, чья самобытная кислинка мягко переплетается с цветочными аккордами жасмина и розы, дополненными пряным акцентом мускатного ореха. Этот цветочный переход придает аромату изысканную многогранность, плавно подготавливая переход к базе. Шлейф аромата выстроен на благородной древесной базе из кедра, сандала и ветивера, которые обретают глубину благодаря теплому звучанию амбры и мускуса. Финальные ноты оставляют устойчивое ощущение спокойной элегантности и уверенности.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Hatkora Wood is a sophisticated fusion of citrus vibrancy and deep woody foundations, balancing invigorating freshness with an enveloping, grounding warmth. The fragrance opens with an energetic burst of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the piquant spice of pink pepper and cardamom that sets a dynamic tone from the very first impression. At the heart of the composition, the rare hatkora citrus takes center stage, its distinctive tartness softening into the velvety floral character of jasmine and rose, further nuanced by a hint of nutmeg. This floral transition lends the scent a refined complexity, bridging the gap between the initial sparkle and the grounded base. The fragrance concludes with a noble foundation of cedarwood, sandalwood, and vetiver, which gain profound resonance through the rich warmth of amber and musk. These final notes leave a lingering trail of quiet elegance and balanced character.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:19:30.440Z"}}'::json),
  (5171, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Adyan Bara Coffee Extrait De Parfum Unisex Fragrance Original From Dubai', '/assets/img/generated-products/baff003dbab980b13175c78e861826fe1e2a89400f8ac7e70f92a82cded3f148.png', 'Adyan Bara Coffee Extrait De Parfum Unisex Fragrance Original From Dubai — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 21.73, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Кофе · Бергамот · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/N4V7DEo6dYZvfGTcUwtGJh.jpg","gtin":"6292257646573","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:33:17.708769+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/baff003dbab980b13175c78e861826fe1e2a89400f8ac7e70f92a82cded3f148.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:46.505996+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:33:24.714527+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:33:24.714527+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"61d456b29dce4ac19cce08a76d57ef16","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Кофе","Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Флёрдоранж","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Ваниль","Сандаловое Дерево","Мускус","Пачули","Бобы Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Coffee","Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Orange Blossom","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Vanilla","Sandalwood","Musk","Patchouli","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:42.533Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Coffee · Bergamot · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Adyan Bara от Ajmal — это глубокая восточная композиция, построенная на интригующем контрасте между бодрящей кофейной горечью и мягкой цветочной сладостью. Аромат открывается ярким всплеском цитрусовых нот бергамота и лимона, которые мгновенно уравновешиваются пряными искрами розового перца и кардамона, создавая эффектный кофейный аккорд в самом начале звучания. В сердце композиции раскрывается изысканный букет из розы, жасмина и нежного флердоранжа, чья легкость постепенно обретает пряную глубину благодаря вкраплениям корицы и мускатного ореха. Это сочетание придает аромату многогранный характер, переходящий от цветочной свежести к теплым, обволакивающим оттенкам. Шлейф аромата соткан из богатых нот амбры, ванили и сливочного сандала, дополненных землистыми нюансами пачули. Завершающие аккорды мускуса и бобов тонка оставляют на коже стойкий, чувственный след, подчеркивающий восточную роскошь и глубину этого парфюма.","descriptionEn":"Adyan Bara by Ajmal is a profound oriental composition defined by the intriguing contrast between invigorating coffee bitterness and soft floral sweetness. The fragrance opens with a sparkling burst of bergamot and lemon, instantly balanced by the spicy sparks of pink pepper and cardamom, which frame the prominent coffee accord from the very first impression. At the heart, a sophisticated bouquet of rose, jasmine, and delicate orange blossom unfolds, its lightness gaining spicy depth through nuances of cinnamon and nutmeg. This transition creates a multifaceted character, moving seamlessly from floral brightness to a warmer, more textured core. The dry down is woven from rich notes of amber, vanilla, and creamy sandalwood, further grounded by the earthy influence of patchouli. A lingering trail of musk and tonka bean settles on the skin, leaving a sensual, enduring finish that highlights the oriental richness and depth of the fragrance.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:19:50.217Z"}}'::json),
  (5140, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Noble Notes Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/ffb4bbc31774beee6013f0dadcd0efb5c367cfea15457c9a21ee4f6cd321a551.png', 'Ajmal Noble Notes Eau De Parfum — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 40.73, '{"gtin":"6293708019557","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/eXZUuH4ktDyzbXTZwRnQgW.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:36.336181+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/ffb4bbc31774beee6013f0dadcd0efb5c367cfea15457c9a21ee4f6cd321a551.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:32.420090+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/f6ad767894283044278e3e4e9dfdf7c1b2eaf80891f0b399165591085c10d6a9.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:42.516982+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:28:42.516982+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"3b8ed025e3a347a8b2793bac20a4078c","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Жасмин","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Кедровая Древесина","Ветивер","Боб Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Jasmine","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Cedarwood","Vetiver","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:36.170Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Noble Notes — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой искристая цитрусовая свежесть встречается с глубоким, пряным теплом. Аромат балансирует между энергичным началом и обволакивающим древесным шлейфом, создавая ощущение сдержанной элегантности. Верхние ноты встречают ярким дуэтом бергамота и лимона, чью прохладу подчеркивают острые акценты розового перца и кардамона. По мере раскрытия аромат приобретает цветочную мягкость лаванды, жасмина и герани, дополненную пряным характером мускатного ореха. В базе композиция обретает свою истинную силу: насыщенный аккорд амбры и мускуса сливается с сухой древесностью кедра и ветивера. Теплый, сладковатый оттенок бобов тонка завершает звучание, оставляя после себя выразительный и стойкий след.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Noble Notes is a refined oriental composition where sparkling citrus freshness meets deep, spicy warmth. The fragrance balances an energetic opening with an enveloping woody trail, evoking a sense of understated elegance. The top notes greet you with a vibrant duet of bergamot and lemon, whose coolness is accentuated by the sharp accents of pink pepper and cardamom. As the scent evolves, it gains the floral softness of lavender, jasmine, and geranium, complemented by the spicy character of nutmeg. In the base, the fragrance reveals its true depth: a rich amber and musk accord merges with the dry, woody tones of cedar and vetiver. A warm, sweet nuance of tonka bean completes the profile, leaving behind a distinctive and lingering trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:18:17.858Z"}}'::json),
  (5154, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Ajmal Scarlet Bloom Eau de Parfum Spray for Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/798e595c883495f1334acada20de9427e2623500d1b934c00d6ba9046c3188a4.png', 'Ajmal Scarlet Bloom Eau de Parfum Spray for Women 3.4 oz — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 25.17, '{"gtin":"6293708016525","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/ELabVur4c7Kwjt3scvdv8J.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:30:58.252119+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/798e595c883495f1334acada20de9427e2623500d1b934c00d6ba9046c3188a4.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:39.621317+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/d519380050d9e3a7c3502e4a1398d6d3ef51a6dc14b092596c6598a246517c8c.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:31:09.266690+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:31:09.266690+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"14ab80e57efa47849726e4c75cd073d3","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Пачули","Амбра"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Patchouli","Amber"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:39.630Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Scarlet Bloom — это гармоничное сочетание восточной глубины и легкой цветочной свежести, где искристая энергия цитрусов встречается с чувственным теплом древесных смол. Композиция открывается бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и мандарина, приправленным пикантным розовым перцем и экзотической сладостью личи. В сердце аромата распускается пышный букет из розы, жасмина, пиона и фрезии, создающий ощущение мягкой женственности и цветочной грации. Постепенно раскрываясь, композиция обретает более глубокий характер благодаря шлейфу из пачули и амбры. Базовые ноты ванили и мускуса окутывают кожу бархатистым теплом, завершая звучание элегантным и стойким аккордом.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Scarlet Bloom captures the perfect balance between oriental depth and airy floral freshness, where sparkling citrus energy meets the sensual warmth of rich resins. The fragrance opens with a vibrant blend of bergamot and mandarin orange, brightened by a dash of spicy pink pepper and the exotic sweetness of litchi. At the heart, a sophisticated bouquet of rose, jasmine, peony, and freesia unfolds, lending the scent a refined and velvety floral character. As it settles, the fragrance transitions into a deeper, more grounded complexity defined by earthy patchouli and golden amber. The final impression is one of enduring comfort, as base notes of creamy vanilla and musk leave a soft, lingering trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:19:06.326Z"}}'::json),
