:["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Nutmeg"],"base":["Oud","Sandalwood","Amber","Musk","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:51.248Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Eternal 49 — это восточная композиция, построенная на изящном контрасте между искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким, согревающим древесно-амбровым шлейфом. Аромат открывается ярким всплеском бергамота и лимона, чью прохладу подчеркивает пикантный акцент розового перца и пряная терпкость кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает богатый цветочный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, дополненный теплым, слегка ореховым нюансом мускатного ореха. Это сочетание придает аромату бархатистую текстуру и глубину, плавно переходящую в чувственную базу. Завершающим аккордом выступает благородное сочетание уда и сандала, окутанное мягким теплом амбры, ванили и мускуса. Финальный шлейф оставляет на коже стойкое ощущение восточной роскоши и утонченной сладости.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Eternal 49 is an oriental composition defined by the elegant contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and a deep, warming woody-amber trail. The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of bergamot and lemon, whose crispness is enhanced by the piquant touch of pink pepper and the spicy astringency of cardamom. At the heart of the composition, a rich floral bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, complemented by the warm, slightly nutty nuance of nutmeg. This blend imparts a velvety texture and depth, transitioning seamlessly into the sensual foundation. The base is characterized by the noble presence of oud and sandalwood, enveloped in the soft warmth of amber, vanilla, and musk. The final trail leaves a lasting impression of oriental richness and refined sweetness on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:22:11.378Z"}}'::json),
  (5170, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Musc Mango Extrait De Parfum Tropical Delights Collection Unisex Perfume', '/assets/img/generated-products/1b4624c68b42ab72e22618daecc86ce0dc3221dad2dc1835d4c52001a547001d.png', 'Musc Mango Extrait De Parfum Tropical Delights Collection Unisex Perfume — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 17.52, '{"gtin":"6292257645538","gender":"Мужской","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/SA3X2oE4j5izRxF432g6c7.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Манго · Бергамот · Жасмин · Белый Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:33:04.521448+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/1b4624c68b42ab72e22618daecc86ce0dc3221dad2dc1835d4c52001a547001d.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:45.966708+00:00"},"retiredGeneratedImages":["/assets/img/generated-products/9b477457f4aacc323c2f9deba784fe2bf18b625d8ff29d4bef5bb1b2e2de5c7d.png"],"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:33:14.320281+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:33:14.320281+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"3e289e211c61459fa9e2b9822711a655","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Манго","Бергамот","Ананас","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Жасмин","Флёрдоранж","Персик","Роза"],"base":["Белый Мускус","Ваниль","Сандаловое Дерево","Амбра"]},"en":{"top":["Mango","Bergamot","Pineapple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Jasmine","Orange Blossom","Peach","Rose"],"base":["White Musk","Vanilla","Sandalwood","Amber"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:41.869Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Mango · Bergamot · Jasmine · White Musk","descriptionRu":"Musc Mango — это яркий восточный аромат, в котором сочная экзотическая сладость фруктов встречается с обволакивающей нежностью мускуса. Композиция открывается искристой свежестью бергамота, сплетающейся с насыщенными аккордами манго, ананаса и черной смородины, создавая энергичное и солнечное вступление. В сердце аромата расцветает изысканный цветочный букет из жасмина, флердоранжа и розы, дополненный бархатистыми оттенками персика. Шлейф раскрывается глубоким теплом белого мускуса, ванили, сандала и амбры, оставляя на коже мягкий, притягательный и стойкий след.","descriptionEn":"Musc Mango is a vibrant Oriental fragrance where the succulent sweetness of exotic fruits meets the enveloping tenderness of musk. The composition opens with the sparkling freshness of bergamot, weaving together with rich accords of mango, pineapple, and black currant to create an energetic and sun-drenched introduction. At the heart of the scent, a sophisticated floral bouquet of jasmine, orange blossom, and rose blooms, complemented by the velvety nuances of peach. The trail unfolds with the deep warmth of white musk, vanilla, sandalwood, and amber, leaving a soft, alluring, and lingering impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:19:47.446Z"}}'::json),
  (5177, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.05111+00:00', 'Adyan Dalia Ciel Extrait De Parfum for Women - Original Fragrance from Dubai', '/assets/img/generated-products/54a3d6be4be077b64ca2a9581daa153ab1e3c355b65ca48b1a0601c08e89fac2.png', 'Adyan Dalia Ciel Extrait De Parfum for Women - Original Fragrance from Dubai — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 16.91, '{"gtin":"6292257642889","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/Q8Mi2siB7Eu5jrVVwqEMcA.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:34:09.427911+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/54a3d6be4be077b64ca2a9581daa153ab1e3c355b65ca48b1a0601c08e89fac2.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:49.198073+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:34:14.664168+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:34:14.664168+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"43c3423984da42278547fe32164688aa","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:43.394Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Adyan Dalia Ciel — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой искристая свежесть цитрусовых встречается с мягким цветочным шлейфом. Аромат играет на контрасте энергичных фруктовых аккордов и глубокой, чувственной базы. На старте раскрывается бодрящий дуэт бергамота и мандарина, дополненный пикантным розовым перцем и сладковатым оттенком личи. Это яркое вступление плавно переходит в цветочное сердце, где доминируют классическая роза и жасмин, смягченные нежностью пиона и фрезии. Завершает композицию теплый и обволакивающий шлейф. Сливочный сандал и ваниль в сочетании с амброй создают стойкую базу, а тонкие мускусные ноты придают аромату завершенность и элегантную глубину.","descriptionEn":"Adyan Dalia Ciel is a sophisticated oriental composition where the sparkling freshness of citrus meets a soft, velvety floral trail. The fragrance plays on the contrast between energetic fruity facets and a deep, sensual foundation. The opening reveals an invigorating duo of bergamot and mandarin orange, accented by the piquant bite of pink pepper and the sweet nuance of litchi. This vibrant introduction transitions seamlessly into a floral heart, where classic rose and jasmine take center stage, softened by the delicate presence of peony and freesia. The experience concludes with a warm and enveloping dry down. Creamy sandalwood and vanilla blend with rich amber to form a lasting base, while subtle musk notes provide a refined finish and elegant depth.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:20:07.936Z"}}'::json),
  (5212, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.183501+00:00', 'Ajmal Elixir Precious Unisex Perfume', '/assets/img/generated-products/9a21a0b8ce753429eaed29282bf588ec2d9d264c17799f170dab40ee62322341.png', 'Ajmal Elixir Precious Unisex Perfume 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 77.38, '{"gtin":"6293708013944","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/LhPkDajT7PPSzsBcMMfHT9.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:16:58.223178+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/9a21a0b8ce753429eaed29282bf588ec2d9d264c17799f170dab40ee62322341.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:45:46.501685+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:17:04.640916+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:17:04.640916+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"Q05L18","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Ирис","Корица"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Orris","Cinnamon"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:49.312Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Elixir Precious — это восточный аромат, построенный на контрасте искристой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого, обволакивающего тепла. Композиция раскрывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным пряными акцентами розового перца и кардамона, которые задают динамичный тон с самого начала. В сердце аромата расцветает элегантный букет из розы и жасмина, смягченный пудровыми оттенками ириса и согревающей пряностью корицы. Это цветочно-специевое созвучие плавно перетекает в насыщенный шлейф, где доминируют древесные ноты уда и сандала. Мягкое послевкусие амбры, мускуса и ванили придает композиции завершенность, оставляя на коже чувственный и стойкий след.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Elixir Precious is an oriental fragrance defined by the contrast between sparkling citrus brightness and profound, enveloping warmth. The composition opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the piquant accents of pink pepper and cardamom that set a dynamic tone from the first spray. At the heart of the fragrance, an elegant bouquet of rose and jasmine unfolds, softened by the powdery nuances of orris and the warming spice of cinnamon. This floral-spiced accord transitions seamlessly into a rich base where the woody depth of oud and sandalwood takes center stage. A lingering finish of amber, musk, and vanilla rounds out the profile, leaving a sensual and persistent trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:21:54.571Z"}}'::json),
  (5215, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.183501+00:00', 'Ajmal Little Prince Eau De Toilette', '/assets/img/generated-products/d1d319f7c34cdfecac05f0e341947271f1eea801b65690272d9d02db284fc709.png', 'Ajmal Little Prince Eau De Toilette — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 7.56, '{"gtin":"6293708020027","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/SR5QsEmuPkCmyJMG3qeMzN.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:04.509676+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/d1d319f7c34cdfecac05f0e341947271f1eea801b65690272d9d02db284fc709.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:03.977729+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:10.571660+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:10.571660+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"f65319c978304478a0511d6ecc2ef651","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Ландыш","Корица"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Ваниль","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Lily of the Valley","Cinnamon"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Vanilla","Cedar","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:50.208Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Ajmal Little Prince — это яркое восточное прочтение классической свежести, где искристая цитрусовая энергия встречается с глубоким пряным теплом. Аромат балансирует между фруктовой легкостью и уверенным древесно-мускусным шлейфом, создавая гармоничный контраст. Композиция открывается бодрящим коктейлем из бергамота, лимона и спелых фруктовых нот, в которых угадываются сочный ананас, хрустящее яблоко и терпкая черная смородина. Это энергичное начало постепенно уступает место цветочному сердцу, где нежность розы, жасмина и ландыша обретает характер благодаря теплому акценту корицы. Завершает звучание мягкая, обволакивающая база. Сочетание древесных нот кедра и пачули в сочетании с ванилью, амброй и мускусом оставляет на коже стойкий, теплый и глубокий след, придавая аромату завершенность и благородную мягкость.","descriptionEn":"Ajmal Little Prince is a vibrant Oriental interpretation of classic freshness, where sparkling citrus energy meets deep, spicy warmth. The fragrance maintains a delicate balance between fruit-forward lightness and a confident woody-musk trail, creating a refined olfactory contrast. The composition opens with an invigorating cocktail of bergamot, lemon, and ripe fruit notes, featuring the crisp sweetness of apple, juicy pineapple, and the tangy depth of black currant. This energetic introduction gradually transitions into a floral heart, where the elegance of rose, jasmine, and lily of the valley is punctuated by the subtle, warm spice of cinnamon. The dry down is defined by a soft, enveloping base. The woody presence of cedar and patchouli, softened by the rich creaminess of vanilla, amber, and musk, leaves a lingering, warm trail on the skin, providing the fragrance with lasting depth and a smooth, sophisticated character.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:22:01.794Z"}}'::json),
  (5184, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.183501+00:00', 'Adyan Majestic Aura Extrait Perfume for Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/de008386a3c43ed64335d680c447f97942e7b360d0935a6da9edc2e4ba51983d.png', 'Adyan Majestic Aura Extrait Perfume for Women 100ml 3.4oz — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ajmal.', 'Ajmal', 26.93, '{"gtin":"6292257643633","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/aApZo9pcQBf6N9mYuBRgXQ.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:35:11.086013+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/de008386a3c43ed64335d680c447f97942e7b360d0935a6da9edc2e4ba51983d.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:13:52.652420+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:38:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:35:17.587028+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:35:17.587028+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"ea1aa6cd54f0404d98d44f3831e006de","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Флёрдоранж"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Амбра","Сандаловое Дерево","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Orange Blossom"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Amber","Sandalwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:45.197Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Adyan Majestic Aura — это восточный аромат, построенный на контрасте искристой фруктовой свежести и глубокой, чувственной теплоты. Композиция раскрывается динамичным аккордом бергамота, мандарина и личи, подчеркнутым легкой остротой розового перца. Сердце аромата расцветает пышным букетом из розы, жасмина, пиона и флердоранжа, придавая звучанию женственную мягкость и цветочную элегантность. Постепенно раскрываясь, композиция оставляет на коже насыщенный шлейф из ванили, амбры и сандала, уравновешенный землистыми оттенками пачули и деликатным мускусным акцентом.","descriptionEn":"Adyan Majestic Aura is an oriental fragrance defined by the contrast between sparkling fruity freshness and deep, sensual warmth. The composition opens with a vibrant blend of bergamot, mandarin orange, and litchi, sharpened by a subtle touch of pink pepper. The heart reveals a rich bouquet of rose, jasmine, peony, and orange blossom, lending the fragrance a feminine grace and velvety floral character. As it settles, the scent unfolds into a lingering base of vanilla, amber, and sandalwood, grounded by the earthy depth of patchouli and a soft musky trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:20:29.309Z"}}'::json),
  (5251, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.323011+00:00', 'Al Fares Midnight Uomo Eau de Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/00071eb41e698e7ea12478596779df4b89962b4520903feb48467204e662231d.png', 'Al Fares Midnight Uomo Eau de Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Fares.', 'Al Fares', 12.06, '{"gtin":"6294021906265","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/MtCX56JDfcvWHZ8x8tdjsK.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Герань · Кожа","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:43:20.855627+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/00071eb41e698e7ea12478596779df4b89962b4520903feb48467204e662231d.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:15.037024+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T16:43:29.845402+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:43:29.845402+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"minOrderQuantity":4,"unit":4,"variantFid":"804f203c807e4587b3caa6758c2a7e8c","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Лист Фиалки","Шалфей"],"base":["Кожа","Амбра","Пачули","Кедровая Древесина","Боб Тонка","Мускус"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Violet Leaf","Sage"],"base":["Leather","Amber","Patchouli","Cedarwood","Tonka Bean","Musk"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:44:56.395Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Geranium · Leather","descriptionRu":"Al Fares Midnight Uomo — это глубокая восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте бодрящей цитрусовой свежести и обволакивающего тепла пряностей. Аромат раскрывается динамичным сочетанием бергамота, лимона и розового перца, чья острота плавно смягчается ароматическими нюансами лаванды и кардамона. В сердце композиции доминируют насыщенные пряные ноты корицы и мускатного ореха, дополненные травянистой свежестью герани, шалфея и утонченным оттенком листьев фиалки. Это сочетание создает пряный, текстурный аккорд, придающий аромату характер и глубину. Завершает звучание плотный шлейф из благородной кожи, амбры и пачули. Древесные ноты кедра в сочетании с мягкостью бобов тонка и мускуса формируют стойкий, чувственный финал, оставляющий на коже теплое и мужественное послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Al Fares Midnight Uomo is a profound oriental composition defined by the contrast between invigorating citrus brightness and enveloping spicy warmth. The fragrance opens with a dynamic blend of bergamot, lemon, and pink pepper, whose sharp edge is softened by the aromatic nuances of lavender and cardamom. At the heart of the composition, rich notes of cinnamon and nutmeg take center stage, complemented by the herbaceous freshness of geranium, sage, and the subtle, green character of violet leaf. This transition creates a textured, spicy core that gives the fragrance its distinct personality. The dry-down settles into a dense, lingering trail of noble leather, amber, and patchouli. Woody cedar notes combined with the smooth, sweetness of tonka bean and musk form a persistent, sensual finish that leaves a warm and masculine impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:23:15.051Z"}}'::json),
