33+00:00"}},"variantFid":"6RNV56","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Чёрная Смородина","Яблоко"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Ирис"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Дубовый Мох","Боб Тонка","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Black Currant","Apple"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Orris"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Oakmoss","Tonka Bean","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:04.771Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Night Dreams Silver — это многогранная восточная композиция, построенная на интригующем контрасте между искристой фруктовой свежестью и глубоким древесно-мшистым шлейфом. Аромат открывается энергичным всплеском цитрусовых нот бергамота и лимона, дополненных сочными акцентами ананаса, черной смородины и яблока, создающими яркое и динамичное начало. В сердце композиции расцветает элегантный букет из розы и жасмина, чья цветочная мягкость изящно подчеркнута землистыми оттенками пачули, корня ириса и дымным нюансом березы. Такое сочетание придает аромату особую глубину и текстурную сложность. Завершается композиция теплым и обволакивающим финалом, в котором сладость ванили и бобов тонка гармонично переплетается с классическим звучанием амбры, мускуса, кедра и дубового мха. Этот насыщенный шлейф оставляет стойкое ощущение благородства и спокойной уверенности.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Night Dreams Silver is a multifaceted Oriental composition built on an intriguing contrast between sparkling fruity freshness and a deep, mossy woody trail. The fragrance opens with an energetic burst of bergamot and lemon, complemented by juicy accents of pineapple, black currant, and apple that create a vibrant and dynamic introduction. At the heart of the composition, an elegant bouquet of rose and jasmine blooms, its floral softness elegantly underscored by the earthy tones of patchouli, orris, and a smoky hint of birch. This combination imbues the fragrance with distinct depth and textural complexity. The fragrance concludes with a warm and enveloping finish, where the sweetness of vanilla and tonka bean harmoniously intertwines with the classic character of amber, musk, cedar, and oakmoss. This rich trail leaves a lingering impression of nobility and calm confidence.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:25:19.993Z"}}'::json),
  (5307, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.47167+00:00', 'Al Haramain Hayati Unisex Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/63f5a70e168bff53b904cf246bb4dade1b348e71f681f30474638c39b2477013.png', 'Al Haramain Hayati Unisex Eau De Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 36.22, '{"gtin":"6291100130177","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/3yqm5reDqKaTU2NFbmfJUX.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:27:25.738368+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/63f5a70e168bff53b904cf246bb4dade1b348e71f681f30474638c39b2477013.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:10.841277+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:27:31.550732+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:27:31.550732+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"6REW95","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Nutmeg"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:10.149Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Hayati — это глубокая восточная композиция, в которой искристая свежесть цитрусовых встречается с обволакивающим теплом пряностей и древесных смол. Аромат выстраивает динамичный контраст между бодрящим вступлением и чувственным, тягучим шлейфом. На старте композиция раскрывается ярким созвучием бергамота и лимона, чья цитрусовая прохлада подчеркнута пикантной остротой розового перца и согревающим кардамоном. Постепенно аромат переходит в цветочное сердце, где нежность розы и жасмина гармонично сочетается с травянистыми нюансами герани и пряным теплом мускатного ореха. Завершающий аккорд формирует богатое древесно-амбровое основание. Глубина уда и мягкость сандала в сочетании с ванильно-мускусным фоном создают стойкий и многогранный шлейф, подчеркивающий характер этого парфюма.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Hayati is a profound oriental composition where the sparkling freshness of citrus meets the enveloping warmth of spices and resinous woods. The fragrance builds a dynamic contrast between an invigorating opening and a sensual, lingering trail. The scent begins with a vibrant accord of bergamot and lemon, whose crisp coolness is accentuated by the piquant sharpness of pink pepper and warming cardamom. The fragrance evolves into a floral heart, where the delicacy of rose and jasmine blends harmoniously with the herbaceous nuances of geranium and the spicy warmth of nutmeg. The final accord forms a rich woody-amber base. The depth of oud and the smoothness of sandalwood, combined with a vanilla-musk foundation, create a lasting and multifaceted trail that defines the character of this perfume.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:26:35.530Z"}}'::json),
  (5328, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.47167+00:00', 'Al Haramain Faris Unisex Perfumed Oil', '/assets/img/generated-products/8200567c72f8479f4c02325ab927399375d5e6b15c46f8aca21c68c062ba2cf5.png', 'Al Haramain Faris Unisex Perfumed Oil 12ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 9.54, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/HBdxoQMmwJRf6xwUyz6ttA.jpg","gtin":"6291100136223","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:31:37.329734+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/8200567c72f8479f4c02325ab927399375d5e6b15c46f8aca21c68c062ba2cf5.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:17.918503+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:31:47.052456+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:31:47.052456+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"U5JinZkWbD","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Чёрный Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Уд","Сандал","Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Black Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Oud","Sandalwood","Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:16.263Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Faris — это яркое восточное парфюмерное масло, построенное на контрасте искристой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого пряно-древесного тепла. Его характер раскрывается постепенно, переходя от бодрящих акцентов к обволакивающей глубине. Композиция открывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным сочным ананасом и выразительной остротой черного перца с кардамоном. Постепенно на первый план выходит насыщенное «сердце», где бархатистая роза и утонченный жасмин переплетаются с прохладной зеленью герани и согревающим букетом корицы и мускатного ореха. Завершает звучание богатый шлейф, сотканный из благородного уда, сливочного сандала и землистых пачулей. Теплые аккорды амбры, мускуса и ванили смягчают древесную основу, придавая композиции округлость и стойкое ориентальное звучание.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Faris is a vibrant oriental perfumed oil built on the contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and deep spicy-woody warmth. Its character unfolds progressively, moving from invigorating top notes to an enveloping, rich depth. The composition opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, complemented by juicy pineapple and the striking sharpness of black pepper and cardamom. Gradually, a rich heart emerges where velvety rose and refined jasmine intertwine with the green nuances of geranium and a warming duet of cinnamon and nutmeg. The fragrance settles into a complex base woven from noble oud, creamy sandalwood, and earthy patchouli. Warm facets of amber, musk, and vanilla soften the woody core, leaving a smooth and lasting oriental trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:02.146Z"}}'::json),
