","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Уд","Ваниль","Мускус","Сандал","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Apple"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Oud","Vanilla","Musk","Sandalwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:06.425Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Amber Oud White Edition — это гармоничное сочетание искрящейся цитрусовой свежести и глубоких древесных аккордов. Аромат выстраивает элегантный контраст между острыми пряными полутонами и мягкой, обволакивающей базой. Композиция открывается энергичным всплеском бергамота и лимона, дополненным фруктовой сладостью яблока и деликатной остротой розового перца и кардамона. В сердце аромата расцветает классический цветочный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, который обретает теплоту благодаря пряным акцентам корицы и мускатного ореха. Завершает звучание богатый шлейф, в котором землистые оттенки пачули и древесная глубина уда сочетаются с кремовой мягкостью сандала, ванили, амбры и мускуса. Этот финальный аккорд оставляет стойкое ощущение тепла и утонченности.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Amber Oud White Edition is a harmonious balance between sparkling citrus freshness and profound woody accords. The fragrance builds an elegant contrast between sharp, spicy nuances and a soft, enveloping foundation. The composition opens with an energetic burst of bergamot and lemon, complemented by the crisp sweetness of apple and the delicate piquancy of pink pepper and cardamom. At the heart, a classic floral bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, gaining warmth through the spicy inclusion of cinnamon and nutmeg. The experience concludes with a rich trail where the earthy depth of patchouli and the woody character of oud are grounded by the creamy softness of sandalwood, vanilla, amber, and musk. This final accord leaves a lingering impression of warmth and sophistication.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:25:37.228Z"}}'::json),
  (5300, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.47167+00:00', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/596ded7f857afba23ef6886fce861dc511d01ac016267cbb8c7a9f767ebd1c9d.png', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud Eau De Parfum Spray 60ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 25.61, '{"gtin":"6291100131709","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Древесные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/83sEsHiG4SUgcGwdBx3zoM.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:52.569457+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/596ded7f857afba23ef6886fce861dc511d01ac016267cbb8c7a9f767ebd1c9d.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:07.217402+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:26:03.562573+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:26:03.562573+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"4qteZGxTZp","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Слива"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Кедр","Пачули"],"base":["Амбра","Уд","Ваниль","Мускус","Сандал"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Plum"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cedar","Patchouli"],"base":["Amber","Oud","Vanilla","Musk","Sandalwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:08.807Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Amber Oud — это выразительный древесный аромат, построенный на тонком балансе яркой фруктово-цитрусовой свежести и глубокого смолистого шлейфа. Он объединяет в себе динамичное начало и обволакивающее тепло восточной классики. Композиция раскрывается бодрящим коктейлем из цитрусов и спелых фруктов, где искристый бергамот и лимон переплетаются с сочными акцентами ананаса, яблока и сливы. Постепенно на первый план выходит изысканное «сердце» аромата, в котором классический дуэт розы и жасмина гармонично дополнен благородными древесными оттенками кедра и пачули. Завершает звучание богатая база, сотканная из глубоких нот амбры, удовой древесины, ванили, мускуса и сандала. Это сочетание создает мягкий, обволакивающий и долгий ориентальный след на коже.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Amber Oud is a striking woody fragrance built on a delicate balance between vibrant fruit-citrus freshness and a deep, resinous trail. It unites a dynamic opening with the enveloping warmth of eastern tradition. The composition unfolds with an invigorating cocktail of citrus and ripe fruits, where sparkling bergamot and lemon intertwine with juicy accents of pineapple, apple, and plum. Gradually, the refined heart comes forward, featuring a classical duet of rose and jasmine harmoniously complemented by noble woody nuances of cedar and patchouli. The fragrance concludes with a rich base woven from deep notes of amber, oud, vanilla, musk, and sandalwood. This combination leaves a smooth, enveloping, and lingering oriental trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:25:55.978Z"}}'::json),
  (5308, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.47167+00:00', 'Al Haramain L''Aventure Gold Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/8b1c8d81df7c1a84410172bcb99ce6e0b59955fc0bbee4da70199f47833abc5f.png', 'Al Haramain L''Aventure Gold Eau De Parfum Spray 200ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 18.04, '{"gtin":"6291100131747","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/PKC3YkgEFqfX6HQNdgSBqu.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:27:25.431142+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/8b1c8d81df7c1a84410172bcb99ce6e0b59955fc0bbee4da70199f47833abc5f.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:34:24.425075+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:27:31.410227+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:27:31.410227+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"Y1WNW5","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Грейпфрут"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Жасмин"],"base":["Амбра","Ваниль","Мускус","Пачули","Кедровая Древесина","Боб Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Grapefruit"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Jasmine"],"base":["Amber","Vanilla","Musk","Patchouli","Cedarwood","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:11.239Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain L''Aventure Gold — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой искристая цитрусовая свежесть встречается с глубоким, пряным теплом. Контраст между бодрящим стартом и обволакивающим древесно-амбровым шлейфом создает гармоничный и многогранный образ. Верхние ноты бергамота, лимона и грейпфрута создают яркий цитрусовый аккорд, подчеркнутый пикантными искрами розового перца и кардамона. Постепенно аромат раскрывается в сердце, где цветочные грани лаванды, герани и жасмина переплетаются с теплотой корицы и мускатного ореха. База аромата оставляет стойкий след из амбры, ванили, мускуса и пачули, дополненный древесными оттенками кедра и мягкой сладостью бобов тонка.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain L''Aventure Gold is a sophisticated oriental composition where sparkling citrus freshness meets deep, spicy warmth. The contrast between a vibrant opening and an enveloping woody-amber trail creates a harmonious and multifaceted olfactory profile. The fragrance begins with a sharp, bright blend of bergamot, lemon, and grapefruit, highlighted by the piquant flickers of pink pepper and cardamom. As it develops, the heart reveals a velvety floral character of lavender, geranium, and jasmine, skillfully balanced by the piquant warmth of cinnamon and nutmeg. The base settles into a rich, lingering foundation of amber, vanilla, musk, and patchouli, grounded by the earthy strength of cedarwood and the smooth, gourmand touch of tonka bean.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:26:51.625Z"}}'::json),
  (5287, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.47167+00:00', 'Al Haramain Madinah Pure Perfume Oil', '/assets/img/generated-products/7df07fc0ced90e485b9badfeb1a629d98555bcff6f156d194eedf5dc2bd0ea72.png', 'Al Haramain Madinah Pure Perfume Oil 15ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 7.99, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Роза · Шафран · Уд · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/mYeY5L8XNY9Rb8KLtkxUa2.jpg","gtin":"6291100133666","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:22:39.787224+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/7df07fc0ced90e485b9badfeb1a629d98555bcff6f156d194eedf5dc2bd0ea72.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:00.087565+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T14:53:00.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T14:53:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:22:51.552530+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:22:51.552530+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"08NXWQ","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Роза","Шафран","Бергамот","Лимон"],"heart":["Уд","Сандал","Жасмин","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Rose","Saffron","Bergamot","Lemon"],"heart":["Oud","Sandalwood","Jasmine","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:05.120Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Rose · Saffron · Oud · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Madinah — это многогранная восточная композиция, в которой классическая цветочная свежесть сталкивается с глубоким древесным теплом. Аромат открывается ярким всплеском бергамота и лимона, чья искристая кислинка мягко смягчается бархатистыми лепестками розы и пряным оттенком шафрана. В сердце композиции раскрывается насыщенный древесный аккорд: землистые нюансы уда и кедра обретают сливочную мягкость благодаря сандалу и деликатному цветочному флеру жасмина. Это сочетание создает плотный, но гармоничный переход к основным нотам. Завершает звучание чувственный шлейф, в котором сладость ванили встречается с глубиной амбры, мускуса и пачули. Такое сочетание придает аромату стойкость и характерную восточную теплоту, оставляя на коже мягкий, обволакивающий след.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Madinah is a multifaceted oriental composition where classic floral brightness meets deep, resonant woodiness. The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of bergamot and lemon, whose sparkling citrus edge is softened by the velvety texture of rose petals and a distinct touch of saffron. At the heart, a robust woody structure takes center stage: the earthy intensity of oud and cedar finds a creamy balance through sandalwood and the subtle, ethereal presence of jasmine. This transition bridges the initial freshness with the fragrance’s more substantial core. The dry down leaves a sensual trail where the sweetness of vanilla intertwines with the rich warmth of amber, musk, and patchouli. This final composition provides a lasting, sophisticated presence, grounding the scent in a smooth and enveloping finish.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:25:23.041Z"}}'::json),
  (5317, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.47167+00:00', 'Al Haramain L''Aventure Rose Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/b5b76c15e061cd300ddb1329f808b32845280e5b03fc28ce27067ef0548cd84b.png', 'Al Haramain L''Aventure Rose Eau De Parfum Spray 200ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 23.13, '{"gtin":"6291100131594","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Цветочные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/4qU5WVgzz6cp4Hrxg3TLQJ.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Роза · Бергамот · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:29:11.043125+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/b5b76c15e061cd300ddb1329f808b32845280e5b03fc28ce27067ef0548cd84b.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:14.641740+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:29:23.233854+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:29:23.233854+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"KLKVW6","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Роза","Бергамот","Чёрная Смородина","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Роза","Пион","Жасмин","Герань"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Пачули","Ваниль","Кедровая Древесина"]},"en":{"top":["Rose","Bergamot","Black Currant","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Rose","Peony","Jasmine","Geranium"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Patchouli","Vanilla","Cedarwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:06.511Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Rose · Bergamot · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain L''Aventure Rose — это многогранная цветочная композиция, в которой классическая элегантность розы встречается с дерзкой остротой специй и ягодной терпкостью. Аромат балансирует между утонченной нежностью лепестков и глубоким, уверенным древесно-мускусным шлейфом. Первое впечатление раскрывается искристой свежестью бергамота, дополненной пикантными искрами розового перца и сочной кислинкой черной смородины, на фоне которой сразу заявляет о себе королева композиции — роза. По мере раскрытия сердце аромата наполняется пышным цветочным букетом: к розовым аккордам присоединяются травянистые нюансы герани, шелковистая мягкость пиона и чувственные переливы жасмина. Завершает звучание теплая база, где смолистые ноты амбры и пачули переплетаются с древесной строгостью кедра. Ванильная сладость и пудровый мускус создают стойкий, обволакивающий финиш, придавая композиции завершенность и благородную глубину.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain L''Aventure Rose is a multifaceted floral composition where the classic elegance of the rose meets the bold zest of spices and the tartness of berries. The fragrance strikes a perfect balance between the refined softness of delicate petals and a profound, assertive woody-musky trail. The initial impression unfolds with the sparkling freshness of bergamot, accented by the piquant sparks of pink pepper and the succulent acidity of black currant, against which the rose immediately asserts its presence. As the scent evolves, the heart blossoms into a lush floral bouquet: the rose notes are joined by the herbaceous nuances of geranium, the silky softness of peony, and the sensuous undertones of jasmine. The dry-down reveals a warm base where the resinous depth of amber and patchouli intertwines with the woody structure of cedar. A touch of vanilla sweetness and powdery musk creates a lingering, enveloping finish, lending the composition a sense of poise and noble depth.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:27:24.603Z"}}'::json),
  (5335, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Batoul Attar Perfume Oil', '/assets/img/generated-products/dceef36465ee850edd7b064721b36da17b9a4ee4bbb1db651425aaf7de66a3e1.png', 'Al Haramain Batoul Attar Perfume Oil 12ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 14.21, '{"gtin":"6291100138074","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/hefin9uf8cU2BBd3RneLVt.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Роза · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:33:38.841739+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/dceef36465ee850edd7b064721b36da17b9a4ee4bbb1db651425aaf7de66a3e1.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:19.995290+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:33:45.417497+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:33:45.417497+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"K4KX03","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Роза","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Уд","Герань"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Rose","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Oud","Geranium"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:17.441Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Batoul — это изысканная восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте искристой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого, обволакивающего тепла драгоценных смол. Аромат открывается ярким всплеском бергамота и лимона, которые смягчаются благородной пряностью шафрана и нежным цветочным оттенком розы. В сердце композиции раскрывается насыщенный букет из жасмина, герани и классической розы, дополненный характерным дымным звучанием уда. Завершается аромат плотным шлейфом из чувственного мускуса, теплой амбры и сливочного сандала, где ваниль и пачули добавляют финальный акцент глубины и стойкости.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Batoul is a sophisticated oriental composition built on the contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and the deep, enveloping warmth of precious resins. The fragrance opens with a vibrant burst of bergamot and lemon, softened by the noble spice of saffron and the delicate floral nuance of rose. The heart reveals a rich bouquet of jasmine, geranium, and classic rose, complemented by the characteristic smoky depth of oud. The scent concludes with a dense trail of sensual musk, warm amber, and creamy sandalwood, where vanilla and patchouli provide a final touch of richness and lasting presence.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:12.678Z"}}'::json),
  (5341, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Royal Musk Women''s Eau De Parfum Spray Unisex Fragrance', '/assets/img/generated-products/469f0849c882c31496e8a8d63f772239a50da8958dccc62b526b3e110541d3fa.png', 'Al Haramain Royal Musk 100ml Women''s Eau De Parfum Spray Unisex Fragrance — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 24.58, '{"gtin":"6291100130979","gender":"Женский","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/9qZFPnYFJu3UX2rKSgtvAQ.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:34:20.452546+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/469f0849c882c31496e8a8d63f772239a50da8958dccc62b526b3e110541d3fa.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:22.281055+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:34:27.557593+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:34:27.557593+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"W6V3LX","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Альдегиды","Зелёные Ноты"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Ландыш","Ирис","Иланг-иланг"],"base":["Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Амбра","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Aldehydes","Green Notes"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Lily of the Valley","Iris","Ylang-ylang"],"base":["Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Amber","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:18.065Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Royal Musk — это изысканная восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте кристальной чистоты альдегидов и глубокой, обволакивающей чувственности. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и лимона, дополненным свежестью зеленых нот, которые в сочетании с альдегидами создают ощущение безупречной свежести. В сердце композиции расцветает пышный цветочный букет. Нежная роза и жасмин переплетаются с утонченными аккордами ландыша, пудрового ириса и экзотического иланг-иланга, придавая звучанию благородную мягкость и женственность. Завершает этот ольфакторный образ теплый, тягучий шлейф. Древесные оттенки сандала и кедра гармонично сливаются с мягкостью мускуса, сладостью ванили и смолистым теплом янтаря, оставляя на коже стойкий и притягательный след.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Royal Musk is a refined oriental composition that balances the crystalline clarity of aldehydes with deep, enveloping sensuality. The fragrance opens with a sparkling duet of bergamot and lemon, heightened by crisp green notes that work alongside aldehydes to evoke a sensation of pristine freshness. At the heart, a lush floral bouquet unfolds. Delicate rose and jasmine entwine with the nuanced elegance of lily of the valley, powdery iris, and exotic ylang-ylang, lending the scent a sophisticated, velvety character. The fragrance concludes with a warm, lingering trail. The woody depth of sandalwood and cedar blends seamlessly into the softness of musk, the sweetness of vanilla, and the resinous warmth of amber, grounding the composition in a lasting, magnetic base.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:20.565Z"}}'::json),
