texture of sandalwood and cedar intertwines with the sweetness of vanilla, while a sensual combination of amber and musk leaves a soft, lingering finish on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:29:01.108Z"}}'::json),
