ец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Амбра","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Amber","Cedar","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:00.519Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain L''Aventure Women — это яркая восточная композиция, в которой искристая свежесть цитрусов встречается с глубиной чувственных цветочных и древесных аккордов. Аромат открывается бодрящим сочетанием бергамота, мандарина и розового перца, дополненным сладковатым фруктовым нюансом личи. В сердце раскрывается нежный букет из розы, жасмина, пиона и фрезии, придающий композиции утонченную женственность и цветочную мягкость. Постепенно аромат переходит в теплый, обволакивающий шлейф. База из мускуса, ванили и амбры в сочетании с древесными нотами кедра и пачули оставляет на коже стойкий, глубокий след, подчеркивающий восточный характер этой парфюмерной воды.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain L''Aventure Women is a vibrant oriental composition that balances sparkling citrus freshness with the depth of sensual floral and woody accords. The fragrance opens with an invigorating blend of bergamot, mandarin orange, and pink pepper, accented by the sweet, exotic nuance of litchi. At the heart, a delicate bouquet of rose, jasmine, peony, and freesia unfolds, lending the scent a refined, velvety floral character. The transition into the base is seamless, revealing a grounding structure of cedar and earthy patchouli. Finally, the fragrance settles into a warm, lingering trail of musk, vanilla, and amber, providing a rich and sophisticated finish that defines its distinct oriental identity.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:34.917Z"}}'::json),
  (5353, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud Extreme Gold Edition Extrait De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/106ec9af49874f391a35087960e19600aa6c7450fc67001227076a429f8ebe4e.png', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud Extreme Gold Edition Extrait De Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 35.11, '{"gtin":"6291106813067","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Древесные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/VdLrsrVM4ao952epnASZuy.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Ананас · Роза · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:36:52.996300+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/106ec9af49874f391a35087960e19600aa6c7450fc67001227076a429f8ebe4e.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:28.532432+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:37:02.120939+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:37:02.120939+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"O19LO9","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Уд","Ваниль","Мускус","Сандал","Боб Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Oud","Vanilla","Musk","Sandalwood","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:20.919Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pineapple · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Extreme Gold Edition — это насыщенная древесная композиция, в которой искристая фруктовая свежесть встречается с глубоким, обволакивающим теплом восточных смол. Аромат раскрывается динамичным аккордом бергамота, лимона и черной смородины, дополненным сочными нотами ананаса и яблока, создающими яркое и энергичное начало. В сердце парфюма расцветает изысканный букет из розы и жасмина, который обретает особую глубину благодаря дымным нюансам березы, землистым акцентам пачули и строгим кедровым полутонам. Эта гармоничная структура плавно переходит в чувственный шлейф, где доминируют благородный уд, сливочный сандал и теплая амбра. Завершающие ноты ванили, мускуса и бобов тонка придают аромату стойкость и бархатистую мягкость, оставляя после себя запоминающийся древесный след.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Extreme Gold Edition is a sophisticated woody composition defined by the striking contrast between sparkling fruit brightness and the profound, resonant warmth of precious resins. The fragrance opens with a vibrant citrus fusion of bergamot and lemon, softened by the crisp, succulent sweetness of pineapple, apple, and black currant. As the scent evolves, a floral heart of rose and jasmine emerges, grounding itself in the smoky, textured character of birch, earthy patchouli, and clean cedar. This complex transition leads into a rich, lingering base where the intensity of oud and amber meets the creamy smoothness of sandalwood. Hints of vanilla, musk, and tonka bean provide a velvety finish, ensuring a balanced and enduring trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:51.072Z"}}'::json),
  (5363, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Manege Rouge Eau De Parfum For Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/325600beddb65f2f9873cb8b2ec5b02f86777f757be771334ce976b1dfc6e255.png', 'Al Haramain Manege Rouge Eau De Parfum 75ml For Women — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 30.18, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/SkFa4xQymPumkScVZS2doE.jpg","gtin":"6291100131303","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:29:57.163088+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/325600beddb65f2f9873cb8b2ec5b02f86777f757be771334ce976b1dfc6e255.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:34:26.368447+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:06.981546+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:06.981546+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"X2265L","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Амбра","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Amber","Cedarwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:23.468Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Manege Rouge — это яркая восточная композиция, построенная на изысканном контрасте искристых фруктовых аккордов и глубокого пряного шлейфа. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим сочетанием бергамота, мандарина и экзотического личи, дополненным пикантным акцентом розового перца. В сердце парфюма расцветает пышный букет из розы, жасмина, пиона и фрезии, придающий звучанию женственную мягкость и цветочную глубину. Эта цветочная гармония плавно перетекает в обволакивающую базу. Финальный аккорд согревает теплом ванили и амбры, переплетаясь с древесными нотами кедра и землистыми оттенками пачули. Завершающий шлейф мускуса придает композиции стойкость и чувственное очарование.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Manege Rouge is a vibrant oriental composition defined by a sophisticated contrast between sparkling citrus-fruity top notes and a deep, spicy foundation. The fragrance opens with a lively blend of bergamot, mandarin orange, and exotic litchi, sharpened by the subtle warmth of pink pepper. At the heart, a lush bouquet of rose, jasmine, peony, and freesia unfolds, lending the scent a velvety floral character and elegant complexity. This floral core transitions seamlessly into a richer, more grounded narrative. The base settles into a warm embrace of vanilla and amber, balanced by the structured depth of cedarwood and earthy patchouli. A final trail of musk rounds out the composition, leaving a lingering, soft, and resonant impression.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:29:13.663Z"}}'::json),
  (5366, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Portfolio Royale Stallion Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/8b18eb4f1eb6df4688221a463255a4d3ee8a8d9635eddb7481e0d20c782788df.png', 'Al Haramain Portfolio Royale Stallion Eau De Parfum Spray 75ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 45.02, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Ананас · Берёза · Дубовый Мох","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/o4rr6h3j2wPHVgnyeUYHc3.jpg","gtin":"6291100130825","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:09.803284+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/8b18eb4f1eb6df4688221a463255a4d3ee8a8d9635eddb7481e0d20c782788df.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:34:26.734822+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:16.986743+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:16.986743+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"HhPagdyw7z","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина","Лимон"],"heart":["Берёза","Пачули","Жасмин","Роза","Кедр"],"base":["Дубовый Мох","Мускус","Амбра","Ваниль","Кожа"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant","Lemon"],"heart":["Birch","Patchouli","Jasmine","Rose","Cedar"],"base":["Oakmoss","Musk","Amber","Vanilla","Leather"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:24.321Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pineapple · Birch · Oakmoss","descriptionRu":"Royale Stallion от Al Haramain — это выразительная восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте искристой фруктовой свежести и глубокого, благородного кожаного шлейфа. Аромат открывается динамичным аккордом из бергамота, лимона, ананаса, яблока и черной смородины, создавая яркий и энергичный первый акцент. В сердце композиции раскрывается изысканное сочетание древесных нот березы и кедра, дополненное землистыми оттенками пачули и нежным цветочным дуэтом жасмина и розы. Это развитие придает аромату структурность и глубину, плавно переходя к более тяжелому основанию. Завершающий шлейф окутывает теплом амбры, ванили и мускуса, в то время как дубовый мох и кожа придают звучанию маскулинную строгость. Этот гармоничный баланс между фруктовой легкостью и плотными анималистическими акцентами создает стойкий и узнаваемый характер.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain’s Royale Stallion is a bold Oriental composition defined by the contrast between sparkling fruity brightness and a deep, sophisticated leather finish. The fragrance opens with a dynamic blend of bergamot, lemon, pineapple, apple, and black currant, offering an immediate and energetic sensory impression. As the scent evolves, it reveals a refined heart of birch and cedar, balanced by the earthy nuances of patchouli and the delicate floral character of jasmine and rose. This transition introduces structural depth, guiding the fragrance toward its more substantial foundation. The base settles into a warm, lingering trail of amber, vanilla, and musk, while notes of oakmoss and leather ground the scent with a firm, masculine edge. This careful equilibrium between effervescent top notes and a rich, grounded base creates a distinct and enduring presence.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:29:19.601Z"}}'::json),
  (5343, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud Black Edition Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/e8130d2bc87bd297d702d081eee92b588c4833cc54bbd17917d42de2de9b0428.png', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud Black Edition Eau De Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 26.78, '{"gtin":"6291100132317","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Древесные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/GCvsUzuVyZkU9vd46MDCoC.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Чёрный Перец · Роза · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:34:46.019344+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/e8130d2bc87bd297d702d081eee92b588c4833cc54bbd17917d42de2de9b0428.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:22.906064+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:34:58.000053+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:34:58.000053+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"53VW4L","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Чёрный Перец","Кардамон","Ананас","Яблоко"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Кедр","Пачули","Ирис"],"base":["Амбра","Уд","Ваниль","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Бобы Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Black Pepper","Cardamom","Pineapple","Apple"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cedar","Patchouli","Orris"],"base":["Amber","Oud","Vanilla","Musk","Sandalwood","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:13.513Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Black Pepper · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Black Edition — это глубокая древесная композиция, построенная на выразительном контрасте между искристой фруктовой свежестью и плотным, обволакивающим теплом восточных смол. Аромат открывается энергичным сочетанием цитрусовой горечи бергамота, пряного черного перца и кардамона, которые гармонично дополняются сочными аккордами ананаса и яблока. В сердце композиции раскрывается изысканный цветочный букет из розы и жасмина, чья нежность подчеркнута землистыми оттенками ириса и строгими древесными нотами кедра и пачули. Это сочетание придает аромату необходимую структурность и утонченность, подготавливая почву для глубокого финала. Завершающий аккорд представляет собой мягкий и стойкий шлейф, в котором доминируют классические восточные компоненты: драгоценный уд, теплая амбра и сливочный сандал. Ваниль, мускус и бобы тонка придают базе бархатистую глубину, оставляя ощущение благородной сладости и древесной насыщенности.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Black Edition is a profound woody composition defined by the stark contrast between sparkling fruit freshness and the dense, enveloping warmth of oriental resins. The fragrance opens with an energetic blend of bitter bergamot, piquant black pepper, and cardamom, seamlessly balanced by the succulent presence of pineapple and crisp apple. At the heart, a sophisticated floral bouquet of rose and jasmine emerges, its delicacy sharpened by the earthy nuances of orris and the structured, resinous qualities of cedar and patchouli. This transition adds complexity and refinement to the scent profile, grounding the initial brightness. The dry down creates a soft yet enduring trail dominated by classic oriental elements: precious oud, warm amber, and creamy sandalwood. Notes of vanilla, musk, and tonka bean provide a velvety depth to the base, leaving a lingering impression of noble sweetness and woody intensity.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:28.327Z"}}'::json),
