ry, refined notes of peony and freesia. This floral core lends the scent a graceful femininity, guiding the development toward a richer base. The fragrance concludes with an alluring foundation of creamy sandalwood and smooth vanilla, enhanced by the golden depth of amber and the soft, lingering presence of musk. This final trail settles beautifully on the skin, leaving a lasting impression that defines the fragrance’s harmonious and balanced profile.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:32:08.369Z"}}'::json),
  (5350, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.597778+00:00', 'Al Haramain Haramain Das Ziel Glanz Extrait De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/6ab545741e05b11da1fdaa18956b83b5272c5cb61cd49d7591ed2794cebdb513.png', 'Al Haramain Haramain Das Ziel Glanz Extrait De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 24.1, '{"gtin":"6291106814491","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/PERCbrr9JB76mqqybiqWVu.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:36:18.605439+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/6ab545741e05b11da1fdaa18956b83b5272c5cb61cd49d7591ed2794cebdb513.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:26.314892+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:36:27.515367+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:36:27.515367+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"ffad7aeba24e41d69461124760f05c25","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Кедровое Дерево","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Cedarwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:19.852Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Das Ziel Glanz — это восточный аромат, балансирующий между искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким пряным теплом. Его характер определяется динамичным переходом от прохладных травянистых акцентов к роскошному цветочно-древесному шлейфу. Композиция раскрывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, дополненным пикантной остротой розового перца и кардамона, которые гармонично уравновешиваются спокойным звучанием лаванды. В сердце аромата расцветает изысканный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, чью цветочную мягкость подчеркивают пряные нюансы корицы и мускатного ореха. Завершается звучание плотной, обволакивающей базой, где теплая амбра и сладковатая ваниль сливаются с землистыми оттенками пачули. Древесные ноты сандала и кедра в сочетании с чувственным мускусом создают устойчивый и элегантный финал, придающий аромату особую глубину.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Das Ziel Glanz is an oriental fragrance that balances sparkling citrus freshness with profound spicy depth. Its character is defined by a dynamic transition from cool, herbaceous accents to a rich, velvety floral and woody trail. The composition opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the piquant bite of pink pepper and cardamom, all harmoniously grounded by the soothing presence of lavender. At the heart, a sophisticated bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, its floral softness deepened by the warm, aromatic nuances of cinnamon and nutmeg. The fragrance concludes with a dense, enveloping base where warm amber and sweet vanilla merge with the earthy character of patchouli. Subtle woody undertones of sandalwood and cedar, layered with a sensual musk, create a lasting and elegant finish that imbues the scent with remarkable resonance.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:28:43.939Z"}}'::json),
