Кардамон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Шафран","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Уд","Мускус","Ваниль","Сандал"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Saffron","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Oud","Musk","Vanilla","Sandalwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:25.465Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Collection X 4 — это гармоничное сочетание искристой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого древесного тепла, создающее выразительный контраст между пряной энергией и мягкой восточной чувственностью. Композиция открывается бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и лимона, дополненным пикантными искрами розового перца и прохладным акцентом кардамона. По мере раскрытия аромат обретает цветочную глубину благодаря бархатистому жасмину и нежной розе, которые переплетаются с благородным шафраном и строгими древесными нотами кедра. Финальный аккорд окутывает шлейфом из драгоценного уда и амбры, смягченных сливочным сандалом, ванилью и чистым мускусом, оставляя на коже долгое и обволакивающее послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Collection X 4 balances the vibrant energy of sparkling citrus with the resonant depth of precious woods, creating a sophisticated tension between piquant spice and velvety oriental warmth. The fragrance opens with a crisp, invigorating blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the lively heat of pink pepper and cool cardamom. As the heart unfolds, a floral infusion of rose and jasmine emerges, enriched by the leathery nuances of saffron and the structured elegance of cedarwood. The dry down is defined by a rich, enduring foundation of amber and oud, rounded out by the creamy sweetness of vanilla, sandalwood, and a soft, lingering trail of musk.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:29:34.605Z"}}'::json),
  (5383, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.731707+00:00', 'Al Haramain Hayati Perfume Oil Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/cf4bad25ffe8e911c03c2a2cb91ed3df2999b12ebb5358223a1049aae56af329.png', 'Al Haramain Hayati Perfume Oil 12ml Unisex — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 47.1, '{"gtin":"6291100138883","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/E7P8g6qbpStZcfcGNKePC8.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:42:41.682615+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/cf4bad25ffe8e911c03c2a2cb91ed3df2999b12ebb5358223a1049aae56af329.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:40.730486+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:42:49.072272+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:42:49.072272+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"4dSdSurBUn","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Шафран"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Saffron"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:27.242Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Hayati — это гармоничное восточное масло, в котором яркая искристая свежесть цитрусов встречается с глубоким и обволакивающим теплом пряностей. Аромат балансирует на грани бодрящей динамики и благородной древесной мягкости. Композиция открывается бодрящими верхними нотами лимона и бергамота, мгновенно дополненными пикантной остротой розового перца и благородным теплом кардамона. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат переходит в сердце, где царит классический цветочный ансамбль из розы и жасмина, искусно подчеркнутый травянистой свежестью герани и пряной терпкостью шафрана. В завершении на коже остается плотный и сложный шлейф, построенный на глубоких оттенках уда, смолистой амбры и сливочного сандала. Чувственный мускус и сладковатая ваниль завершают звучание, придавая ему округлость и стойкое притяжение.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Hayati is a balanced oriental perfume oil where bright sparkling citrus freshness meets deep, enveloping warm spices. The fragrance delicately balances between invigorating dynamics and noble woody softness. The composition opens with zesty top notes of lemon and bergamot, instantly enhanced by the piquant bite of pink pepper and the refined warmth of cardamom. As it develops, the scent transitions into a heart dominated by a classic floral duet of rose and jasmine, artfully accented by the herbaceous freshness of geranium and the spicy dryness of saffron. Settling on the skin, it leaves a rich and complex trail built on deep facets of oud, resinous amber, and creamy sandalwood. Sensual musk and sweet vanilla round out the finish, lending the fragrance a smooth and lasting presence.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:29:58.312Z"}}'::json),
  (5404, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.731707+00:00', 'Al Absar Shahoor Platinum Eau De Parfum, Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/a0382ca6c4667845a0d1f5a234533262e12971451101d9b1949b5bdced40571a.png', 'Al Absar Shahoor Platinum Eau De Parfum, Unisex, 100 Ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 10.84, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/Us9gALaRchEnksKfF2Pv9Q.jpg","gtin":"5055810056377","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:46:27.720559+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/a0382ca6c4667845a0d1f5a234533262e12971451101d9b1949b5bdced40571a.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:50.607205+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:46:33.534042+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:46:33.534042+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"48ec8222f05643aeb9941ea71a65ba72","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Мускатный Орех","Корица"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Кедровое Дерево","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Nutmeg","Cinnamon"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Cedarwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:31.661Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Absar Shahoor Platinum от Al Haramain — это динамичная восточная композиция, в которой искристая цитрусовая свежесть встречается с пряным теплом древесных аккордов. Аромат воплощает собой баланс между прохладной чистотой и глубокой чувственностью. Начало раскрывается ярким дуэтом бергамота и лимона, дополненным бодрящим розовым перцем, кардамоном и лавандой, создающими энергичный и пряный старт. Постепенно композиция переходит в цветочное сердце, где нежные ноты розы и жасмина гармонично сочетаются с травянисто-цветочной геранью, подчеркнутой теплыми акцентами мускатного ореха и корицы. Завершает звучание богатый шлейф, построенный на мягкой базе из амбры, мускуса и сливочного сандала. Древесные оттенки кедра в сочетании со сладковатой ванилью и землистыми нотами пачули придают аромату завершенность, оставляя на коже притягательный и стойкий след.","descriptionEn":"Al Absar Shahoor Platinum by Al Haramain is a dynamic oriental composition where sparkling citrus freshness meets the warm depth of woody accords. The fragrance embodies a refined balance between crisp, clean top notes and a rich, sensual foundation. It opens with a vibrant duet of bergamot and lemon, invigorated by the sharp spice of pink pepper, cardamom, and aromatic lavender for an energetic introduction. The scent then transitions into a floral heart, where the delicate presence of rose and jasmine intertwines with the herbal nuances of geranium, sharpened by the subtle heat of nutmeg and cinnamon. The experience concludes with a substantial dry down centered on amber, musk, and creamy sandalwood. Earthy patchouli and the structural elegance of cedarwood are softened by a touch of vanilla, resulting in a persistent and captivating trail that lingers on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:30:38.365Z"}}'::json),
