3+00:00"}},"variantFid":"DZLE53","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Зелёные Ноты"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Иланг-иланг","Герань","Ирис"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Ваниль","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Green Notes"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Ylang-ylang","Geranium","Orris"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Cedarwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:28.381Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Maryam Eau De Parfum Spray раскрывается ярким цитрусовым аккордом с пряными искрами розового перца и кардамона, смягченными сочной свежестью зеленых нот. В сердце композиции распускается богатый и многогранный цветочный букет из розы, жасмина, иланг-иланга, герани и пудрового ириса. Шлейф обволакивает глубоким древесным теплом сандала и кедра в обрамлении чувственного мускуса, амбры, ванили и пачули.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Maryam Eau De Parfum Spray opens with a vibrant citrus burst accented by the spicy facets of pink pepper and cardamom, balanced by crisp green notes. The heart unfolds into a rich, velvety floral bouquet featuring rose, jasmine, ylang-ylang, geranium, and powdery orris. The drydown settles into a deep, warm base of sandalwood and cedarwood, intertwined with sensual musk, amber, vanilla, and patchouli.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:30:00.304Z"}}'::json),
  (5399, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.731707+00:00', 'Al Haramain Musk Noir Perfume Oil', '/assets/img/generated-products/85a1d06e4b4d5e9976877ef53bbbb9346f2202fed1aeab11847966cac8315ae0.png', 'Al Haramain Musk Noir Perfume Oil 12ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 9.51, '{"gtin":"6291100130818","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/VgTQU3UCYEpNmGDLbYwBdG.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Мускус","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:45:37.947200+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/85a1d06e4b4d5e9976877ef53bbbb9346f2202fed1aeab11847966cac8315ae0.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:48.481903+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:45:45.015339+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:45:45.015339+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"D4LXL4","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Шафран","Мускатный Орех"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Кедровое Дерево"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Saffron","Nutmeg"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Cedarwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:31.278Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Musk Noir — это утонченная интерпретация восточной классики, где пронзительная цитрусовая свежесть встречается с глубоким, пульсирующим теплом пряностей. Аромат выстраивает сложный баланс между холодным блеском начальных нот и обволакивающей мягкостью древесно-мускусного шлейфа. Композиция открывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, чья искристая терпкость мгновенно смягчается благородным шафраном и сухим теплом мускатного ореха. Этот контрастный старт плавно переходит в цветочное «сердце», где классический дуэт розы и жасмина обретает характерную строгость благодаря герани и пикантным акцентам корицы. Постепенно аромат обретает глубину, раскрываясь плотной базой из сливочного сандала, кедра и ванили. Финальный аккорд, сотканный из амбры и чувственного мускуса, оставляет на коже стойкий, бархатистый след, подчеркивающий многогранность и сдержанную элегантность композиции.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Musk Noir is a sophisticated interpretation of Oriental classics, where piercing citrus freshness meets the deep, pulsating warmth of spices. The fragrance strikes a precise balance between the cool brilliance of its opening and the enveloping softness of its woody-musky trail. The composition begins with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, whose sparkling tartness is instantly tempered by noble saffron and the dry warmth of nutmeg. This contrasting opening flows seamlessly into a floral heart, where the classic duo of rose and jasmine gains a distinctive edge from geranium and spicy hints of cinnamon. The fragrance gradually acquires depth, revealing a dense base of creamy sandalwood, cedarwood, and vanilla. A final accord, woven from amber and sensual musk, leaves a persistent, velvety trail on the skin that underscores the complexity and restrained elegance of the blend.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:30:34.114Z"}}'::json),
  (5421, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.731707+00:00', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud - Gold Lux Extrait De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/578223c87faeaf58f138f01e24a88a2f70eab798ee0c96ee5bda5bf1af08db47.png', 'Al Haramain Amber Oud - Gold Lux Extrait De Parfum Spray 3.4 oz — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 53.99, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/HXtetNAjNP5mP6h8zUmMtb.jpg","gtin":"6291106816860","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T17:49:16.771114+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/578223c87faeaf58f138f01e24a88a2f70eab798ee0c96ee5bda5bf1af08db47.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:46:58.276499+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:25:17.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:25:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:49:26.237683+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:49:26.237683+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"d8f57d7ba3914fc48b39d24221dd5974","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Шафран"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Уд","Сандал","Пачули","Ваниль","Мускус","Лабданум"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Saffron"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Oud","Sandalwood","Patchouli","Vanilla","Musk","Labdanum"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:33.480Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Gold Lux Extrait De Parfum — это глубокая древесная композиция, в которой искристая свежесть цитрусов встречается с обволакивающим теплом пряностей и смол. Аромат играет на контрасте между бодрящим стартом и величественным, тягучим шлейфом. Композиция открывается энергичным всплеском бергамота и лимона, чью прохладу подчеркивают острые акценты розового перца, шафрана и кардамона. Этот начальный импульс постепенно смягчается, уступая место цветочно-пряному сердцу, где бархатистая роза и жасмин переплетаются с пикантными нотами корицы, мускатного ореха и герани. Завершает звучание богатая база, построенная вокруг драгоценного уда и сливочного сандала. Мягкость ванили и мускуса в сочетании с землистыми оттенками пачули, амбры и лабданума придают парфюму глубину, создавая стойкий и благородный древесный характер.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Amber Oud Gold Lux Extrait De Parfum is a profound woody composition where the sparkling freshness of citrus meets the enveloping warmth of spices and resins. The fragrance balances a vibrant, energetic opening against a majestic, lingering base. It begins with an invigorating burst of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the piquant nuances of pink pepper, saffron, and cardamom. This initial brightness gradually mellows into a floral-spicy heart, where velvety rose and jasmine entwine with the warmth of cinnamon, nutmeg, and geranium. The fragrance settles into a rich, grounded base defined by precious oud and creamy sandalwood. Notes of vanilla and musk, layered with the earthy depth of patchouli, amber, and labdanum, bestow a lasting, noble character upon this complex woody scent.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:31:04.326Z"}}'::json),
  (5395, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.731707+00:00', 'Al Haramain Natural Oud Perfume for Women and Cologne for Men - Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/e5808278dbe4383f0bf8e2225a80e8e1274af5c4b559737de8dfd1a4b66c0f50.png', 'Al Haramain Natural Oud Perfume for Women and Cologne for Men - Unisex — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 33.08, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Уд · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/ntbb8r6CqpQj7gECCuwayh.jpg","gtin":"6291106814552","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:31:09.320727+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/e5808278dbe4383f0bf8e2225a80e8e1274af5c4b559737de8dfd1a4b66c0f50.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:34:28.326853+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:31:14.311087+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:31:14.311087+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"ff721adfeff849778cf79ac067cb5100","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Роза","Мускатный Орех"],"heart":["Уд","Роза","Жасмин","Кедровая Древесина"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Rose","Nutmeg"],"heart":["Oud","Rose","Jasmine","Cedarwood"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:30.318Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Oud · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Natural Oud представляет собой гармоничный союз пряной остроты и глубокой древесной теплоты, создающий сбалансированный восточный профиль. Это аромат контрастов, где холодные цитрусовые искры встречаются с густой, обволакивающей текстурой драгоценных смол. Композиция открывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и мускатного ореха, дополненным кожаным нюансом шафрана и мягким цветочным отголоском розы. Постепенно аромат раскрывается более насыщенным сердцем, в котором доминирует дымный аккорд уда, сплетающийся с элегантным жасмином, классической розой и строгими древесными нотами кедра. Завершает звучание богатый шлейф, в котором сливочные оттенки сандала и ванили смягчаются землистым пачули. Теплая база из амбры и мускуса придает композиции завершенность, оставляя на коже стойкий и благородный древесный отпечаток.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Natural Oud offers a sophisticated balance between spicy sharpness and deep woody warmth, defining a versatile oriental profile. It is a fragrance of deliberate contrasts, where bright citrus sparks meet the dense, enveloping texture of precious resins. The composition opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and nutmeg, accented by the leathery nuance of saffron and a delicate floral hint of rose. As the scent evolves, it reveals a more profound heart dominated by a smoky oud accord, seamlessly woven with elegant jasmine, classic rose, and the structured woody character of cedarwood. The fragrance settles into a rich base where creamy sandalwood and vanilla are grounded by the earthy depth of patchouli. A lingering trail of warm amber and musk provides a refined finish, leaving a lasting, distinguished woody impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:30:27.627Z"}}'::json),
  (5403, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.731707+00:00', 'Al Absar Shahoor Intense Eau De Parfum, Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/23b927b72421e9003e0aa0cff71ad5d56e1e2e5a9b0f9b329742c6bb8f176c56.png', 'Al Absar Shahoor Intense Eau De Parfum, Unisex, 100 Ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 10.84, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/2KJk8d2xEtPVSMkkU9YYXd.jpg","gtin":"5055810045036","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:31:27.894493+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/23b927b72421e9003e0aa0cff71ad5d56e1e2e5a9b0f9b329742c6bb8f176c56.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:34:29.037458+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:31:33.806695+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:31:33.806695+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"31f35c82c9af4686aec9459ccbc091f2","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Яблоко"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Apple"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:31.404Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Al Absar Shahoor Intense — это выразительная восточная композиция, построенная на гармоничном контрасте между искристой цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким, согревающим древесно-пряным шлейфом. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и лимона, дополненным хрустящим яблоком и деликатной остротой розового перца и кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает пышный букет из розы и жасмина, чья цветочная мягкость подчеркнута травянистыми нюансами герани и пряным теплом корицы и мускатного ореха. Такое сочетание придает аромату особую глубину и текстурную многогранность. Завершается композиция торжественным древесным аккордом уда и сандала, который плавно переходит в чувственную базу из амбры, мускуса, ванили и пачули. Этот сложный шлейф создает стойкое ощущение уюта и благородной элегантности.","descriptionEn":"Al Absar Shahoor Intense is a sophisticated oriental fragrance defined by the interplay between sparkling citrus brightness and a profound, warming woody-spicy depth. The scent opens with a vibrant fusion of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the crisp sweetness of apple and the subtle, piquant nuance of pink pepper and cardamom. As the fragrance evolves, a rich floral heart of rose and jasmine emerges, balanced by the herbaceous character of geranium and the enveloping warmth of cinnamon and nutmeg. This complex core provides the scent with a velvety texture and a compelling sense of transition. The dry-down reveals a majestic foundation of oud and sandalwood, softened by the lingering sweetness of vanilla and the earthy resonance of patchouli. Touches of amber and musk round out the composition, leaving a lasting, refined trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:30:36.187Z"}}'::json),
