hy undertones of patchouli, leaving a lingering, enveloping trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:30:46.930Z"}}'::json),
