1-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"936231","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Зелёные Ноты","Персик"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Ландыш","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Сандал","Амбра","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Green Notes","Peach"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Lily of the Valley","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Sandalwood","Amber","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:03.563Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Twin Flower от Al Haramain — это изысканная цветочная композиция, построенная на контрасте искристой фруктовой свежести и мягкого, обволакивающего шлейфа. Аромат открывается бодрящим сочетанием цитрусовых нот бергамота и лимона, дополненных сочностью персика и естественной прохладой зеленых аккордов. В сердце композиции расцветает нежный цветочный букет, где классическая роза и жасмин переплетаются с изящными нюансами ландыша и фрезии. Это цветочное созвучие придает аромату особую утонченность и глубину, плавно переходя к чувственному финалу. Базовые ноты раскрываются теплым слиянием сандалового дерева и амбры, смягченных сладостью ванили. Завершающий аккорд мускуса оставляет на коже деликатный, бархатистый след, подчеркивающий чистоту и гармоничность этого масляного парфюма.","descriptionEn":"Twin Flower by Al Haramain is a refined floral composition defined by the contrast between sparkling fruity freshness and a soft, enveloping trail. The fragrance opens with an invigorating blend of bergamot and lemon, balanced by the succulent sweetness of peach and the crisp, natural clarity of green notes. At the heart, a delicate floral bouquet emerges, where the classic elegance of rose and jasmine intertwines with the airy nuances of lily of the valley and freesia. This harmonious floral core imparts a sophisticated depth that gradually transitions into a sensuous dry down. The base settles into a warm fusion of sandalwood and amber, sweetened by a touch of vanilla. A final note of musk leaves a subtle, velvety impression on the skin, enhancing the clean and balanced character of this alcohol-free perfume oil.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:37:14.623Z"}}'::json),
  (5512, '2026-11-02T10:59:24.997288+00:00', 'Al Haramain Najm Gold Perfumed Oil Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/7c1c2831253556ef5166fda46c7d6afe65277551a3bfef8143e8b53c2103adbd.png', 'Al Haramain Najm Gold Perfumed Oil Unisex 18ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 31.59, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/TNs3dfaXRoJhCcZ2bfeiMb.jpg","gtin":"6291106812794","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:03:41.907984+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/7c1c2831253556ef5166fda46c7d6afe65277551a3bfef8143e8b53c2103adbd.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:47:36.167402+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:03:49.984011+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:03:49.984011+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"variantFid":"V2P96Q","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Шафран"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Мускатный Орех","Корица"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Saffron"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Nutmeg","Cinnamon"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:50.002Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Al Haramain Najm Gold — это изысканная восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте искристой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого, обволакивающего тепла. Аромат раскрывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота и лимона, подчеркнутым пряными искрами розового перца, шафрана и кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает пышный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, чья цветочная мягкость деликатно приправлена теплыми нотами мускатного ореха и корицы. Это сочетание придает аромату характерную глубину и пряную многогранность. Шлейф аромата выстраивается вокруг насыщенной базы, объединяющей дымные аккорды уда, землистые оттенки пачули и кремовую мягкость сандала. Сладость ванили, смолистость амбры и чувственность мускуса завершают композицию, оставляя на коже долгое и благородное послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Al Haramain Najm Gold is a sophisticated oriental fragrance defined by the contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and deep, enveloping warmth. The composition opens with an energetic blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by the spicy vibrance of pink pepper, saffron, and cardamom. At the heart, a lush bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, its floral softness delicately enhanced by the warming presence of nutmeg and cinnamon. This interplay adds a distinct richness and a nuanced spicy character to the core of the scent. The fragrance concludes with a substantial base that balances the smoky depth of oud and the earthy complexity of patchouli with the creamy smoothness of sandalwood. Subtle touches of sweet vanilla, resinous amber, and sensual musk anchor the composition, leaving a lingering, noble trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:34:15.822Z"}}'::json),
  (5538, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.149382+00:00', 'Al Absar Passionnova Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/b9129412fc3fac03e174a8f7ffce4dcf3eacda094b8a22d4e2e1ce18d7ac7e23.png', 'Al Absar Passionnova Eau De Parfum 100 Ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Haramain.', 'Al Haramain', 13.72, '{"gtin":"5055810060336","gender":"Унисекс","volume":"100 мл EDP","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","category":"Восточные","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/kNzHVf4RYXPnqb5aLc8pr3.jpg","longevity":"10–14 часов","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Амбра","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:08:55.735718+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/b9129412fc3fac03e174a8f7ffce4dcf3eacda094b8a22d4e2e1ce18d7ac7e23.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:47:49.639103+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T15:46:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T15:46:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:09:06.177317+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:09:06.177317+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z"}},"minOrderQuantity":4,"unit":4,"variantFid":"edc75e4f8f6d44f7a7a9340d9bbeaa6d","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лимон","Зелёное Яблоко"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon","Green Apple"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Cedar","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:45:56.137Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Absar Passionnova от Al Haramain — это восточная композиция, построенная на интригующем контрасте между искристой фруктовой свежестью и плотной, согревающей пряностью. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим сочетанием бергамота, лимона и зеленого яблока, дополненным пикантными акцентами розового перца и кардамона. В сердце аромата расцветает классический цветочный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, который обретает глубину благодаря теплым нотам корицы и мускатного ореха. Это сочетание придает композиции пряный, но при этом утонченный характер. Завершается звучание аромата мягким, обволакивающим шлейфом. Сочетание амбры, ванили и сандала создает сливочную сладость, а кедр, пачули и мускус добавляют древесную стойкость и чувственную завершенность.","descriptionEn":"Al Absar Passionnova by Al Haramain is an oriental fragrance defined by the interplay between sparkling fruit-forward freshness and a deep, warming spice core. The scent opens with a vibrant blend of bergamot, lemon, and crisp green apple, energized by the sharp, aromatic bite of pink pepper and cardamom. As it evolves, the heart reveals a velvety floral arrangement of rose, jasmine, and geranium, intricately layered with the dry heat of cinnamon and nutmeg. This transition bridges the initial brightness with a more complex, textured middle phase. The fragrance settles into a rich, lingering base where the sweetness of vanilla and amber meets the creamy warmth of sandalwood. Earthy undertones of patchouli, cedar, and musk provide a grounded finish, leaving a sophisticated and lasting trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:35:41.822Z"}}'::json),
