dAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:06.027449+00:00"}},"variantFid":"3beeebdc80884c7297da2f382a49fdd3","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Роза","Лимон","Бергамот","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Фиалка"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Rose","Lemon","Bergamot","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Violet"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:27.255Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Rose · Lemon · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Bab Al Wardi от Ard Al Zaafaran — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой классическая розово-цветочная женственность встречается с бодрящей искрой цитрусовых и пряностей. Аромат раскрывается динамичным сочетанием бергамота, лимона и розового перца, создавая яркое вступление, смягченное нежным дыханием лепестков розы. Сердце парфюма представляет собой пышный флоральный букет, где доминирующая роза гармонично дополняется жасмином, геранью и пудровыми акцентами фиалки. Постепенно композиция переходит в глубокий, обволакивающий шлейф из теплой амбры, сандалового дерева и ванили, оставляя на коже мягкое мускусное послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Bab Al Wardi by Ard Al Zaafaran is a refined oriental composition where classic floral femininity meets the invigorating spark of citrus and spice. The fragrance opens with a dynamic blend of bergamot, lemon, and pink pepper, creating a bright introduction softened by the gentle breath of rose petals. The heart reveals a lush floral bouquet, where the dominant rose is harmoniously complemented by jasmine, geranium, and powdery violet accents. The composition gradually transitions into a deep, enveloping trail of warm amber, sandalwood, and vanilla, leaving a soft musky finish on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:15.718Z"}}'::json),
  (5633, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Munchies Choco Truffle Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/92040fc3c0d47ddfa6fd9989c5525de9c9a4f6fa3e0de81b39c39fb890f04504.png', 'Al Wataniah Munchies Choco Truffle Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 16.37, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шоколад · Какао · Молочный Шоколад · Ваниль","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/6j636scoDwCtoXhCVrW4YZ.jpg","gtin":"5055810059415","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:20:49.145897+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/92040fc3c0d47ddfa6fd9989c5525de9c9a4f6fa3e0de81b39c39fb890f04504.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:20.674752+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:21:06.691866+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:21:06.691866+00:00"}},"variantFid":"c1572ceb4dc143cb9a4ee38edbec61bf","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шоколад","Какао","Кофе","Карамель"],"heart":["Молочный Шоколад","Лесной Орех","Ваниль","Боб Тонка"],"base":["Ваниль","Мускус","Амбра","Сандаловое Дерево","Бензоин"]},"en":{"top":["Chocolate","Cocoa","Coffee","Caramel"],"heart":["Milk Chocolate","Hazelnut","Vanilla","Tonka Bean"],"base":["Vanilla","Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Benzoin"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:12.189Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Chocolate · Cocoa · Milk Chocolate · Vanilla","descriptionRu":"Al Wataniah Munchies Choco Truffle — это глубокий восточный аромат, построенный на контрасте интенсивной кофейной горечи и обволакивающей сладости кондитерских аккордов. Композиция раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом шоколада, какао и кофе, дополненным тягучими карамельными полутонами, которые мгновенно создают ощущение тепла. В сердце аромата раскрывается нежная гурманская палитра: молочный шоколад переплетается с ореховыми нюансами фундука, создавая кремовую текстуру, подчеркнутую мягкостью ванили и бобов тонка. Эта сладость плавно переходит в древесно-смолистый шлейф, где сандал и бензоин придают аромату благородную глубину. Финальные аккорды амбры и мускуса закрепляют композицию, оставляя на коже мягкий, чувственный и стойкий след.","descriptionEn":"Al Wataniah Munchies Choco Truffle is a deep Oriental fragrance defined by the contrast between intense coffee bitterness and the enveloping sweetness of decadent confectionery accords. The scent opens with a stimulating fusion of chocolate, cocoa, and coffee, sharpened by rich caramel undertones that provide an immediate sense of warmth. At the heart, the fragrance unfolds into a creamy gourmand profile where milk chocolate blends seamlessly with the nutty nuances of hazelnut, softened by the inclusion of vanilla and tonka bean. This indulgent core transitions into a resinous, woody base, where sandalwood and benzoin lend a sophisticated weight to the composition. A lingering trail of amber and musk rounds out the experience, leaving a velvety, long-lasting impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:39:35.490Z"}}'::json),
  (5655, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Boraq Eau De Parfum - Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/ccb009b62da2875bafa93933c8cae62bf4a79fb2d9eae189716561e841957d44.png', 'Al Wataniah Boraq Eau De Parfum - Unisex - 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 79.19, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Герань · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/QyDdaghGp5pXKLS8cfsCx8.jpg","gtin":"6299088884457","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:51:47.742729+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/ccb009b62da2875bafa93933c8cae62bf4a79fb2d9eae189716561e841957d44.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:38.367807+00:00"},"minOrderQuantity":6,"unit":6,"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:51:56.873132+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:51:56.873132+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"212e17fde38d4b269ff49fdd2fba2494","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Роза"],"base":["Амбра","Ваниль","Боб Тонка","Кедр","Мускус"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Rose"],"base":["Amber","Vanilla","Tonka Bean","Cedarwood","Musk"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:15.044Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Geranium · Amber","descriptionRu":"Boraq от Al Wataniah — это восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте прохладных пряностей и глубокой, обволакивающей сладости. Аромат раскрывается энергичным сочетанием бергамота, розового перца и кардамона, чья острота деликатно сглажена свежим нюансом лаванды. В сердце аромата пряный дуэт корицы и мускатного ореха встречается с цветочными акцентами герани и розы, создавая насыщенный и многогранный центр композиции. Этот переход от динамичных верхов к более густым, цветочным нотам придает аромату особую глубину. Завершается композиция теплым шлейфом, в котором смолистая амбра и мягкая ваниль переплетаются с бобами тонка. Древесные ноты кедра в сочетании с деликатным мускусом обеспечивают стойкий и гармоничный финал, оставляя на коже спокойное, но выразительное ощущение.","descriptionEn":"Al Wataniah’s Boraq is an oriental composition defined by the contrast between crisp, invigorating spices and a deep, enveloping sweetness. The fragrance opens with a vibrant blend of bergamot, pink pepper, and cardamom, their initial sharpness softened by a clean, aromatic touch of lavender. At the heart, a warm pairing of cinnamon and nutmeg meets the velvety floral character of geranium and rose, forming a rich and intricate core. This transition from the lively top notes to a more textured, floral center gives the fragrance its distinctive complexity. The dry down settles into a warm, resonant trail where resinous amber and creamy vanilla are balanced by the nutty sweetness of tonka bean. Woody cedarwood notes, rounded out by a subtle musk, provide a lasting and harmonious finish that leaves a calm, sophisticated impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:40:05.083Z"}}'::json),
  (5702, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Baini Wa Bainak', '/assets/img/generated-products/4f76603cd1388a606042e60ebb3db49baa3a365262a702c4a410c6992e89cc11.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Baini Wa Bainak — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 11.76, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/7989pjoMyRRLgZxFeqLdxi.jpg","gtin":"6423080722749","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:06.523999+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/4f76603cd1388a606042e60ebb3db49baa3a365262a702c4a410c6992e89cc11.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:39.317817+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:12.988233+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:12.988233+00:00"}},"notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Корица"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Дубовый Мох","Боб Тонка","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Cinnamon"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Oakmoss","Tonka Bean","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:21.700Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Baini Wa Bainak — это выразительная восточная композиция, которая строится на неожиданном контрасте яркой цитрусово-фруктовой свежести и глубоких, дымно-древесных полутонов. Верхние ноты открываются бодрящим аккордом бергамота и лимона, дополненным сочным созвучием ананаса, яблока и спелой черной смородины. Постепенно в развитие вступает насыщенное сердце аромата, где классический цветочный дуэт розы и жасмина гармонично сплетается с дымным характером березы, терпкими пачули и пряным теплом корицы. Завершает звучание мягкий и обволакивающий шлейф, сотканный из чувственной амбры, мускуса, сладкой ванили, влажного дубового моха, бобов тонка и благородного кедра, придающих композиции цельность и глубину.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Baini Wa Bainak is an expressive oriental composition built on an striking contrast between vibrant citrus-fruity freshness and deep, smoky-woody undertones. The opening presents an invigorating blend of bergamot and lemon, complemented by a juicy accord of pineapple, apple, and ripe black currant. Gradually, the rich heart unfolds, where a classic floral duet of rose and jasmine intertwines harmoniously with the smoky character of birch, astringent patchouli, and the warm spice of cinnamon. The fragrance concludes with a soft, enveloping trail woven from sensual amber, musk, sweet vanilla, damp oakmoss, tonka bean, and noble cedar, imparting balance and depth to the overall character.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:19.866Z"}}'::json),
  (5741, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/11aa5d7fdb64728f58c0e9165012a2f39a62d9bc4d2080c5485ad4be299bd6c9.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen Eau De Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.65, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Ваниль","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/eWWrswecX5wF3kRDgmXGLN.jpg","gtin":"6266515361805","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.277911+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/11aa5d7fdb64728f58c0e9165012a2f39a62d9bc4d2080c5485ad4be299bd6c9.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:39.079809+00:00"},"minOrderQuantity":12,"unit":12,"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:35.579159+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:35.579159+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"1WKX4K","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Флёрдоранж"],"base":["Ваниль","Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Orange Blossom"],"base":["Vanilla","Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:22.575Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Vanilla","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen — это изысканная восточная композиция, построенная на тонком балансе яркой фруктово-цитрусовой свежести и глубокого, бархатистого шлейфа. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом искристого мандарина и бергамота, оттененным сочной сладостью личи и пикантной пряностью розового перца. Постепенно в силу вступает роскошное цветочное «сердце», в котором классическая элегантность розы и жасмина гармонично переплетается с воздушной легкостью пиона и нежным благоуханием флердоранжа. Этот чувственный букет плавно перетекает в теплую и обволакивающую базу. Завершающий аккорд звучит благородными древесными переливами сандала и пачули, смягченными чувственной сладостью ванили, мягким мускусом и глубоким амбровым теплом, оставляющим на коже утонченный и стойкий след.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen is a sophisticated oriental composition built on a delicate balance of vibrant fruit-citrus freshness and a deep, velvety trail. The fragrance opens with an invigorating duet of sparkling mandarin orange and bergamot, contrasted by the juicy sweetness of litchi and the subtle spice of pink pepper. Gradually, the opulent floral heart emerges, where the classic elegance of rose and jasmine harmonizes with the airy lightness of peony and the delicate aroma of orange blossom. This sensual bouquet smoothly transitions into a warm and enveloping base. The final chord unites the noble woody nuances of sandalwood and patchouli, softened by the sensual sweetness of vanilla, gentle musk, and deep amber warmth, leaving a refined and lasting impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:30.774Z"}}'::json),
  (5631, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Munchies Lemon Souffle Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/14e518e96f65f5c63800b441bcd9a29f744ff328c3c8899d4d2f415a7c85d4ba.png', 'Al Wataniah Munchies Lemon Souffle Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 16.37, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Лимон · Бергамот · Лимонный Суфле · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/9VuTynNbWTBgw26FKgMahg.jpg","gtin":"5055810059422","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:20:28.658568+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/14e518e96f65f5c63800b441bcd9a29f744ff328c3c8899d4d2f415a7c85d4ba.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:19.565212+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:20:35.724216+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:20:35.724216+00:00"}},"variantFid":"9afd08a759c04c628fb605474869c059","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Лимон","Бергамот","Мандарин","Сахар","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Лимонный Суфле","Флёрдоранж","Жасмин","Ваниль","Миндаль"],"base":["Мускус","Бобы Тонка","Белый Мускус","Амбра","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Lemon","Bergamot","Mandarin Orange","Sugar","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Lemon Souffle","Orange Blossom","Jasmine","Vanilla","Almond"],"base":["Musk","Tonka Bean","White Musk","Amber","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:11.279Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Lemon · Bergamot · Lemon Souffle · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Wataniah Munchies Lemon Souffle — это яркая восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте искрящейся цитрусовой свежести и гурманской сладости. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом лимона, бергамота и мандарина, приправленным щепоткой розового перца и сахарным акцентом, что создает ощущение утренней легкости. В сердце композиции расцветает изысканный десертный аккорд лимонного суфле, дополненный нежными цветочными оттенками жасмина и апельсинового цвета. Сливочные нюансы миндаля и мягкая ваниль придают аромату глубину, плавно переходя в теплое, обволакивающее основание. Финальный шлейф соткан из благородных нот кедра, амбры и бобов тонка. Дуэт белого и классического мускуса завершает звучание, оставляя на коже мягкий, притягательный и устойчивый след.","descriptionEn":"Al Wataniah Munchies Lemon Souffle is a vibrant oriental composition defined by the contrast between sparkling citrus freshness and indulgent gourmand sweetness. The fragrance opens with an invigorating blend of lemon, bergamot, and mandarin orange, brightened by a dash of pink pepper and a touch of sugar for a crisp, luminous introduction. As the scent evolves, the heart reveals a sophisticated lemon souffle accord, elegantly balanced by the floral grace of orange blossom and jasmine. Notes of almond and vanilla add a creamy, velvety texture to the center, grounding the brightness of the opening in a rich, comforting warmth. The dry down settles into a base of cedar, amber, and tonka bean, providing a steady foundation for the fragrance. A delicate combination of white musk and musk lingers on the skin, leaving a soft, persistent, and refined trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:39:29.772Z"}}'::json),
  (5648, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Amnia Eau De Parfum, Unisex', '/assets/img/generated-products/05ce20a4f19f9c6b9091a1bed08e745fec315dcc7b0d60702ab72f2a1cbcb525.png', 'Al Wataniah Amnia Eau De Parfum, Unisex, 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 10.69, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/EmLjb4RtzRDtojTFZ38Q7w.jpg","gtin":"5055810030452","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:22:14.372496+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/05ce20a4f19f9c6b9091a1bed08e745fec315dcc7b0d60702ab72f2a1cbcb525.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:23.325845+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:22:22.962352+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:22:22.962352+00:00"}},"variantFid":"eb153583ef6d4180890bcab0054589cf","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Шафран","Герань"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Saffron","Geranium"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:13.323Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Wataniah Amnia — это изысканный восточный аромат, в котором искристая цитрусовая свежесть гармонично сочетается с теплым пряным характером и бархатистой глубиной. Композиция открывается бодрящими верхними нотами лимона и бергамота, дополненными пикантной пряностью розового перца и кардамона, задающими динамичный и яркий тон. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат обретает благородное цветочной звучание: классическая роза и изящный жасмин переплетаются с терпкими нюансами герани и драгоценной пряностью шафрана, создавая богатый и многогранный сердечный аккорд. Завершает композицию обвокакивающий шлейф, построенный на гармонии глубокой амбры, чувственного мускуса, благородного сандала и кедра, смягченных сладковатыми нюансами ванили. Этот теплый древесно-амбровый финальный аккорд оставляет на коже элегантное и стойкое послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Al Wataniah Amnia is a sophisticated Oriental fragrance where sparkling citrus freshness gracefully contrasts with a warm, spicy character and velvety depth. The composition opens with invigorating top notes of lemon and bergamot, accented by the sharp, lively spice of pink pepper and cardamom to set a vibrant initial impression. As the fragrance evolves, it develops a refined floral heart where classic rose and delicate jasmine entwine with the herbal astringency of geranium and the precious warmth of saffron, creating a rich and multifaceted core. The fragrance settles into a lingering base built on the harmonious depth of amber, sensual musk, noble sandalwood, and cedar, softened by the rich sweetness of vanilla. This warm woody-ambry finish leaves an elegant and lasting trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:39:53.733Z"}}'::json),
  (5671, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Anfas Dhai Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/d51ce55c0c0d1f5f596ac591976a3e9203b80831f297af5fe2f3a8d440c4b998.png', 'Anfas Dhai Parfum 75ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Anfas.', 'Anfas', 294.33, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/RNpEcdAcXA3RzTzVfaG2wi.jpg","gtin":"8055773549319","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:25:02.102618+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/d51ce55c0c0d1f5f596ac591976a3e9203b80831f297af5fe2f3a8d440c4b998.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:31.855128+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:25:08.112404+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:25:08.112404+00:00"}},"variantFid":"108f64eef21e44a5990132c88ba02ed3","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лимон","Зелёные Ноты"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Ирис","Герань","Шафран"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon","Green Notes"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Orris","Geranium","Saffron"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:17.890Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Anfas Dhai — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой искристая цитрусовая свежесть встречается с глубоким, бархатистым звучанием драгоценных смол и пряностей. Это аромат-контраст, гармонично сочетающий прохладу зелени с обволакивающим теплом древесного шлейфа. Верхние ноты раскрываются бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и лимона, подчеркнутым пикантной остротой розового перца и кардамона, чью терпкость смягчают легкие зеленые акценты. Постепенно аромат обретает цветочную глубину: нежная роза и жасмин переплетаются с пудровым оттенком корня ириса и травянистой свежестью герани, приправленной благородной пряностью шафрана. В базе парфюм раскрывается многогранным шлейфом, где насыщенный уд соединяется с мягкостью сандалового дерева и сладкой ванилью. Амбра, мускус и пачули придают композиции завершенность, создавая стойкий, чувственный и глубокий след на коже.","descriptionEn":"Anfas Dhai is a sophisticated oriental composition where sparkling citrus freshness meets the deep, velvety resonance of precious resins and spices. It is a fragrance of contrasts, harmoniously balancing crisp green nuances with the enveloping warmth of a woody trail. The opening reveals an invigorating duo of bergamot and lemon, highlighted by the sharp piquancy of pink pepper and cardamom, softened by light green accents. As it develops, the scent acquires a floral depth: delicate rose and jasmine intertwine with the powdery character of orris and the herbal freshness of geranium, seasoned with the refined spice of saffron. The base unfolds into a multifaceted trail where rich oud merges with the creaminess of sandalwood and the sweetness of vanilla. Amber, musk, and patchouli ground the composition, leaving a lasting, sensual, and profound impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:40:39.364Z"}}'::json),
  (5704, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Sahebat Al Jamal Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/b03f8030f7164d5924441bd972ad0a360eda4f3ce6b190611376df53abb8c503.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Sahebat Al Jamal Eau De Parfum 70ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 10.75, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Шафран · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/nr9Nmwfm9MM8zw5xusLYW5.jpg","gtin":"6295199790595","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:27.925602+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/b03f8030f7164d5924441bd972ad0a360eda4f3ce6b190611376df53abb8c503.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:40.360356+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:35.534042+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:35.534042+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":12,"unit":12,"variantFid":"a1201850b9c5438a9a673ba0fb119791","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Шафран","Розовый Перец","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Флёрдоранж"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Saffron","Pink Pepper","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Orange Blossom"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:22.059Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Saffron · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Sahebat Al Jamal — это утонченная восточная композиция, которая сочетает в себе искристую цитрусовую свежесть и глубокое тепло благородной древесины. Контраст ярких специй и нежного цветочно-амбрового шлейфа придает аромату многогранность и выразительный характер. Аромат раскрывается бодрящим дуэтом лимона и бергамота, дополненным пикантной пряностью розового перца и благородным оттенком шафрана. Начальные ноты плавно переходят в пышное и гармоничное «сердце», где изысканная роза и чувственный жасмин сплетаются с прохладной свежестью герани и утонченной сладостью апельсинового цвета. В завершении формируется плотный и обволакивающий шлейф. Дымный уд, теплая амбра и сливочный сандал соединяются с мягкостью мускуса и сладковатой ванилью, оставляя на коже долгое и элегантное звучание.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Sahebat Al Jamal is a refined oriental composition that pairs sparkling citrus freshness with the deep warmth of noble woods. The contrast of vibrant spices and a soft floral-amber trail gives the fragrance remarkable depth and a distinctive character. The fragrance opens with an invigorating duet of lemon and bergamot, enhanced by the piquant spice of pink pepper and the rich nuance of saffron. These initial notes gradually transition into a lush and balanced heart, where refined rose and sensual jasmine entwine with the cool freshness of geranium and the delicate sweetness of orange blossom. The drydown forms a dense, enveloping trail. Smoky oud, warm amber, and creamy sandalwood unite with soft musk and sweet vanilla, leaving a lasting and elegant presence on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:24.921Z"}}'::json),
  (5651, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Oud Cambodi Eau De Parfum For Men', '/assets/img/generated-products/61cef4a4ba1647dc0887db25f47475f1a386a303889364af14c2a0815ffa7a85.png', 'Al Wataniah Oud Cambodi Eau De Parfum For Men - 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 7.69, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Мужской","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Камбоджийский Уд · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/noihUaNBfr2rh4GPT9JveR.jpg","gtin":"5055810027988","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:22:38.431669+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/61cef4a4ba1647dc0887db25f47475f1a386a303889364af14c2a0815ffa7a85.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:24.488206+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:22:45.376437+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:22:45.376437+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":6,"unit":6,"variantFid":"2ec9621aa3954108b064affc41c50417","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Мускатный Орех","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Камбоджийский Уд","Роза","Жасмин","Кедровая Древесина"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Nutmeg","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Cambodian Oud","Rose","Jasmine","Cedarwood"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:14.040Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Cambodian Oud · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Wataniah Oud Cambodi — это глубокая древесная композиция, в которой пряная острота встречается с драгоценной смолистой мягкостью. Аромат раскрывается динамичным сочетанием бергамота и темпераментного розового перца, приправленного благородным шафраном и мускатным орехом. В сердце композиции доминирует камбоджийский уд, чья характерная плотность смягчается цветочными аккордами розы и жасмина, а кедр придает звучанию четкую структуру. Постепенно аромат переходит в теплый, обволакивающий шлейф, где сливочный сандал и ваниль гармонично переплетаются с землистыми пачули, мускусом и золотистой амброй.","descriptionEn":"Al Wataniah Oud Cambodi is a profound woody composition where spicy vibrancy meets precious resinous softness. The fragrance opens with a dynamic blend of bergamot and spirited pink pepper, seasoned with noble saffron and nutmeg. At the heart, Cambodian oud takes center stage, its characteristic density softened by floral accents of rose and jasmine, while cedarwood imparts a structured foundation. The scent gradually settles into a warm, lingering trail where creamy sandalwood and vanilla harmonize with earthy patchouli, musk, and golden amber.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:39:58.092Z"}}'::json),
  (5669, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Marjaan Unisex Perfume', '/assets/img/generated-products/df482bc0db64cd7a066a22194fdced3ce7ad1bf244cff1f4b52bc94ca3564e42.png', 'Al Wataniah Marjaan Unisex Perfume — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 79.19, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/jP7MHvC2T27XmAjSyv7GiJ.jpg","gtin":"5055810012151","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:24:42.114658+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/df482bc0db64cd7a066a22194fdced3ce7ad1bf244cff1f4b52bc94ca3564e42.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:30.659160+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:24:49.186531+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:24:49.186531+00:00"}},"variantFid":"80Q0DY","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лаванда"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Корица"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lavender"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cinnamon"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:17.064Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Marjaan от Al Wataniah — это глубокая восточная композиция, построенная на контрасте бодрящей пряной свежести и обволакивающего цветочного тепла. Аромат раскрывается энергичным сочетанием цитрусовой горечи бергамота, остроты розового перца и прохладных травянистых акцентов лаванды и кардамона. В сердце композиции расцветает пышный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, чья цветочная мягкость подчеркнута сухим пряным оттенком корицы. Это сочетание создает утонченный переход от яркого начала к более спокойному и глубокому звучанию. Шлейф аромата обретает чувственность благодаря сочетанию сливочного сандала, сладкой ванили и землистых пачули. Теплые амбровые и мускусные ноты завершают композицию, оставляя на коже стойкий, благородный отпечаток.","descriptionEn":"Marjaan by Al Wataniah is a profound Oriental composition defined by the contrast between invigorating spicy freshness and enveloping floral warmth. The fragrance opens with an energetic blend of bitter bergamot, sharp pink pepper, and the cool, herbal nuances of lavender and cardamom. At the heart of the scent, a lush bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, its floral softness deepened by the dry, piquant accent of cinnamon. This transition creates a sophisticated bridge between the vibrant top notes and the emerging complexity of the base. The dry down reveals a sensual character, anchored by creamy sandalwood, sweet vanilla, and earthy patchouli. Rich amber and musk round out the composition, leaving a lingering, noble trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:40:34.990Z"}}'::json),
  (5703, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Fakhar Al Oud Eau de Parfum - Oriental Wood', '/assets/img/generated-products/d61caf271d6193f7f96289a75fe4dafd7042c0a467343be0e907f8a50da0caa2.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Fakhar Al Oud Eau de Parfum 3.4oz (100ml) - Oriental Wood — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 11.75, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/i4uHFBrBCLWC6wfJet6sCy.jpg","gtin":"6295199795071","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:16.657349+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/d61caf271d6193f7f96289a75fe4dafd7042c0a467343be0e907f8a50da0caa2.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:39.874593+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:23.662639+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:23.662639+00:00"}},"variantFid":"92755a42c5cb478782943f963b941c8c","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Шафран","Мускатный Орех"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Кедровая Древесина","Герань"],"base":["Уд","Сандаловое Дерево","Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Saffron","Nutmeg"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cedarwood","Geranium"],"base":["Oud","Sandalwood","Amber","Musk","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:21.492Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Fakhar Al Oud Eau de Parfum — это гармоничный ориентально-древесный аромат, в котором цитрусовая свежесть искусно уравновешена плотным теплом пряностей и смол. Композиция обладает выразительным восточным характером и глубоким, многогранным шлейфом. Аромат открывается бодрящим цитрусовым дуэтом бергамота и лимона, который мгновенно сменяется пряным теплом шафрана и мускатного ореха. Начальные ноты задают интригующий контраст между прохладной свежестью и пряной терпкостью. Постепенно раскрываясь, композиция обретает бархатистое цветодревесное звучание в сердце, сотканное из нот розы, жасмина, герани и благородного кедра. Завершает историю глубокая и обволакивающая база, объединяющая насыщенный аккорд уда, сливочный сандал, теплую амбру, мягкий мускус и сладковатую ваниль.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Fakhar Al Oud Eau de Parfum is a harmonious oriental-woody fragrance where bright citrus freshness is artfully balanced by the dense warmth of spices and resins. The composition possesses a distinct eastern character and a deep, multi-layered trail. The fragrance opens with an invigorating citrus duet of bergamot and lemon, quickly transitioning into the warm spice of saffron and nutmeg. The initial notes establish an intriguing contrast between crisp brightness and spiced pungency. Gradually unfolding, the heart reveals a velvety floral-woody character woven from rose, jasmine, geranium, and cedarwood. The development concludes with a deep, enveloping base uniting rich oud, creamy sandalwood, warm amber, soft musk, and a touch of vanilla.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:22.480Z"}}'::json),
  (5706, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/d6d7ac748630ce37c8de5403dc54ccf0e983adda7f5cd03361578eea653c88ec.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 7.64, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Ваниль","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/4d96q56zgpyuahwTQcpEgU.jpg","gtin":"6295199791189","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:48.453281+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/d6d7ac748630ce37c8de5403dc54ccf0e983adda7f5cd03361578eea653c88ec.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:41.460100+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:57.674186+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:57.674186+00:00"}},"variantFid":"7ba15da2b8674374a12b8f14cf6d6bfb","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Флёрдоранж"],"base":["Ваниль","Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Orange Blossom"],"base":["Vanilla","Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:22.575Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Vanilla","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen — выразительный восточный аромат, в котором искристая цитрусовая свежесть гармонично переплетается с глубоким древесно-амбровым шлейфом. Эта композиция строится на контрасте легких фруктово-пряных акцентов и насыщенного классического звучания。 Верхние ноты открываются бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и мандарина, дополненными сочной сладостью личи и пикантной пряностью розового перца. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат переходит в пышное цветочное сердце, где благородная роза и чувственный жасмин переплетаются с воздушным пионом и нежным апельсиновым цветом. В базе композиция обретает теплоту и глубину благодаря сладкому ванильному аккорду, мягкому мускусу и янтарной амбре. Древесная основа из сандала и пачули завершает звучание, формируя обволакивающий и элегантный шлейф.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran I Am The Queen is an expressive oriental fragrance where sparkling citrus freshness harmoniously intertwines with a deep woody-amber trail. This composition is built on a contrast of light fruity-spicy accents and rich classic character. Top notes open with an invigorating duet of bergamot and mandarin orange, complemented by the juicy sweetness of litchi and the piquant spice of pink pepper. Gradually unfolding, the fragrance transitions into a lush floral heart where noble rose and sensual jasmine entwine with airy peony and delicate orange blossom. In the base, the composition gains warmth and depth through a sweet vanilla accord, soft musk, and warm amber. A woody foundation of sandalwood and patchouli completes the profile, forming an enveloping and elegant trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:29.455Z"}}'::json),
  (5663, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Al Wataniah Musk Collection Candy Musk Body Mist', '/assets/img/generated-products/920a1c199db5811befb458334fa1c67b6d48ce3d87c58b1c756012426cb45d7e.png', 'Al Wataniah Musk Collection Candy Musk Body Mist 250ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Al Wataniah.', 'Al Wataniah', 7.22, '{"category":"Гурманские","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Сахар · Бергамот · Ванильная Орхидея · Ваниль","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/D5usS7KU9euNQpv4guaQj8.jpg","gtin":"5055810099619","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:23:48.187966+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/920a1c199db5811befb458334fa1c67b6d48ce3d87c58b1c756012426cb45d7e.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:27.976868+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:23:58.944739+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:23:58.944739+00:00"}},"variantFid":"fcd8be81dcd9407a93fa202d022553d7","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Сахар","Бергамот","Красные Фрукты","Груша"],"heart":["Ванильная Орхидея","Жасмин","Карамель","Гелиотроп"],"base":["Ваниль","Белый Мускус","Бобы Тонка","Сандал"]},"en":{"top":["Sugar","Bergamot","Red Fruits","Pear"],"heart":["Vanilla Orchid","Jasmine","Caramel","Heliotrope"],"base":["Vanilla","White Musk","Tonka Bean","Sandalwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:16.119Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Sugar · Bergamot · Vanilla Orchid · Vanilla","descriptionRu":"Candy Musk — это игривое гурманское облако, в котором искристая фруктовая свежесть встречается с обволакивающей сладостью. Аромат балансирует на грани яркого десертного лакомства и нежной пудровой элегантности. Композиция открывается бодрящими нотами бергамота в сочетании с сочной грушей, красными фруктами и отчетливым сахарным аккордом. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат переходит в цветочно-карамельное сердце, где ванильная орхидея и жасмин переплетаются с мягкими оттенками гелиотропа. Завершает звучание теплый, сливочный шлейф. Сочетание ванили, бобов тонка и сандалового дерева придает аромату глубину, а белый мускус оставляет на коже чистое, бархатистое послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Candy Musk is a playful gourmand mist where sparkling fruit freshness meets an enveloping, sugar-spun sweetness. The fragrance strikes a delicate balance between vibrant confectionery notes and a soft, powdery elegance. The scent opens with a bright burst of bergamot, balanced by the succulent crispness of pear, red fruits, and a distinct sugary accord. As it settles, the heart reveals a floral-caramel core, where the exotic sweetness of vanilla orchid and jasmine blends seamlessly with the almond-like nuances of heliotrope. The experience concludes with a warm, creamy foundation. A rich base of vanilla, tonka bean, and sandalwood provides lasting depth, while white musk leaves a clean, velvety trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:40:25.589Z"}}'::json),
  (5701, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Hareem Al Sultan', '/assets/img/generated-products/25cacff93274606ea37375ee2b4eec1d6f267c7c58f8681f6db2e350ef221508.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Hareem Al Sultan — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 10.71, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шафран · Роза · Уд · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/HUfearfgeNXQscXWRkKBfP.jpg","gtin":"6235621586150","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:27:55.965647+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/25cacff93274606ea37375ee2b4eec1d6f267c7c58f8681f6db2e350ef221508.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:38.755092+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:02.644013+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:02.644013+00:00"}},"variantFid":"Z6NN95","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Роза","Бергамот","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Уд","Роза","Жасмин","Пачули","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Ладанник"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Rose","Bergamot","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Oud","Rose","Jasmine","Patchouli","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Labdanum"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:21.139Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Rose · Oud · Amber","descriptionRu":"Восточный аромат Hareem Al Sultan от Ard Al Zaafaran раскрывает богатую палитру пряных и древесных оттенков, где благородная терпкость гармонично сочетается с мягкой сладостью. Композиция построена на выразительном контрасте ярких искристых акцентов и глубокой бархатистой базы. Вступительный аккорд встречает ярким сочетанием цитрусовой свежести бергамота, пряной прохлады розового перца и утонченной сухости шафрана, дополненных первыми нюансами розы. Постепенно раскрываясь, композиция обретает сложный древесный характер: дымные акценты уда и сухой кедр сплетаются с глубоким звучанием пачули, а классический дуэт розы и жасмина придает сердцу аромата насыщенный цветочный объем. Завершающий шлейф формирует теплое, обволакивающее послевкусие. Смолистые переливы лабданума и амбры соединяются с кремовой мягкостью сандала, сладковатой ванилью и чистым мускусом, оставляя на коже глубокий и гармоничный след.","descriptionEn":"The oriental fragrance Hareem Al Sultan by Ard Al Zaafaran explores a rich palette of spicy and woody nuances, balancing noble dryness with soft sweetness. The composition is built on an expressive contrast between vibrant sparkling accents and a deep, velvety base. The opening introduces a bright combination of citrus bergamot freshness, spicy pink pepper, and refined dry saffron, accented by the first nuances of rose. As it evolves, the fragrance develops a complex woody character: smoky oud and dry cedar intertwine with deep patchouli, while the classic rose and jasmine pairing adds a rich floral body to the heart. The final trail forms a warm, enveloping drydown. Resinous labdanum and amber merge with the creamy softness of sandalwood, sweet vanilla, and clean musk, leaving a deep and harmonious trace on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:17.574Z"}}'::json),
  (5712, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Caramel Oud Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/04f53f1c712d8fee39e3a7ac63ce96146ca5afd46569781b5a26e468739ff3c7.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Caramel Oud Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 7.94, '{"category":"Гурманские","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Карамель · Бергамот · Уд · Ваниль","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/eS4ZvVWzmCvxsCwq4Hzz5K.jpg","gtin":"6295199790496","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:29:35.491948+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/04f53f1c712d8fee39e3a7ac63ce96146ca5afd46569781b5a26e468739ff3c7.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:43.863541+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:29:43.371539+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:29:43.371539+00:00"}},"variantFid":"45b3400bd3344b01b4d3088cf944ddf3","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Карамель","Бергамот","Шафран","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Уд","Роза","Жасмин","Корица"],"base":["Ваниль","Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Боб Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Caramel","Bergamot","Saffron","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Oud","Rose","Jasmine","Cinnamon"],"base":["Vanilla","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:23.528Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Caramel · Bergamot · Oud · Vanilla","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Caramel Oud — это изысканное сочетание гурманской сладости и восточной глубины, где сливочная мягкость встречается с дымным благородством уда. Аромат раскрывается ярким контрастом: искристый бергамот и пряный шафран с розовым перцем создают динамичное вступление, которое плавно перетекает в обволакивающую сладость карамели. В сердце композиции расцветает классический цветочный дуэт розы и жасмина, обогащенный пряным теплом корицы и характерным древесным аккордом уда. Это сочетание придает аромату особую многогранность, уравновешивая насыщенные пряные ноты нежной цветочной элегантностью. База парфюма строится вокруг теплого, обволакивающего шлейфа из ванили, сандала и бобов тонка. Янтарные оттенки амбры и мягкий мускус завершают композицию, оставляя после себя долгое, глубокое послевкусие с выраженным ориентальным характером.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Caramel Oud is a sophisticated fusion of gourmand sweetness and oriental depth, where creamy indulgence meets the smoky nobility of oud. The fragrance opens with a dynamic contrast: sparkling bergamot and the spicy allure of saffron and pink pepper create an energetic entrance that leads directly into the luscious, enveloping sweetness of caramel. At its heart, a classic floral duo of rose and jasmine flourishes, enriched by the piquant warmth of cinnamon and the profound woody signature of oud. This interplay gives the fragrance a distinct complexity, balancing intense spicy facets with soft, velvety floral elegance. The base settles into a warm, lingering trail defined by vanilla, sandalwood, and tonka bean. Notes of amber and smooth musk round out the composition, leaving a deep, resonant finish that carries a distinctly luxurious oriental character.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:38.988Z"}}'::json),
  (5727, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Intense Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/22bb7c296e4b7833bd881c2d8e3f1b9afe03ab54465c985a9fd19e90b40723ea.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Intense Eau De Parfum 70ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.14, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/jmKFE9kzjvAAVbBpEonw4Q.jpg","gtin":"6295199795644","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:32:10.733782+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/22bb7c296e4b7833bd881c2d8e3f1b9afe03ab54465c985a9fd19e90b40723ea.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:51.557834+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:32:19.696901+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:32:19.696901+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":12,"unit":12,"variantFid":"b83b09ea9315460aafed53415c49cdd7","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Чёрный Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Герань"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Black Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Geranium"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:26.624Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Intense — выразительный восточный аромат, в котором цитрусовая искра встречается с пряным теплом и глубокой древесной основательностью. Эта композиция выстраивает сложный контраст между бодрящим началом и многогранной бархатистой базой. Первые секунды раскрываются ярким цитрусовым дуэтом бергамота и лимона, дополненным сочным акцентом ананаса и бодрящей остротой черного перца с кардамоном. Постепенно этот бодрящий старт перетекает в богатое цветочно-пряное сердце, где классическая элегантность розы и жасмина переплетается с согревающими нотами корицы, мускатного ореха и свежестью герани. Завершает звучание плотный и обволакивающий шлейф. Древесная глубина уда и сандала соединяется с мягкостью амбры, мускуса и ванили, а землистый аккорд пачули придает композиции завершенность и стойкий восточный характер.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Intense is a striking oriental fragrance where vibrant citrus freshness meets warm spice and deep woody foundation. The composition builds a sophisticated contrast between an invigorating opening and a rich, velvety drydown. The initial impression unfolds with a bright citrus duo of bergamot and lemon, enhanced by the juicy presence of pineapple and the sharp, lively bite of black pepper and cardamom. This energetic introduction gradually gives way to a complex floral and spicy heart, where classic rose and jasmine blend with the comforting warmth of cinnamon, nutmeg, and aromatic geranium. The fragrance settles into a dense and enveloping trail. The deep woodiness of oud and sandalwood merges with the warmth of amber, musk, and vanilla, while an earthy touch of patchouli grounds the composition with a lasting oriental character.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:07.084Z"}}'::json),
  (5673, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.413266+00:00', 'Anfas Anfas Watan Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/66d8962dba6763a7af8f581f085d7629d56cd051691d9629ce5680b2b2f090c7.png', 'Anfas Anfas Watan Eau De Parfum Spray 75ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Anfas.', 'Anfas', 193.27, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/BHQR5oBLUhp6PUvgbk6Rsd.jpg","gtin":"8055773549289","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:25:11.740573+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/66d8962dba6763a7af8f581f085d7629d56cd051691d9629ce5680b2b2f090c7.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:32.485904+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:25:30.339457+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:25:30.339457+00:00"}},"variantFid":"43df600c3a5a407dbb5ddb5e7d2a82ba","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Кардамон","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Мускатный Орех"],"base":["Уд","Сандаловое Дерево","Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Cardamom","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Nutmeg"],"base":["Oud","Sandalwood","Amber","Musk","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:18.244Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Anfas Watan — это восточный аромат, построенный на тонком контрасте между искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью и глубоким, согревающим древесным шлейфом. Композиция открывается энергичным всплеском лимона и бергамота, которые смягчаются пряным теплом кардамона и розового перца. В сердце аромата расцветает элегантный букет из розы, жасмина и герани, чья цветочная мягкость деликатно подчеркнута сухим пряным акцентом мускатного ореха. Это сочетание придает композиции утонченную глубину и гармоничный баланс между остротой и цветочной нежностью. База аромата раскрывается вкрадчивым теплом уда и сандалового дерева, создавая обволакивающий эффект. Финальные аккорды амбры, мускуса и ванили оставляют на коже мягкий, притягательный и стойкий след, завершая образ спокойной и уверенной элегантностью.","descriptionEn":"Anfas Watan is an Oriental fragrance defined by the interplay between sparkling citrus brightness and a profound, warming woody foundation. The scent opens with a vibrant burst of lemon and bergamot, immediately tempered by the aromatic warmth of cardamom and the subtle piquancy of pink pepper. At the heart, a sophisticated floral bouquet of rose, jasmine, and geranium unfolds, its velvety texture enriched by the dry, spicy nuance of nutmeg. This transition bridges the initial freshness with the fragrance’s deeper, more complex layers. The base settles into a rich resinous embrace of oud and sandalwood, providing a solid grounding. Notes of amber, musk, and vanilla linger in the dry down, leaving a soft, lingering trail that balances traditional depth with a refined, contemporary presence.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:40:41.719Z"}}'::json),
  (5700, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Thara Al Oud Perfume', '/assets/img/generated-products/c0f75c787d85baf0e29f71a8b196147479307b619bad1964d4bcf23278edd428.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Thara Al Oud Perfume — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 12.62, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/gKfx8TYv3iWeAD7nK7ztMw.jpg","gtin":"6435074242867","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:27:46.038713+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/c0f75c787d85baf0e29f71a8b196147479307b619bad1964d4bcf23278edd428.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:38.228399+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:27:52.874526+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:27:52.874526+00:00"}},"notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Мускатный Орех","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Кедр","Герань"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Nutmeg","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cedar","Geranium"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:21.064Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Thara Al Oud от Ard Al Zaafaran — это богатая древесная композиция, в которой пряная глубина восточных специй гармонично переплетается с искрящейся цитрусовой свежестью. Аромат выстраивает изысканный контраст между теплой бальзамической таинственностью и классической цветочной элегантностью. Вступление раскрывается бодрящим цитрусовым дуэтом лимона и бергамота, мгновенно окутанным пряной дымкой шафрана и мускатного ореха. Начальные аккорды задают уверенный и насыщенный тон всему звучанию. Постепенно раскрываясь, композиция обретает бархатистый цветочный характер: изящная роза и медовый жасмин сплетаются с терпковатой геранью и благородными древесными переливами кедра. Этот союз смягчает первоначальную пряность и добавляет глубины. Шлейф аромата соткан из глубоких и обволакивающих нот уда, амбры и чувственного мускуса, смягченных сливочной мягкостью сандала и сладковатым теплом ванили. Финал оставляет долговечный, обволакивающий древесный след.","descriptionEn":"Thara Al Oud by Ard Al Zaafaran is a rich woody composition where the spicy depth of oriental spices harmoniously intertwines with sparkling citrus freshness. The fragrance builds a refined contrast between warm balsamic mystery and classic floral elegance. The opening unfolds with an invigorating citrus duet of lemon and bergamot, instantly enveloped in the spicy haze of saffron and nutmeg. These initial accords set a confident and saturated tone for the entire development. Gradually unfolding, the fragrance acquires a velvety floral character: exquisite rose and honeyed jasmine intertwine with tart geranium and noble cedarwood nuances. This union softens the initial spice and adds structural depth. Base notes are woven from deep and enveloping facets of oud, amber, and sensual musk, softened by the creamy smoothness of sandalwood and the sweet warmth of vanilla. The drydown leaves a lasting, enveloping woody trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:10.405Z"}}'::json),
  (5728, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/74820525efba104d91fa5408579d1ad9128a3c4c0a12283ddbb5617ca86997ee.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Eau De Parfum 70ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 11.36, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/hy6hwkt2zYuhvBUcJDUvAE.jpg","gtin":"6291108736111","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:32:23.288172+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/74820525efba104d91fa5408579d1ad9128a3c4c0a12283ddbb5617ca86997ee.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:52.096435+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:32:30.801310+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:32:30.801310+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":6,"unit":6,"variantFid":"WPQ4QD","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Корица"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Дубовый Мох","Бобовая Стружка","Кожа"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Cinnamon"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Oakmoss","Tonka Bean","Leather"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:27.160Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Eau De Parfum — это яркая восточная композиция, построенная на выразительном контрасте искрящейся фруктовой свежести и глубоких, благородных древесно-кожаных аккордов. Аромат открывается бодрящим и сочным сочетанием цитрусов и спелых садовых фруктов, задающим динамичный тон с первых минут звучания. Постепенно раскрываясь на коже, композиция обретает изысканный объем благодаря пышному цветочному дуэту розы и жасмина, искусно подчеркнутому дымными нюансами березы, землистыми переливами пачули и теплой пряностью корицы. В финале аромат оставляет обволакивающий, сложный шлейф, в котором гармонично сплетаются смолистая амбра, чувственный мускус, сладковатая ваниль, влажный дубовый мох, бобы тонка и благородная кожа.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Saheb Eau De Parfum is a striking oriental composition built on an expressive contrast between sparkling fruity freshness and deep, noble woody-leather accords. The fragrance opens with an invigorating and juicy blend of citrus and ripe orchard fruits that sets a dynamic tone from the very first moments. Gradually unfolding on the skin, the composition gains refined depth through a lush floral duet of rose and jasmine, skillfully accentuated by smoky nuances of birch, earthy patchouli facets, and warm cinnamon spice. In the drydown, the fragrance leaves an enveloping, complex trail where resinous amber, sensual musk, sweet vanilla, damp oakmoss, tonka bean, and fine leather harmoniously intertwine.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:09.467Z"}}'::json),
  (5734, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Al Dirgham Special Edition Eau De Parfum For Men', '/assets/img/generated-products/84e3a7b45c0920b0dd224312638ed31b9fe529be565c78d6df046b7d344f9e32.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Al Dirgham Special Edition Eau De Parfum For Men - 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.74, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Мужской","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/RaxdLSEhTVnJCAmm8ZGxkt.jpg","gtin":"6423080733158","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:20.758947+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/84e3a7b45c0920b0dd224312638ed31b9fe529be565c78d6df046b7d344f9e32.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:54.235925+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:27.301170+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:27.301170+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":6,"unit":6,"variantFid":"66b4695f880049a8b8c9f7a59bf5fddc","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Чёрный Перец","Яблоко"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Жасмин"],"base":["Амбра","Ваниль","Мускус","Кедр","Пачули","Бобы Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Black Pepper","Apple"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Jasmine"],"base":["Amber","Vanilla","Musk","Cedarwood","Patchouli","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:28.564Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Al Dirgham Special Edition — это яркий восточный аромат, в котором энергичная цитрусово-фруктовая свежесть динамично контрастирует с глубокой пряной и древесной основой. Композиция открывается бодрящим сочетанием бергамота, лимона, сочного ананаса и яблока, подчеркнутым пикантной остротой черного перца. По мере раскрытия аромат обретает более сложный и теплый характер: в сердце аромата звучит гармоничный дуэт прохладной лаванды и элегантной герани, окруженный пряными оттенками корицы, мускатного ореха и деликатными нюансами жасмина. Завершает звучание обволакивающий шлейф, сотканный из нот амбры, ванили, мускуса, благородного кедра, пачули и бобов тонка, которые придают композиции глубину и стойкое тепло.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Al Dirgham Special Edition is a vibrant Oriental fragrance where an energetic citrus and fruit freshness dynamically contrasts with a deep spicy and woody foundation. The composition opens with an invigorating blend of bergamot, lemon, juicy pineapple, and apple, accented by the sharp piquancy of black pepper. As the fragrance evolves, it develops a more complex and warm character: the heart features a harmonious duet of cool lavender and elegant geranium, surrounded by the spicy warmth of cinnamon, nutmeg, and delicate hints of jasmine. The development concludes with a rich, enveloping trail woven from amber, vanilla, musk, noble cedarwood, patchouli, and tonka bean, leaving a grounded and lasting warmth on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:20.395Z"}}'::json),
  (5694, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Oud Romancea Eau de Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/30f1e74223a21bcbe253d0812dec838a47cdce945dd5af218839caf1916fb26d.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Oud Romancea Eau de Parfum Spray 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.71, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Мужской","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Шафран · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/8u36P3QPCeZD64z9pKvE73.jpg","gtin":"6295199790489","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:26:45.223668+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/30f1e74223a21bcbe253d0812dec838a47cdce945dd5af218839caf1916fb26d.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:35.525808+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:26:53.145869+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:26:53.145869+00:00"}},"variantFid":"22c3d4f4b6df4160aff35f25af460bb9","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Шафран","Розовый Перец","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Герань","Кедр"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Saffron","Pink Pepper","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Geranium","Cedar"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:19.535Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Saffron · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Oud Romancea — это выразительный древесный аромат, в котором яркая цитрусовая свежесть переплетается с обволакивающей теплотой пряностей и глубоким восточным характером. Изысканный контраст бодрящих аккордов и насыщенной древесной базы задает композиции особое звучание. Верхние ноты открываются ярким всплеском лимона и бергамота, дополненным пряным теплом шафрана и розового перца. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат переходит в насыщенное «сердце», где классический дуэт розы и жасмина гармонично сочетается с травянистой терпкостью герани и благородными древесными нюансами кедра. В завершении формируется мягкий, но глубокий шлейф, построенный на гармонии уда, амбры, мускуса, сандала и сладковатой ванили. Этот комплексный базовый аккорд придает композиции завершенность и бархатистую стойкость.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Oud Romancea is an expressive woody fragrance where vibrant citrus freshness intertwines with the enveloping warmth of spices and a deep oriental character. This sophisticated contrast between sparkling invigorating accords and a rich woody base defines the scent''s distinctive presence. The opening introduces a bright burst of lemon and bergamot, complemented by the spiced warmth of saffron and pink pepper. As the composition unfolds, it transitions into a rich heart where a classic duet of rose and jasmine blends harmoniously with the herbal astringency of geranium and the noble woody nuances of cedar. The fragrance settles into a smooth yet deep trail built on the harmony of oud, amber, musk, sandalwood, and sweet vanilla. This complex base accord provides the composition with a lingering and velvety finish.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:40:58.223Z"}}'::json),
