tUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:31:33.093043+00:00"}},"variantFid":"346411337443414fb7e91793d39ee399","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Чёрный Перец"],"heart":["Жасмин","Роза","Кардамон","Корица"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Black Pepper"],"heart":["Jasmine","Rose","Cardamom","Cinnamon"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:25.568Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Jasmine · Amber","descriptionRu":"Jazzab от Ard Al Zaafaran — это яркий восточный аромат, в котором энергичная цитрусовая свежесть гармонично сочетается с выразительным пряным теплом. Контраст бодрящих фруктовых аккордов и глубокой древесной базы придает композиции объем и динамику. Вступление раскрывается искристыми цитрусовыми оттенками бергамота и лимона, дополненными сочным соком ананаса и бодрящим акцентом черного перца. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат обретает бархатистое цветочное звучание в сердце, сотканное из нот жасмина и розы, которое деликатно оттеняется пряным теплом кардамона и корицы. Завершает композицию обвокакивающий шлейф, построенный на гармонии янтарной теплоты, мягкого мускуса и сливочного сандала. Сладковатая ваниль в сочетании с глубокими пачулями придают базовым нотам выразительную стойкость и завершенность.","descriptionEn":"Jazzab by Ard Al Zaafaran is a vibrant oriental fragrance where energetic citrus freshness meets pronounced spicy warmth. This compelling contrast between invigorating fruit accords and a deep woody foundation gives the composition remarkable dimension and dynamism. The opening unfolds with sparkling citrus nuances of bergamot and lemon, complemented by juicy pineapple and a lively pinch of black pepper. As the composition evolves, it reveals a velvety floral heart woven from jasmine and rose, gracefully accented by the warm, aromatic character of cardamom and cinnamon. The fragrance settles into a lingering trail built on a rich foundation of warm amber, soft musk, and creamy sandalwood. Subtle touches of vanilla intertwined with earthy patchouli impart a profound depth and a lasting, harmonious finish to the base.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:42:05.454Z"}}'::json),
  (5738, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Dar Al Hae Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/0acb84d3f91bf20b0a29496c4c2ed6fb4a5b32e521398f20cd4a0f1b1ff73146.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Dar Al Hae Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.14, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Уд · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/bdjUqbyK2TNAhhvqgepdDW.jpg","gtin":"6290362343301","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:41.242745+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/0acb84d3f91bf20b0a29496c4c2ed6fb4a5b32e521398f20cd4a0f1b1ff73146.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:55.297955+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:49.633608+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:49.633608+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":12,"unit":12,"variantFid":"b1d56d358bbc4306be8b5d4d255f21a9","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Роза","Мускатный Орех"],"heart":["Уд","Роза","Пачули","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Кожа"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Rose","Nutmeg"],"heart":["Oud","Rose","Patchouli","Cedarwood"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Leather"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:28.436Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Oud · Amber","descriptionRu":"Dar Al Hae от Ard Al Zaafaran — это выразительная восточная композиция, построенная на утонченном балансе прохладных цитрусовых нюансов и глубоких смолистых аккордов. Аромат раскрывается ярким контрастом искрящейся бергамотовой свежести, терпкого шафрана, пряного мускатного ореха и нежных лепестков розы. Постепенно на первый план выходит плотное и многогранное сердце аромата. Дымное звучание уда гармонично переплетается с древесным теплом кедра, бархатистой пачулевой зеленью и благородным розовым оттенком, придавая композиции текстурность и глубину. Завершающий шлейф окутывает мягким теплом амбры, чувственного мускуса, сливочного сандала и сладковатой ванили, подчёркнутых благородной кожей. Этот насыщенный шлейф оставляет обволакивающее и гармоничное послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Dar Al Hae by Ard Al Zaafaran is an expressive oriental composition built on a refined balance of cool citrus nuances and deep resinous accords. The fragrance opens with a striking contrast of sparkling bergamot freshness, tart saffron, spicy nutmeg, and delicate rose petals. Gradually, the dense and multifaceted heart of the fragrance comes to the fore. The smoky resonance of oud harmoniously intertwines with the woody warmth of cedar, velvety patchouli green facets, and a noble rose nuance, giving the composition texture and depth. The final trail envelops with the soft warmth of amber, sensual musk, creamy sandalwood, and sweetish vanilla, underscored by a distinguished leather note. This rich trail leaves a lingering, harmonious presence.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:25.009Z"}}'::json),
  (5705, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.547405+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Saher Al Layali Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/20530559943e60063194f69bb1226966df89ad7383cfc75a30d2f8599eff94e8.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Saher Al Layali Eau De Parfum 100 Ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 8.51, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/CV5c6YwcXKqF5ZAW6ZdMDx.jpg","gtin":"6438585524729","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:38.842925+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/20530559943e60063194f69bb1226966df89ad7383cfc75a30d2f8599eff94e8.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:40.931283+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:45.402437+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:28:45.402437+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":12,"unit":12,"variantFid":"c46a77c3653f498a97e694677c585a76","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Корень Ириса","Пачули","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Сандаловое Дерево","Боб Тонка","Дубовый Мох"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Orris Root","Patchouli","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Sandalwood","Tonka Bean","Oakmoss"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:22.440Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Saher Al Layali от Ard Al Zaafaran — это восточная композиция, которая искусно сочетает бодрящую фруктово-цитрусовую свежесть с бархатистой древесно-амбровой глубиной. Аромат открывается ярким и сочным сплетением бергамота, лимона, ананаса, яблока и спелой черной смородины, создающим динамичное и свежее вступление. Постепенно раскрываясь на коже, сердце аромата демонстрирует благородный и многогранный характер. Здесь классический дуэт розы и жасмина гармонично переплетается с пудровыми нюансами корня ириса, сухой элегантностью кедра и глубоким древесным теплом пачули, придавая композиции утонченную текстуру. Завершает звучание богатая и обволакивающая база, сотканная из нот амбры, мускуса, ванили, сандалового дерева, бобов тонка и дубового мха. Этот стойкий шлейф оставляет теплое, чувственное и гармоничное послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Saher Al Layali by Ard Al Zaafaran is an Oriental fragrance that skillfully balances an invigorating fruit-citrus freshness with a velvety woody-amber depth. The scent opens with a vibrant and juicy intertwining of bergamot, lemon, pineapple, apple, and ripe black currant, creating a dynamic and crisp introduction. Gradually developing on the skin, the heart of the fragrance reveals a refined and multifaceted character. Here, the classic duo of rose and jasmine blends harmoniously with the powdery nuances of orris root, the dry elegance of cedar, and the deep woody warmth of patchouli, lending the composition a sophisticated texture. The fragrance culminates in a rich and enveloping base woven from amber, musk, vanilla, sandalwood, tonka bean, and oakmoss. This lingering trail leaves a warm, sensuous, and balanced finish.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:41:27.131Z"}}'::json),
