:39:12.422145+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:39:12.422145+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":3,"unit":3,"variantFid":"2edef64e93a34b52981ae9ec44607f70","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Корица"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Сандаловое Дерево","Кожа"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Cinnamon"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Sandalwood","Leather"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:35.102Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Hayaati Oud от Ard Al Zaafaran — это выразительный древесный аромат, в котором энергичная свежесть цитрусов и фруктов контрастирует с глубокой смолистой основой. Верхушка композиции открывается искристыми цитрусовыми искрами бергамота и лимона, дополненными сочной сладостью ананаса, яблока и терпкой черной смородины. По мере раскрытия фруктовый старт сменяется сложным сердцем, где элегантный дуэт розы и жасмина сплетается с дымными оттенками березы, пряной корицей и землистыми нюансами пачули. В базе аромат обретает плотное звучание благодаря благородному уду, теплой амбре, мягкому мускусу и сладковатой ванили, которые гармонично завершаются сливочным сандалом и благородным аккордом кожи.","descriptionEn":"Hayaati Oud by Ard Al Zaafaran is an expressive woody fragrance where energetic citrus and fruit freshness contrasts with a deep, resinous foundation. The opening presents a sparkling crispness of bergamot and lemon, complemented by the juicy sweetness of pineapple, apple, and tart black currant. As the fragrance develops, the fruity opening transitions into a complex heart where an elegant floral pairing of rose and jasmine intertwines with smoky birch nuances, spicy cinnamon, and earthy patchouli. The base achieves a rich, textured depth through precious oud, warm amber, soft musk, and sweet vanilla, beautifully anchored by creamy sandalwood and a refined leather accord.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:48:08.932Z"}}'::json),
  (5730, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Cotton Candy Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/c19d73a3aa6ac295d2b42fed352e564d4f489f8bc25753a419a5d6c95d7397a2.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Cotton Candy Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 7.05, '{"category":"Гурманские","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Сахар · Малина · Сахарная Вата · Ваниль","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/TqeAAX58TLVojNHUCGCthc.jpg","gtin":"6295199795736","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:20.664741+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/c19d73a3aa6ac295d2b42fed352e564d4f489f8bc25753a419a5d6c95d7397a2.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:38.904459+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:26.398996+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:26.398996+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"5cbb417f524145a5b8e1f631fdf22622","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Сахар","Малина","Бергамот","Вишня"],"heart":["Сахарная Вата","Ванильная Орхидея","Жасмин","Гелиотроп"],"base":["Ваниль","Мускус","Боб Тонка","Карамель","Сандал"]},"en":{"top":["Sugar","Raspberry","Bergamot","Cherry"],"heart":["Cotton Candy","Vanilla Orchid","Jasmine","Heliotrope"],"base":["Vanilla","Musk","Tonka Bean","Caramel","Sandalwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:27.055Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Sugar · Raspberry · Cotton Candy · Vanilla","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Cotton Candy — это изысканная гурманская композиция, в которой сочная фруктовая сладость изящно уравновешена легкой цитрусовой свежестью. Аромат раскрывается бодрящими искрами бергамота, которые мгновенно смягчаются сочными оттенками спелой вишни, малины и сиропной сладости сахара. Постепенно в развитие вступает воздушное сердце композиции: невесомые ноты сахарной ваты сплетаются с чувственной ванильной орхидеей, утонченным жасмином и пудровым гелиотропом, создавая нежное облако. В шлейфе доминирует богатая база, объединяющая теплую ваниль, сливочную карамель, бобы тонка и мягкий мускус, подчеркнутые благородной древесной глубиной сандала.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Cotton Candy is a refined gourmand composition where lush fruity sweetness is delicately balanced by a bright citrus freshness. The fragrance opens with an invigorating burst of bergamot, instantly softened by the mouthwatering juiciness of ripe cherry, raspberry, and sugary facets. As the development unfolds, an airy heart emerges: weightless cotton candy notes entwine with sensual vanilla orchid, delicate jasmine, and powdery heliotrope to create a soft, enveloping aura. The drydown reveals a rich base uniting warm vanilla, creamy caramel, tonka bean, and gentle musk, grounded by the smooth, deep character of sandalwood.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:14.049Z"}}'::json),
  (5744, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Al Sayaad For Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/35e26da557cc2fc48ebe57f1fb0ac2be58dc1b156229903f2c9c1e297c713012.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Al Sayaad For Women — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.17, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/VTQG668SvHCFisGPhh5fU5.jpg","gtin":"6423080615362","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:34:36.870850+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/35e26da557cc2fc48ebe57f1fb0ac2be58dc1b156229903f2c9c1e297c713012.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:57.295604+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:34:44.061933+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:34:44.061933+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":6,"unit":6,"variantFid":"VP66Z0","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Амбра","Сандаловое Дерево","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Amber","Sandalwood","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:29.751Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Al Sayaad For Women от Ard Al Zaafaran — это утонченная восточная композиция, которая раскрывается ярким контрастом цитрусовой свежести, терпких ягодных нюансов и мягкой пряности. Аромат балансирует между воздушной легкостью и глубоким, обволакивающим характером. Верхние ноты встречают бодрящим дуэтом бергамота и мандарина, дополненными сочным акцентом личи и пикантной искристостью розового перца. Постепенно раскрываясь, композиция обретает изысканный цветочный характер в сердце, где сплетаются бархатистая роза, чувственный жасмин, нежный пион и хрупкая фрезия, создавая гармоничный и элегантный букет. Завершает звучание богатая и теплая база, в которой переплетаются мягкий мускус, сладковатая ваниль, смолистая амбра, сливочный сандал и благородный кедр. Шлейф оставляет уютный, обволакивающий и продолжительный след на коже.","descriptionEn":"Al Sayaad For Women by Ard Al Zaafaran is an exquisite oriental composition that unfolds through a striking contrast of sparkling freshness, juicy fruit nuances, and a delicate spicy edge. The fragrance bridges airy delicacy with a warm, enveloping depth. Opening with an invigorating blend of bergamot and mandarin orange, the initial impression is heightened by the juicy character of litchi and the subtle spice of pink pepper. As the scent develops, it transitions into a refined floral heart featuring velvety rose, sensual jasmine, lush peony, and delicate freesia, forming a balanced and elegant bouquet. The fragrance settles into a rich and enduring base where soft musk, sweet vanilla, warm amber, creamy sandalwood, and noble cedar intertwine. The resulting trail leaves a comforting, lasting signature on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:38.035Z"}}'::json),
  (5761, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Hayaati Exotic Eau de Parfum for Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/0e055675a88abc3d2cba5a5e828a22678eba5524ce37da7562694a559ca0924f.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Hayaati Exotic Eau de Parfum for Women 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 11.23, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Ананас · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/9k8Cc8ryVoA9aNkqKaKBFY.jpg","gtin":"6295199796085","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:36:12.859127+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/0e055675a88abc3d2cba5a5e828a22678eba5524ce37da7562694a559ca0924f.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:49:01.871219+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:36:18.604888+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:36:18.604888+00:00"}},"variantFid":"6f4762fc50ff41a2a94dd5572756288a","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Ананас","Чёрная Смородина","Яблоко","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Ирис"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Ваниль","Дубовый Мох","Боб Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pineapple","Black Currant","Apple","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Orris"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Vanilla","Oakmoss","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:31.668Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pineapple · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Hayaati Exotic от Ard Al Zaafaran — это яркий восточный аромат, в котором энергичная фруктовая свежесть встречается с глубоким, землистым характером классических древесных и цветочных нот. Композиция открывается искристым коктейлем из бергамота, лимона и яблока, дополненным сочной сладостью ананаса и черной смородины. В сердце аромата раскрывается элегантный букет из розы и жасмина, чья нежность уравновешена строгими акцентами березы, пачули и пудрового корня ириса. Такое сочетание придает композиции изысканную текстуру и глубину. Шлейф окутывает теплым союзом амбры, ванили и бобов тонка, в то время как мускус и дубовый мох создают стойкую, благородную базу, завершающую этот многогранный восточный образ.","descriptionEn":"Hayaati Exotic by Ard Al Zaafaran is a vibrant oriental fragrance that contrasts energetic fruity brightness with the deep, earthy sophistication of classic floral and woody accords. The scent opens with a sparkling citrus blend of bergamot and lemon, sharpened by crisp apple and the lush, tropical sweetness of pineapple and black currant. As the fragrance evolves, the heart reveals an elegant floral core of rose and jasmine, which is balanced by the smoky nuance of birch, the grounded presence of patchouli, and the soft, powdery texture of orris. This olfactory journey settles into a warm, lingering base where the richness of amber, vanilla, and tonka bean meets the enduring, earthy character of oakmoss and clean musk, leaving a refined and memorable trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:47:13.593Z"}}'::json),
  (5774, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Jazzab Gold Eau De Parfum For Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/1c5e2319b763cd0479e660e1f393dd829656af99870163262b7cb6a4ba7a2b35.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Jazzab Gold Eau De Parfum For Women - 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 13.63, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/SpJXQbEFXhYUfRFt89JAdL.jpg","gtin":"6295199792049","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:38:12.214152+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/1c5e2319b763cd0479e660e1f393dd829656af99870163262b7cb6a4ba7a2b35.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:49:07.476080+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:38:17.604020+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:38:17.604020+00:00"}},"variantFid":"1666e983d12f49b19e5805fbea2561d7","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Амбра","Сандаловое Дерево","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Amber","Sandalwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:33.692Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Jazzab Gold от Ard Al Zaafaran — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой яркая искристая свежесть цитрусов и фруктов контрастирует с бархатистым, обволакивающим шлейфом. Аромат раскрывается бодрящими аккордами мандарина и бергамота, дополненными пикантной пряностью розового перца и сочной сладостью личи. Постепенно в силу вступает богатое сердце аромата, где распускается классический дуэт розы и жасмина, окруженный воздушной свежестью пиона и фрезии. Цветочный букет звучит объемно и выразительно, плавно переходя к более глубоким и чувственным интонациям. Завершающий аккорд формирует устойчивую и теплую базу, сотканную из мягкого мускуса, сладкой ванили, драгоценной амбры, сливочного сандала и землистых нюансов пачули. Этот многогранный шлейф оставляет на коже благородное и гармоничное звучание.","descriptionEn":"Jazzab Gold by Ard Al Zaafaran is an exquisite oriental composition where bright, sparkling citrus and fruit freshness contrasts with a velvety, enveloping trail. The fragrance opens with invigorating accords of mandarin orange and bergamot, complemented by the piquant spice of pink pepper and the juicy sweetness of litchi. Gradually, the rich heart of the fragrance unfolds, featuring a classic duo of rose and jasmine surrounded by the airy freshness of peony and freesia. This floral bouquet sounds voluminous and expressive, smoothly transitioning into deeper and more sensual tones. The final chord forms a lasting and warm base woven from soft musk, sweet vanilla, precious amber, creamy sandalwood, and earthy patchouli nuances. This multifaceted trail leaves a noble and harmonious impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:47:51.049Z"}}'::json),
  (5732, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Ithra Dubai Musk Pomegranate Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/ebcb695e1d57770d128c206373df844e75177a766920310a84da5c9adfc56cfe.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Ithra Dubai Musk Pomegranate Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 12.52, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Гранат · Бергамот · Мускус · Белый Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/9udzNdHYiSxRiDD34dXonM.jpg","gtin":"6432452224477","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:09.347714+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/ebcb695e1d57770d128c206373df844e75177a766920310a84da5c9adfc56cfe.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:53.647021+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:17.740264+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:17.740264+00:00"}},"variantFid":"99b0fe76781a44f3b026b96fda12561b","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Гранат","Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Красные Фрукты"],"heart":["Мускус","Роза","Жасмин","Пион"],"base":["Белый Мускус","Амбра","Сандаловое Дерево","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Pomegranate","Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Red Fruits"],"heart":["Musk","Rose","Jasmine","Peony"],"base":["White Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:27.847Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Pomegranate · Bergamot · Musk · White Musk","descriptionRu":"Изящный восточный аромат Ithra Dubai Musk Pomegranate от Ard Al Zaafaran построен на гармоничном контрасте терпковатой ягодной свежести и обволакивающей мускусной мягкости. Композиция раскрывается ярким и динамичным коктейлем из сочного граната, искристого бергамота, пикантного розового перца и спелых красных фруктов, создающим бодрящее и выразительное вступление. Постепенно звучание смягчается, уступая место изысканному «сердцу», где чистый мускус переплетается с элегантной розой, утонченным жасмином и нежным пионом. Завершает композицию теплый и глубокий шлейф из благородного белого мускуса, драгоценной амбры, бархатистого сандала и сладковатой ванили.","descriptionEn":"The elegant oriental fragrance Ithra Dubai Musk Pomegranate by Ard Al Zaafaran is built on a harmonious contrast between tart berry freshness and enveloping musky softness. The composition opens with a vibrant and dynamic cocktail of juicy pomegranate, sparkling bergamot, zesty pink pepper, and ripe red fruits, creating an invigorating and expressive introduction. Gradually, the scent softens to reveal an exquisite heart where clean musk intertwines with elegant rose, refined jasmine, and delicate peony. A warm and deep drydown of noble white musk, precious amber, velvety sandalwood, and sweet vanilla completes the composition.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:18.039Z"}}'::json),
  (5750, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Shams Al Emarat Khususi Red Oud Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/5ba6303a8cc678526a7e056d3ce89cc88028441c2487614be602741c9c824937.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Shams Al Emarat Khususi Red Oud Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 9.15, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Шафран · Роза · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/29WZEDx4VGroDvt2m2aJCz.jpg","gtin":"6295199793831","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:35:09.589971+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/5ba6303a8cc678526a7e056d3ce89cc88028441c2487614be602741c9c824937.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:58.537654+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:35:16.569209+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:35:16.569209+00:00"}},"variantFid":"acb21dd65b104fd39f3a252184c7aa47","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Шафран","Мускатный Орех","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Уд","Кедр","Жасмин"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Saffron","Nutmeg","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Oud","Cedar","Jasmine"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:30.217Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Saffron · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Shams Al Emarat Khususi Red Oud от Ard Al Zaafaran — это выразительный древесный аромат, построенный на гармоничном контрасте яркой цитрусовой свежести и глубокого восточного тепла. Композиция открывается бодрящими искрами лимона и бергамота, мгновенно смягченными благородной пряностью шафрана и мускатного ореха. В сердце аромата раскрывается классический дуэт бархатистой розы и чувственного жасмина, обрамленный плотным, выразительным звучанием уда и сухого кедра. Постепенно цветочные и древесные аккорды растворяются в мягком и обволакивающем шлейфе. Базовая часть композиции составлена из сливочного сандала, сладковатой ванили и землистых пачулей, согретых глубокими нотами амбры и мускуса. Этот шлейф создает долгоиграющее и комфортное послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Shams Al Emarat Khususi Red Oud by Ard Al Zaafaran is an expressive woody fragrance built on a harmonious contrast between vibrant citrus freshness and deep oriental warmth. The composition opens with invigorating sparks of lemon and bergamot, instantly softened by the noble spice of saffron and nutmeg. The heart of the fragrance reveals a classic duet of velvety rose and sensual jasmine, framed by the dense, expressive character of oud and dry cedar. Gradually, the floral and woody accords dissolve into a soft and enveloping trail. The base is composed of creamy sandalwood, sweet vanilla, and earthy patchouli, warmed by deep notes of amber and musk. This foundation creates a long-lasting and comforting drydown.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:49.848Z"}}'::json),
  (5790, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.824604+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Oud Mood Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/ff3a700b642749492dacb9b757012f95ed14ca7ea9aecdc9622c5eb0203b0ce6.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Oud Mood Eau De Parfum Spray 50ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 2.92, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шафран · Мускатный Орех · Уд · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/nMrEGTCrB6CnWNqdfDdcFT.jpg","gtin":"6290362342939","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:59.479167+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/ff3a700b642749492dacb9b757012f95ed14ca7ea9aecdc9622c5eb0203b0ce6.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:39.659198+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:53:04.693469+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:53:04.693469+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"79803c86d00a4c1da03283edea2ba3ee","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Мускатный Орех","Лаванда"],"heart":["Уд","Роза","Кедр"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Nutmeg","Lavender"],"heart":["Oud","Rose","Cedar"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:36.600Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Nutmeg · Oud · Amber","descriptionRu":"Oud Mood представляет собой изысканную древесную композицию, в которой насыщенность драгоценных смол уравновешена утонченным пряно-цветочным контрастом. Аромат открывается интригующим сочетанием сухих специй и едва уловимой травянистой свежести. Начальный аккорд звучит характерным теплом шафрана и мускатного ореха, смягченным лавандой, которая придает старту чистоту и легкость. По мере раскрытия в сердце проявляется классический восточный дуэт глубокого уда и бархатистой розы, структурированный сухим, основательным звучанием кедра. Финальный шлейф окутывает мягким теплом золотистой амбры и мускуса в сочетании со сливочными оттенками сандала. Деликатная ваниль в базе смягчает древесный характер композиции, обеспечивая мягкое и гармоничное завершение.","descriptionEn":"Oud Mood is a sophisticated woody composition that balances the intensity of precious resins with a refined spicy-floral contrast. The fragrance opens with an intriguing blend where the dryness of spices meets a subtle herbal clarity. The scent begins with the distinctive warmth of saffron and nutmeg, softened by a touch of lavender that provides a clean, airy introduction. As it evolves, the heart reveals a classic oriental duo of deep oud and velvety rose, structured by the dry, grounding presence of cedarwood. The dry-down settles into a smooth, lingering trail where golden amber and soft musk meet the creaminess of sandalwood. A final hint of vanilla rounds out the woody base, adding a gentle sweetness that balances the overall depth of the composition.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3-flash-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:48:34.296Z"}}'::json),
  (5804, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.824604+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Dirham Oud', '/assets/img/generated-products/137f8423d1cb38bbd5fe3c84a8dbb11c45759ec20325124b1e8ef4b615999b57.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Dirham Oud — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 8.49, '{"category":"Древесные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шафран · Бергамот · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/Pe7xShY2vhkCSiJaZ5qhRn.jpg","gtin":"6423080608432","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:54:47.276868+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/137f8423d1cb38bbd5fe3c84a8dbb11c45759ec20325124b1e8ef4b615999b57.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:41.615983+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:54:54.060036+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:54:54.060036+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Бергамот","Мускатный Орех","Лимон"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Кедр","Корица"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Сандал","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Bergamot","Nutmeg","Lemon"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cedar","Cinnamon"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Sandalwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:39.619Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Bergamot · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Dirham Oud от Ard Al Zaafaran — это выразительный древесный аромат, в котором благородная глубина удовой древесины встречается с яркой пряной свежестью. Его характер строится на гармоничном контрасте прохладных цитрусовых акцентов и обволакивающих восточных специй. Композиция открывается бодрящим цитрусовым дуэтом лимона и бергамота, мгновенно дополненным теплым, пряным звучанием шафрана и мускатного ореха. С первых минут аромат заявляет о своем насыщенном восточном темпераменте. По мере раскрытия в сердце аромата распускается классический цветочный дуэт розы и жасмина, окруженный сухими древесными тонами кедра и сладковато-пряной корицей. Этот сложный переход подготавливает восприятие к основательному шлейфу. В базе доминирует густой аккорд уда, смягченный бархатистым звучанием амбры, мягкого мускуса, сливочного сандала и землистых пачулей. Финал оставляет на коже устойчивый, глубокий и многогранный древесно-амбровый след.","descriptionEn":"Dirham Oud by Ard Al Zaafaran is an expressive woody fragrance where the noble depth of agarwood meets vibrant, spicy freshness. Its character is built upon a harmonious contrast between crisp citrus accents and enveloping oriental spices. The composition opens with an invigorating citrus duet of lemon and bergamot, instantly complemented by the warm, spicy resonance of saffron and nutmeg. From the very first moments, the fragrance establishes its rich eastern temperament. As the scent develops, the heart reveals a classic floral pairing of rose and jasmine, framed by the dry woodiness of cedar and sweet-spicy cinnamon. This intricate transition prepares the senses for a substantial, grounded drydown. The base is dominated by a rich oud accord, softened by the velvety warmth of amber, smooth musk, creamy sandalwood, and earthy patchouli. The final phase leaves a persistent, deep, and multifaceted woody-amber trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:49:10.658Z"}}'::json),
  (5740, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf Wardi EDP', '/assets/img/generated-products/45cc5bbb89fa76c7624611ba4eb137d995a1937a78c28047b841aaf7e88f8109.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Mousuf Wardi 50ml EDP — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 2.05, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Роза · Бергамот · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/ZC5xrHhfpbjBP3tpCNdkBd.jpg","gtin":"6295199794487","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:33:54.089279+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/45cc5bbb89fa76c7624611ba4eb137d995a1937a78c28047b841aaf7e88f8109.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:48:55.774491+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:34:00.443955+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:34:00.443955+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":6,"unit":6,"variantFid":"26f6c94c4bb04bdc9ff1eabaf32d7806","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Роза","Бергамот","Шафран","Малина"],"heart":["Роза","Герань","Жасмин","Фиалка"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Ваниль","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Rose","Bergamot","Saffron","Raspberry"],"heart":["Rose","Geranium","Jasmine","Violet"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:23.867Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Rose · Bergamot · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Mousuf Wardi от Ard Al Zaafaran — это утонченная восточная композиция, в которой классическая розово-ягодная сладость обретает благородную пряную глубину. Аромат балансирует на грани сочной фруктовой свежести и бархатистой древесно-амбровой теплоты, создавая гармоничное и завораживающее звучание. Вступление раскрывается ярким аккордом спелой малины и благородной розы, подчеркнутым цитрусовой свежестью бергамота и изысканной терпкостью шафрана. По мере развития аромата на первый план выходит богатый цветок из нежного жасмина, пудровой фиалки и освежающей герани, которые органично сплетаются с новыми гранями царственной розы. В шлейфе доминирует чувственная базовая основа из мягкого мускуса и теплыхи янтарных переливов, дополненная сливочным сандалом, сладкой ванилью и глубокими древесно-землистыми оттенками пачули, оставляющими на коже долгое и обволакивающее послевкусие.","descriptionEn":"Mousuf Wardi by Ard Al Zaafaran is a refined Oriental composition where classic rose and berry sweetness meets noble spicy depth. The fragrance balances on the edge of juicy fruity freshness and velvety amber-woody warmth, creating a harmonious and captivating presence. The opening unfolds with a vibrant accord of ripe raspberry and noble rose, accented by the citrus brightness of bergamot and the sophisticated astringency of saffron. As the scent develops, a rich floral heart takes center stage, featuring delicate jasmine, powdery violet, and refreshing geranium that seamlessly intertwine with new facets of the royal rose. The drydown is anchored by a sensual base of soft musk and warm amber nuances, complemented by creamy sandalwood, sweet vanilla, and deep earthy-woody patchouli facets that leave a lingering, enveloping trail on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:46:28.214Z"}}'::json),
  (5775, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.686185+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Ajeeb Perfumed Water for Women', '/assets/img/generated-products/1f112fe5be948b72d3cc33aec22e5f8f1497ad023c1095b61183b42cc09ab609.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Ajeeb Perfumed Water for Women 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 12.01, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Женский","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/RjBRgdNtc4mUQUT2b9V86c.jpg","gtin":"6423080727157","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-09","startedAt":"2026-11-09T18:38:20.721293+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/1f112fe5be948b72d3cc33aec22e5f8f1497ad023c1095b61183b42cc09ab609.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-09T18:49:07.970024+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","partialAvailableAt":"2026-11-09T10:06:19.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:14:26.706661+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:29.067032+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-08T16:07:14.000Z","availableAt":"2026-11-09T16:07:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:38:28.954371+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:38:28.954371+00:00"}},"minOrderQuantity":10,"unit":10,"variantFid":"2b216828844b4dbea7d87e4ef8c4f439","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Личи","Мандарин"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Фрезия"],"base":["Мускус","Ваниль","Амбра","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Litchi","Mandarin Orange"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Freesia"],"base":["Musk","Vanilla","Amber","Cedarwood","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:33.903Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Аромат Ajeeb от Ard Al Zaafaran раскрывает богатство восточного характера через свежее цитрусово-пряное созвучие и глубокую древесно-амбровую базу. Эта композиция выстроена на тонком балансе искристой сочности и благородной бархатистости. Верхние ноты встречают ярким сплетением цитрусовой свежести мандарина и бергамота, оттененных пикантной остротой розового перца и тропической сладостью личи. Постепенно раскрываясь, аромат переходит в богатое цветочное сердце, где пышная роза и классический жасмин переплетаются с нежными лепестками пиона и прохладной фрезией, придавая звучанию многогранность. В завершении формируется теплый шлейф, сотканный из чувственного мускуса, сладкой ванили и драгоценной амбры. Базовые аккорды кедрового дерева и пачули добавляют композиции устойчивый древесный характер.","descriptionEn":"Ajeeb by Ard Al Zaafaran reveals the richness of an oriental profile through a fresh citrus-spicy accord and a deep woody-amber foundation. This composition is built on a delicate balance of sparkling juiciness and noble velvety textures. The opening introduces a bright interplay of mandarin orange and bergamot freshness, contrasted by the piquant bite of pink pepper and tropical litchi sweetness. As it evolves, the fragrance transitions into a lush floral heart where abundant rose and classic jasmine entwine with delicate peony petals and cool freesia, bringing multidimensional depth to the character. The fragrance settles into a warm trail woven from sensual musk, sweet vanilla, and rich amber. Base accords of cedarwood and patchouli anchor the composition with a lingering woody resonance.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:47:53.568Z"}}'::json),
  (5810, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.824604+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Al Ibdaa For Men Eau De Parfum', '/assets/img/generated-products/1653150137ab0944e4c79aeb4a481d72c7a56925a07a8cbc721dd7b7fe9e5ae7.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Al Ibdaa For Men Eau De Parfum 100ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 10.71, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Мужской","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Лимон · Лаванда · Амбра","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/32puCnPXsGRZVAJNecJNeK.jpg","gtin":"6423080616987","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:55:31.367734+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/1653150137ab0944e4c79aeb4a481d72c7a56925a07a8cbc721dd7b7fe9e5ae7.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:42.307937+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:55:37.287163+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:55:37.287163+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"efe789fa0a314d84a108c69a3ff2f8d7","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Чёрный Перец","Кардамон"],"heart":["Лаванда","Герань","Корица","Мускатный Орех","Жасмин"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Кедровая Древесина","Пачули","Боб Тонка"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Black Pepper","Cardamom"],"heart":["Lavender","Geranium","Cinnamon","Nutmeg","Jasmine"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Cedarwood","Patchouli","Tonka Bean"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:41.271Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Lavender · Amber","descriptionRu":"Al Ibdaa For Men — это динамичный восточный аромат, в котором искрящаяся цитрусовая свежесть встречается с глубоким пряным сердцем. Его характер строится на контрасте между бодрящими ароматическими нотами и обволакивающим бальзамическим шлейфом. Композиция открывается энергичным аккордом бергамота и лимона, дополненным экзотической сладостью ананаса. Этот яркий старт обретает глубину благодаря согревающему дуэту черного перца и кардамона, создающему выразительный и текстурный начальный аккорд. В сердце аромата благородная лаванда и жасмин переплетаются с терпкостью герани, формируя классический мужской профиль. Пряные оттенки корицы и мускатного ореха добавляют композиции насыщенности, плавно переводя звучание к базе из амбры, мускуса и ванили. Древесные ноты кедра и пачули в сочетании с бобами тонка оставляют мягкий, но уверенный след, подчеркивающий сложность всей пирамиды.","descriptionEn":"Al Ibdaa For Men is a dynamic oriental fragrance that balances sharp citrus brightness with a deep, spicy core. Its character is defined by the contrast between cooling aromatics and a lingering balsamic warmth. The scent opens with a vibrant burst of bergamot and lemon, softened by the tropical sweetness of pineapple. This initial freshness is immediately grounded by a sharp, invigorating duo of black pepper and cardamom, creating a spirited and textured introduction. As the fragrance evolves, it reveals a sophisticated heart where lavender and jasmine meet the earthy intensity of geranium. A warm, spicy layer of cinnamon and nutmeg weaves through the floral notes, adding complexity before settling into a rich base of amber and musk. Creamy vanilla and tonka bean provide a smooth finish, while the structured woody notes of cedarwood and patchouli ensure a solid, masculine trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3-flash-preview","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:49:26.662Z"}}'::json),
  (5830, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.964325+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Blue Divina', '/assets/img/generated-products/98e102d79a61bf37a50bd81b2f1560f64c4d1d1ee893943c1bc47b35012ca1a9.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Blue Divina — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 8.71, '{"category":"Свежие","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Бергамот · Розовый Перец · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/5WVs5TmRQFCGEMBvTs82V3.jpg","gtin":"6423080619575","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T18:25:34.482223+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/98e102d79a61bf37a50bd81b2f1560f64c4d1d1ee893943c1bc47b35012ca1a9.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T18:32:01.729797+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T18:25:49.468991+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T18:25:49.468991+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"D23LYQ","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Розовый Перец","Лимон","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Пион","Ландыш"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Ваниль","Кедр","Пачули"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Pink Pepper","Lemon","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Peony","Lily of the Valley"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Vanilla","Cedar","Patchouli"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:44.633Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Pink Pepper · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Blue Divina открывается ярким контрастом цитрусовой свежести и легкой пряности, плавно переходящим в утонченное цветочное сердце. Постепенно композиция обретает глубину за счет древесно-амбрового шлейфа с мягким мускусным акцентом. Аромат стартует бодрящими искрами лимона и бергамота, дополненными пикантной остротой розового перца и сочной терпкостью черной смородины. В сердце раскрывается элегантный букет из классической розы, хрупкого жасмина, пудрового пиона и прохладного ландыша, придающий звучанию многогранность. Завершает композицию теплая база, где сладковатая ваниль и смолистая амбра переплетаются с благородным кедром и глубокими пачулями, оставляя на коже сбалансированный и гармоничный след.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Blue Divina opens with a striking contrast of sparkling citrus brightness and gentle spice, gracefully unfolding into a refined floral heart. Gradually, the composition settles into a warm, grounded base defined by rich woods and a soft musky trail. The fragrance begins with invigorating bursts of lemon and bergamot, laced with the lively piquancy of pink pepper and the tart juiciness of black currant. The heart reveals a classic floral bouquet of rose, jasmine, peony, and lily of the valley, adding a smooth, layered texture to the development. The drydown brings together sweet vanilla and warm amber, anchored by the structured depth of cedar and patchouli for a balanced and enduring finish.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:51:07.638Z"}}'::json),
