"notes":{"ru":{"top":["Бергамот","Лимон","Ананас","Яблоко","Чёрная Смородина"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Берёза","Пачули","Корица"],"base":["Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Дубовый Мох","Бобы Тонка","Кедр"]},"en":{"top":["Bergamot","Lemon","Pineapple","Apple","Black Currant"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Birch","Patchouli","Cinnamon"],"base":["Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Oakmoss","Tonka Bean","Cedar"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:46.257Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Bergamot · Lemon · Rose · Amber","descriptionRu":"Sayaad Al Quloob от Ard Al Zaafaran — это яркий восточный аромат, в котором энергичная свежесть цитрусов и фруктов контрастирует с глубокой древесно-пряной основой. Композиция открывается бодрящим аккордом бергамота, лимона, сочного ананаса, хрустящего яблока и терпкой черной смородины, задающими динамичный и яркий тон.","descriptionEn":"Sayaad Al Quloob by Ard Al Zaafaran is a vibrant oriental fragrance where energetic citrus and fruit freshness contrasts with a deep wood-spice foundation. The composition opens with an invigorating chord of bergamot, lemon, juicy pineapple, crisp apple, and tart black currant, setting a dynamic and lively tone.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:51:18.699Z"}}'::json),
  (5814, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.824604+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Rose Paris Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/dadce98d928e029d6abac85ef6e2b6e9942558ef2dff41eca8fc8121f1d610d3.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Rose Paris Eau De Parfum Spray 50ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 1.98, '{"category":"Цветочные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Роза · Бергамот · Роза · Мускус","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/jdirrSGtVd4ifgyx93rCsV.jpg","gtin":"6295199794623","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T17:56:09.353664+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/dadce98d928e029d6abac85ef6e2b6e9942558ef2dff41eca8fc8121f1d610d3.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T17:57:43.029316+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:56:14.507463+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T17:56:14.507463+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"5423e91b4e474a4486bb362449557e65","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Роза","Бергамот","Лимон","Розовый Перец"],"heart":["Роза","Пион","Жасмин","Фиалка"],"base":["Мускус","Амбра","Сандал","Ваниль"]},"en":{"top":["Rose","Bergamot","Lemon","Pink Pepper"],"heart":["Rose","Peony","Jasmine","Violet"],"base":["Musk","Amber","Sandalwood","Vanilla"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:41.322Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Rose · Bergamot · Rose · Musk","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Rose Paris — это утонченная цветочная композиция, в которой классическое звучание розы гармонично соединяется с ярким цитрусовым обрамлением и пикантной пряной свежестью. Аромат раскрывается бодрящими искрами лимона и бергамота, оттененными розовым перцем и бархатистыми лепестками розы. Постепенно в сердце раскрывается пышный букет, где царственная роза сплетается с утонченной нежностью пиона, чувственным жасмином и пудровой фиалкой. Эта цветочная многогранность придает композиции глубину и живую динамику. Завершает звучание обволакивающий шлейф из мягкого мускуса, теплой амбры, сливочного сандала и сладковатой ванили. Базовые ноты оставляют на коже элегантный, гармоничный и продолжительный след.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Rose Paris is a refined floral composition where the classic character of rose is harmoniously blended with a vibrant citrus contrast and a spicy touch. The fragrance opens with invigorating sparkles of lemon and bergamot, accented by pink pepper and velvety rose petals. Gradually, the heart unfolds a lush bouquet where regal rose intertwines with the delicate softness of peony, sensual jasmine, and powdery violet. This floral complexity lends the composition depth and a living dynamic. The fragrance concludes with an enveloping trail of soft musk, warm amber, creamy sandalwood, and sweet vanilla. The base notes leave an elegant, harmonious, and lasting impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:49:47.903Z"}}'::json),
  (5824, '2026-11-02T10:59:25.824604+00:00', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Raghba Eau De Parfum Spray', '/assets/img/generated-products/f0f6fd578453158d426bf7c9a0204355ea4313a9ee2688f88ae3794623d3b226.png', 'Ard Al Zaafaran Raghba Eau De Parfum Spray 50ml — оригинальный премиальный парфюм бренда Ard Al Zaafaran.', 'Ard Al Zaafaran', 16.15, '{"category":"Восточные","gender":"Унисекс","notesSummary":"Шафран · Мускатный Орех · Роза · Уд","longevity":"10–14 часов","sillage":"Заметный, шлейфовый","volume":"100 мл EDP","rawImage":"https://static.prod.qogita.com/files/images/variants/AkkxPSAXEpAPS2qnMMx9Vp.jpg","gtin":"6290362342953","imageGeneration":{"status":"completed","attemptedOn":"2026-11-10","startedAt":"2026-11-10T18:24:17.805982+00:00","model":"@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b","steps":4,"imageUrl":"/assets/img/generated-products/f0f6fd578453158d426bf7c9a0204355ea4313a9ee2688f88ae3794623d3b226.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"completedAt":"2026-11-10T18:32:00.677252+00:00"},"imageGenerationAccountQuotas":{"primary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T16:37:32.502406+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T16:37:32.502406+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-10T18:24:25.283733+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-10T18:24:25.283733+00:00"},"secondary":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.999458+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:40.999458+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:25:38.252920+00:00"},"third":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T17:52:30.784721+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:30.784721+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T17:52:28.602287+00:00"},"fourth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:16:27.645979+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:27.645979+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:16:23.031938+00:00"},"fifth":{"limitedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","availableAt":"2026-11-10T18:40:25.593266+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:25.593266+00:00","lastUsedAt":"2026-11-09T18:40:12.658233+00:00"}},"variantFid":"337bca6b412f44aca6565a806d51cd08","notes":{"ru":{"top":["Шафран","Мускатный Орех","Корица","Бергамот"],"heart":["Роза","Жасмин","Кедр","Пачули"],"base":["Уд","Амбра","Мускус","Ваниль","Сандал"]},"en":{"top":["Saffron","Nutmeg","Cinnamon","Bergamot"],"heart":["Rose","Jasmine","Cedar","Patchouli"],"base":["Oud","Amber","Musk","Vanilla","Sandalwood"]}},"notesVerified":true,"notesSource":"deepseek","notesLookup":{"status":"found","source":"deepseek","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T20:46:42.921Z","model":"deepseek-chat","generated":true},"notesSummaryEn":"Saffron · Nutmeg · Rose · Oud","descriptionRu":"Ard Al Zaafaran Raghba — это роскошный восточный аромат, в котором благородная пряная глубина встречается с бархатистой сладостью древесных оттенков. Композиция раскрывается ярким союзом бодрящего бергамота, терпкого шафрана, мускатного ореха и корицы, задающим насыщенный и согревающий тон с первых секунд. Постепенно на первый план выходит изысканное сердце аромата, где классический цветочный дуэт розы и жасмина гармонично переплетается со строгими древесными полутонами кедра и землистыми нюансами пачули. Этот переход смягчает начальную пряность, придавая звучанию многогранность и благородную элегантность. Завершает композицию глубокий шлейф из дымного уда, чувственной амбры и мускуса, окутанный мягким теплом ванили и сандала. Слаженные базовые ноты оставляют на коже обволакивающий, стойкий и гармоничный древесно-амбровый след.","descriptionEn":"Ard Al Zaafaran Raghba is a rich oriental fragrance where noble spicy depth meets velvety woody sweetness. The composition opens with a striking union of invigorating bergamot, sharp saffron, nutmeg, and cinnamon, setting an intense and warming tone from the very first seconds. Gradually, the refined heart of the fragrance comes to the fore, where a classic floral duet of rose and jasmine harmoniously intertwines with the structured woody undertones of cedar and the earthy nuances of patchouli. This transition softens the initial spice, imparting multifaceted depth and sophisticated elegance to the development. The fragrance concludes with a deep trail of smoky oud, sensual amber, and musk, enveloped by the gentle warmth of vanilla and sandalwood. The cohesive base notes leave an enveloping, harmonious woody-amber impression on the skin.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:50:14.653Z"}}'::json),
