nt geranium, enriched by a warm infusion of cinnamon and nutmeg alongside a delicate touch of jasmine. The base provides a velvety depth through structured cedarwood and earthy patchouli, melting into a rich harmony of vanilla, tonka bean, warm amber, and soft musk that leaves a lasting and distinguished trail.","descriptionSource":"gemini","descriptionsLookup":{"source":"gemini","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T20:52:22.975Z"}}'::json),
